<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.300" end="00:00:04.000" style="s2">This is the first time I&#39;ve seen Landon.</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.200" end="00:00:05.800" style="s2">He&#39;s an inmate locked up at Riverside</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.000" end="00:00:07.700" style="s2">State Prison.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.800" end="00:00:11.500" style="s2">Among all the inmates, his looks and</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.700" end="00:00:11.500" style="s2">build absolutely stand out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.600" end="00:00:20.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon Frost.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.000" end="00:00:29.800" style="s2">Do I need to take my clothes off?</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.000" end="00:00:32.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, get in line. Miss Hart here</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.800" end="00:00:35.300" style="s2">isn&#39;t even married yet.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.700" end="00:00:38.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Raise your arms. Chest 98, waist 82,</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.300" end="00:00:38.300" style="s2">hips 99.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.000" end="00:00:46.600" style="s2">Ellie, that inmate who flirted with you</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.700" end="00:00:48.300" style="s2">today is so handsome and his body is</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.600" end="00:00:50.500" style="s2">amazing. What a waste that he&#39;s not a</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.300" end="00:00:53.400" style="s2">model. Being boy crazy is fine, but</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.500" end="00:00:53.400" style="s2">don&#39;t go losing your head.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.400" end="00:00:58.400" style="s2">He&#39;s a convict. What if he&#39;s a killer?</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.800" end="00:01:00.300" style="s2">Do you want to gamble your life?</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.400" end="00:01:01.800" style="s2">Fine, my life comes first. But the</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.300" end="00:01:03.300" style="s2">director handing you a prison order,</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.800" end="00:01:05.199" style="s2">isn&#39;t that a total waste of your talent,</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.300" end="00:01:06.600" style="s2">just pure spite?</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.199" end="00:01:08.400" style="s2">Prison uniforms, even I could have done</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.600" end="00:01:10.800" style="s2">that. Stop complaining. Come on, let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.400" end="00:01:10.800" style="s2">head back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.600" end="00:01:18.100" style="s2">Ellie, your fiance hooked up with our</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.300" end="00:01:19.600" style="s2">director. No wonder she&#39;s been giving</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.100" end="00:01:20.700" style="s2">you a hard time.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.600" end="00:01:24.600" style="s2">They&#39;re celebrating his birthday at a</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.700" end="00:01:24.600" style="s2">bar tonight. Go catch them in the act.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.200" end="00:01:34.000" style="s2">What are you two doing?</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.900" end="00:01:38.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, since you&#39;ve seen it,</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.400" end="00:01:41.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll be blunt.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.600" end="00:01:43.600" style="s2">You&#39;re barren. I can never marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.800" end="00:01:44.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m barren? Ethan, that&#39;s why you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.600" end="00:01:47.100" style="s2">dumping me?</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.600" end="00:01:49.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, face reality. A hen that can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.100" end="00:01:52.006" style="s2">lay eggs.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.200" end="00:01:54.026" style="s2">No man wants that.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.006" end="00:01:54.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.400" end="00:01:59.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, we&#39;re all here just waiting</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.100" end="00:02:01.092" style="s2">on you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.192" end="00:02:03.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.092" end="00:02:03.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.292" end="00:02:09.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I need to take my clothes off?</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.992" end="00:02:11.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.092" end="00:02:13.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re that little seamstress?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.692" end="00:02:17.551" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been released?</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.192" end="00:02:19.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Crying that hard, dumped by a man.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.551" end="00:02:20.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.192" end="00:02:22.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have a girlfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.992" end="00:02:25.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.692" end="00:02:25.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So how about we get married?</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.992" end="00:02:29.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Louis, dad&#39;s over here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.592" end="00:02:33.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, while you were locked up,</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.692" end="00:02:35.392" style="s2">your brother messed up plenty.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.992" end="00:02:37.292" style="s2">Good thing you&#39;re out, or Frost</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.392" end="00:02:40.192" style="s2">Industries would have sunk in his hands.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.292" end="00:02:41.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Your brother&#39;s absolute scum.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.192" end="00:02:42.692" style="s2">He thought that by putting you behind</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.392" end="00:02:44.992" style="s2">bars, he could swallow everything the</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.692" end="00:02:48.792" style="s2">Frost family has, but a waste is just a</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.992" end="00:02:50.892" style="s2">waste. He can&#39;t make anything work out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.792" end="00:02:52.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brother really is a waste.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.892" end="00:02:55.092" style="s2">But before I deal with him,</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.592" end="00:02:56.092" style="s2">I need to get married first.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.092" end="00:02:57.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.092" end="00:02:59.392" style="s2">Get married? You&#39;ve been in prison this</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.992" end="00:03:01.392" style="s2">whole time as the future Mrs. Frost?</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.392" end="00:03:03.592" style="s2">Wait, is she your cellmate?</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.392" end="00:03:05.192" style="s2">Mr. Frost, don&#39;t act rash. I know you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.592" end="00:03:06.592" style="s2">got a record, but landing some socialite</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.192" end="00:03:08.292" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t take a minute for you. No need</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.592" end="00:03:09.792" style="s2">to find someone in prison.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.292" end="00:03:12.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is someone I met in prison, but</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.792" end="00:03:12.592" style="s2">she&#39;s not a cellmate.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.392" end="00:03:16.292" style="s2">This marriage is happening.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.492" end="00:03:22.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.992" end="00:03:24.992" style="s2">Even if I got dumped, marrying some</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.492" end="00:03:26.692" style="s2">ex-con in a flash?</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.992" end="00:03:29.292" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this just jumping from one fire</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.692" end="00:03:30.292" style="s2">pit into another?</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.292" end="00:03:32.292" style="s2">Um</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.292" end="00:03:34.892" style="s2">I thought it over all night, and being</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.292" end="00:03:36.192" style="s2">single seems pretty good.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.892" end="00:03:38.792" style="s2">How about we call off what we agreed</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.192" end="00:03:38.792" style="s2">last night?</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.192" end="00:03:42.992" style="s2">How about we get married?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.892" end="00:03:44.292" style="s2">I&#39;m Baron, and you&#39;ve been to prison, so</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.992" end="00:03:45.192" style="s2">neither of us have to look down on the</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.292" end="00:03:46.092" style="s2">other.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.192" end="00:03:49.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.092" end="00:03:49.792" style="s2">Tomorrow at 10:00 a.m. registry office.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.192" end="00:03:54.092" style="s2">You scared?</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.592" end="00:03:54.092" style="s2">Too late.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.792" end="00:04:01.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have a place to stay?</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.092" end="00:04:03.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.692" end="00:04:05.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should move in with me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.294" end="00:04:06.894" style="s2">Whatever reason you went to prison, now</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.194" end="00:04:09.294" style="s2">that we&#39;re married, I hope you turn over</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.894" end="00:04:12.094" style="s2">a new leaf and start fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.294" end="00:04:12.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, sure.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.694" end="00:04:18.694" style="s2">My brother just got out of prison and he</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.294" end="00:04:20.494" style="s2">marries some woman.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.694" end="00:04:22.894" style="s2">Is he out of his mind? Here&#39;s his wife&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.494" end="00:04:24.794" style="s2">file.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.894" end="00:04:27.794" style="s2">Plain and simple looking. Never knew my</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.794" end="00:04:29.294" style="s2">brother liked this type.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.794" end="00:04:30.494" style="s2">Lives out in the mountains, parents are</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.294" end="00:04:32.694" style="s2">farmers, and a little brother to</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.494" end="00:04:33.994" style="s2">support. He spent 6 months in prison and</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.694" end="00:04:35.694" style="s2">came out an idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.994" end="00:04:38.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your brother is ruthless and cunning,</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.694" end="00:04:39.294" style="s2">sir. Better not underestimate him.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.094" end="00:04:41.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.294" end="00:04:42.494" style="s2">Soon I&#39;ll have sold Fault Industries,</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.294" end="00:04:44.494" style="s2">then I&#39;ll take the money and live it up</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.494" end="00:04:48.294" style="s2">abroad while he, with that stain on his</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.494" end="00:04:48.294" style="s2">record, will never turn his life around.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.494" end="00:04:56.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your place?</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.894" end="00:04:58.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m renting it. I can&#39;t afford to buy a</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.894" end="00:05:00.894" style="s2">house yet.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.694" end="00:05:01.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This rundown place is rented?</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.894" end="00:05:02.794" style="s2">Ellie, you</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.494" end="00:05:04.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you looking down on me for being</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.794" end="00:05:06.194" style="s2">poor? You&#39;re not exactly capable</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.694" end="00:05:08.394" style="s2">yourself. How can you look down on</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.194" end="00:05:10.494" style="s2">anyone else?</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.394" end="00:05:12.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said I&#39;m not capable?</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.494" end="00:05:13.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What skills do you have? You just got</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.394" end="00:05:15.294" style="s2">out of prison.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.694" end="00:05:17.894" style="s2">Right now you probably can&#39;t even land a</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.294" end="00:05:20.194" style="s2">decent job.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.894" end="00:05:21.994" style="s2">I make 7,000 a month. As long as you</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.194" end="00:05:23.594" style="s2">don&#39;t cause trouble, I can definitely</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.994" end="00:05:25.594" style="s2">support you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.594" end="00:05:28.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a grown man with two hands and two</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.594" end="00:05:29.394" style="s2">feet. I don&#39;t need you to support me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.294" end="00:05:32.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.394" end="00:05:32.294" style="s2">Then what can you do?</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.494" end="00:05:36.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I should just tell her who I</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.694" end="00:05:38.594" style="s2">really am right now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.494" end="00:05:41.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With that helpless look on his face, he</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.594" end="00:05:42.894" style="s2">probably can&#39;t do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.094" end="00:05:45.494" style="s2">Can you cook?</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.894" end="00:05:48.194" style="s2">Can you do housework?</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.494" end="00:05:48.194" style="s2">Give me your phone.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.394" end="00:05:52.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want my phone for?</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.094" end="00:05:57.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you don&#39;t want me supporting you,</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.394" end="00:05:58.894" style="s2">you&#39;ll have to earn your own keep.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.494" end="00:06:02.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, you signed me up as a delivery</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.894" end="00:06:03.694" style="s2">rider. You want me to deliver food?</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.294" end="00:06:05.995" style="s2">Ellie, you signed me up as a delivery</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.694" end="00:06:07.595" style="s2">rider. You want me to deliver food?</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.995" end="00:06:10.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t do this, can&#39;t do that.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.595" end="00:06:12.195" style="s2">Delivering food is your best bet.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.295" end="00:06:13.595" style="s2">A man should keep his nose clean. You</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.195" end="00:06:15.695" style="s2">can&#39;t go back to scultering and</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.595" end="00:06:17.395" style="s2">thieving.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.695" end="00:06:22.095" style="s2">I&#39;ve got to go to work. This is the key</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.395" end="00:06:22.095" style="s2">to our place. Don&#39;t lose it. I&#39;m off.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.395" end="00:06:27.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stealing and conniving? What did she</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.395" end="00:06:27.095" style="s2">take me for?</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.795" end="00:06:31.895" style="s2">That woman is clearly not right in the</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.495" end="00:06:31.895" style="s2">head.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.895" end="00:06:36.895" style="s2">Eric, I&#39;ll send you my location. Come</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.395" end="00:06:39.295" style="s2">over now. I have a task for you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.895" end="00:06:39.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.295" end="00:06:45.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, you&#39;re finally out. Tomorrow we</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.295" end="00:06:48.695" style="s2">can storm back into Frost Industries and</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.995" end="00:06:50.095" style="s2">reclaim everything we lost.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.695" end="00:06:51.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you in a place like this? This</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.095" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">dump, it&#39;s not fit for you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.895" end="00:06:54.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my wife&#39;s place.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:55.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.995" end="00:06:58.295" style="s2">You got married?</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.995" end="00:06:58.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.895" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">Is this the boss&#39;s wife?</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.295" end="00:07:06.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm. Don&#39;t you notice? She has a certain</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.495" end="00:07:08.995" style="s2">unique aura about her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.795" end="00:07:10.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. A poverty aura that just hits you</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.995" end="00:07:12.195" style="s2">right in the face. You clearly don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.595" end="00:07:13.795" style="s2">have taste. My wife signed me up as a</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.195" end="00:07:14.395" style="s2">delivery ricker. You go deliver food for</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.795" end="00:07:16.195" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.395" end="00:07:17.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deliver food?</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.195" end="00:07:18.895" style="s2">You haven&#39;t told your wife who you</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.195" end="00:07:20.395" style="s2">really are? Sure, you&#39;re infamous at</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.895" end="00:07:22.495" style="s2">home, but your Star Tech overseas is</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.395" end="00:07:25.095" style="s2">worth 100 billion. She makes 7,000 a</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.495" end="00:07:26.295" style="s2">month. I&#39;m afraid I&#39;d scare her off.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.095" end="00:07:27.695" style="s2">We&#39;ll talk about it once I&#39;ve dealt with</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.295" end="00:07:30.195" style="s2">my brother and reclaimed Frost</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.695" end="00:07:30.195" style="s2">Industries.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.895" end="00:07:40.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.695" end="00:07:42.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, I heard you and Ethan broke up.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.695" end="00:07:43.995" style="s2">How could you be so silly? Our family is</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.495" end="00:07:45.895" style="s2">so poor and Ethan never looked down on</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.995" end="00:07:47.495" style="s2">us. How can you throw a tantrum at him?</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.895" end="00:07:48.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, he&#39;s the one who called it off, not</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.495" end="00:07:49.695" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.195" end="00:07:50.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So go make it up to him. Reflect on</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.695" end="00:07:51.595" style="s2">yourself. Didn&#39;t you take good enough</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.895" end="00:07:53.695" style="s2">care of him?</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.595" end="00:07:56.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;ve been Ethan&#39;s unpaid maid for</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.695" end="00:07:58.295" style="s2">two years, washing his clothes, cooking</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.195" end="00:08:01.895" style="s2">for him, never once complaining. What</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.295" end="00:08:01.895" style="s2">more do you want me to do for him?</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.015" end="00:08:08.397" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.995" end="00:08:10.697" style="s2">Ethan, why is there a lipstick mark on</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.397" end="00:08:12.197" style="s2">your collar?</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.697" end="00:08:13.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what if there&#39;s a lipstick mark?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.197" end="00:08:15.397" style="s2">Ellie, do you know how exhausting my</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.697" end="00:08:17.497" style="s2">business dinners are every day? Stop</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.397" end="00:08:19.997" style="s2">making a scene, all right?</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.497" end="00:08:23.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Ethan. I wasn&#39;t doubting you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.997" end="00:08:23.297" style="s2">I just care about you too much.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.497" end="00:08:27.297" style="s2">Mom, my and Ethan&#39;s premarital checkup</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.797" end="00:08:29.197" style="s2">results are in.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.297" end="00:08:30.997" style="s2">Ethan is infertile. He won&#39;t be able to</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.197" end="00:08:32.197" style="s2">have kids.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.997" end="00:08:34.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, when Ethan hears this, he&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.197" end="00:08:36.697" style="s2">devastated. Ellie, as a woman, you need</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.897" end="00:08:38.097" style="s2">to be considerate of your man. When</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.697" end="00:08:41.297" style="s2">Ethan gets back, you tell him that</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.097" end="00:08:41.297" style="s2">you&#39;re the one who&#39;s barren.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.697" end="00:08:46.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, you&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.297" end="00:08:48.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the engagement ring I bought</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.497" end="00:08:50.597" style="s2">you. Like it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.097" end="00:08:52.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love it. Anything you give me I love.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.597" end="00:08:53.997" style="s2">Oh, the checkup results are in. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.397" end="00:08:56.097" style="s2">barren. I&#39;m afraid we won&#39;t be able to</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.997" end="00:08:57.697" style="s2">have kids.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.097" end="00:08:59.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get treatment first then. The wedding</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.697" end="00:09:01.797" style="s2">can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.597" end="00:09:03.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I know I&#39;m poor and not good enough</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.797" end="00:09:06.597" style="s2">for Ethan, so I&#39;ll just marry a poor</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.697" end="00:09:06.597" style="s2">man. That&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.297" end="00:09:10.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, I won&#39;t be anyone&#39;s doormat</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.197" end="00:09:11.597" style="s2">and I won&#39;t let anyone trample my</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.397" end="00:09:15.197" style="s2">dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.597" end="00:09:15.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, director Cole is looking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.597" end="00:09:20.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director,</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.897" end="00:09:20.097" style="s2">here&#39;s the file you asked for.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.197" end="00:09:27.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the ring Ethan meant to give me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.997" end="00:09:28.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, Ethan proposed to me yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.097" end="00:09:32.297" style="s2">I know you&#39;re still in love with him,</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.697" end="00:09:32.297" style="s2">but he only has me in his heart.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.397" end="00:09:35.797" style="s2">Director, I got married.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.897" end="00:09:39.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s the registry office&#39;s official</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.397" end="00:09:41.597" style="s2">seal.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.997" end="00:09:43.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, you really are married?</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.597" end="00:09:44.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. We got the certificate this</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.197" end="00:09:45.497" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.397" end="00:09:47.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does he do?</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.497" end="00:09:50.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He just got out of prison. No job yet.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.797" end="00:09:53.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Released? He&#39;s done time?</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.797" end="00:09:53.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If that&#39;s all, I&#39;ll head out.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.697" end="00:10:02.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon Frost, second son of Frost</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.597" end="00:10:03.997" style="s2">Industries, imprisoned half a year ago</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.797" end="00:10:05.497" style="s2">for manslaughter.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.997" end="00:10:07.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holy crap. Ellie &#39;s husband is the</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.497" end="00:10:09.198" style="s2">second son of Frost Industries? No way.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.797" end="00:10:12.298" style="s2">Ellie is bottom of the barrel trash. how</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.198" end="00:10:12.298" style="s2">could she ever reach that high?</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.498" end="00:10:16.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.998" end="00:10:23.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie Hart.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.698" end="00:10:26.298" style="s2">So to get my attention you went and</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.798" end="00:10:27.498" style="s2">married some random man in a flash.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.298" end="00:10:29.898" style="s2">Think that&#39;ll make me spare you another</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.498" end="00:10:29.898" style="s2">glance?</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.898" end="00:10:34.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got married that fast just to keep my</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.598" end="00:10:37.398" style="s2">job so director Cole wouldn&#39;t give me</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.698" end="00:10:40.698" style="s2">trouble over our past.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.398" end="00:10:40.698" style="s2">It has nothing to do with you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.998" end="00:10:44.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still stubborn.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.698" end="00:10:47.198" style="s2">I heard that man you married did time. I</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.798" end="00:10:50.698" style="s2">knew no decent man would ever want you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.198" end="00:10:50.698" style="s2">So don&#39;t you blame me for dumping you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.598" end="00:10:55.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, when you find out you&#39;re the one</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.698" end="00:10:56.998" style="s2">who&#39;s barren I wonder what you&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.798" end="00:11:00.198" style="s2">of it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.998" end="00:11:00.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you smirking at?</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.298" end="00:11:03.298" style="s2">What are you smirking at?</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.898" end="00:11:04.398" style="s2">You married trash and you&#39;re feeling</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.298" end="00:11:05.998" style="s2">proud?</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.398" end="00:11:08.498" style="s2">You two are doomed to live in the slums</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.998" end="00:11:10.198" style="s2">your whole lives while me and Vanessa</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.498" end="00:11:11.598" style="s2">will only keep climbing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.198" end="00:11:13.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, well then</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.598" end="00:11:15.898" style="s2">congratulations on your marriage and may</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.098" end="00:11:15.898" style="s2">you have kids soon.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.598" end="00:11:23.898" style="s2">How dare she be so smug?</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.798" end="00:11:25.998" style="s2">Ethan, on her marriage certificate her</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.898" end="00:11:27.598" style="s2">husband&#39;s called Landon Frost, the very</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.998" end="00:11:28.998" style="s2">name of the second master of Frost</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.598" end="00:11:30.898" style="s2">Industries.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.998" end="00:11:33.198" style="s2">And what a coincidence, her husband did</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.898" end="00:11:33.998" style="s2">time and so did the second master. What</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.198" end="00:11:35.298" style="s2">if her husband is</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.998" end="00:11:36.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.298" end="00:11:39.298" style="s2">Nobody even knows what the second master</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.798" end="00:11:39.298" style="s2">looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.898" end="00:11:43.098" style="s2">She deliberately married a man with the</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.298" end="00:11:45.998" style="s2">same name to scare us.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.098" end="00:11:47.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.998" end="00:11:49.698" style="s2">Our company just landed a project with</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.598" end="00:11:53.398" style="s2">Frost Industries. I&#39;ll take her there</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.698" end="00:11:53.398" style="s2">tomorrow and teach her a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.198" end="00:12:03.298" style="s2">You why aren&#39;t you wearing any clothes?</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.798" end="00:12:04.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, I&#39;m your husband now. You&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.298" end="00:12:07.398" style="s2">to get used to having a man around who</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.398" end="00:12:07.398" style="s2">doesn&#39;t like wearing clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.898" end="00:12:12.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pervert.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.198" end="00:12:14.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes me a pervert? Then you&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.898" end="00:12:14.999" style="s2">so embarrassed tonight on our wedding</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.099" end="00:12:16.699" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.999" end="00:12:19.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who agreed to a wedding night? We hardly</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.699" end="00:12:20.999" style="s2">know each other. Separate rooms for now.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.399" end="00:12:22.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A 30 square meter spot the size of a</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.999" end="00:12:24.099" style="s2">shoebox? Are you going to exile me to</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.799" end="00:12:26.099" style="s2">the bathroom?</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.099" end="00:12:27.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The place really is a bit small.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.099" end="00:12:29.499" style="s2">This weekend I&#39;ll look around and find</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.399" end="00:12:30.499" style="s2">something bigger.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.499" end="00:12:33.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.499" end="00:12:34.899" style="s2">I made over 300 today delivering food.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.199" end="00:12:36.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That much? Who knew you were this</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.899" end="00:12:38.299" style="s2">impressive?</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.399" end="00:12:40.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got something even more impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.299" end="00:12:40.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.358" end="00:12:48.378" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.299" end="00:12:57.099" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.799" end="00:12:57.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a husband should do, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.299" end="00:13:04.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, there are no condoms in the house.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.399" end="00:13:05.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you supposed to be barren?</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.099" end="00:13:06.664" style="s2">That save us on condoms.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.199" end="00:13:10.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; closer.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.664" end="00:13:10.299" style="s2">[sighs] Don&#39;t be shy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.199" end="00:13:18.399" style="s2">A thread of light, a single spot.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.899" end="00:13:28.699" style="s2">I told him I was barren and he didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.899" end="00:13:30.899" style="s2">mind one bit.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.699" end="00:13:33.199" style="s2">He really is a different kind of man.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.899" end="00:13:36.139" style="s2">But this guy&#39;s all brum just proves that</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.199" end="00:13:37.899" style="s2">saying all brum no brains.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.139" end="00:13:39.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.899" end="00:13:40.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I hurt you last night? Maybe you</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.199" end="00:13:40.899" style="s2">should take the day off and rest at</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.299" end="00:13:43.499" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.899" end="00:13:44.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Taking leave costs money. I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.499" end="00:13:45.799" style="s2">to go to work. Figure out your own</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.899" end="00:13:47.699" style="s2">breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.799" end="00:13:49.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it was her first time.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.699" end="00:13:50.899" style="s2">No wonder she kept crying out in pain</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.199" end="00:13:52.399" style="s2">last night.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.899" end="00:13:54.299" style="s2">Come home early tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.399" end="00:13:56.099" style="s2">I have a surprise for you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.299" end="00:13:57.799" style="s2">Tonight I&#39;ll tell her who I really am</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.099" end="00:14:00.699" style="s2">and prepare a gift for her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.799" end="00:14:02.339" style="s2">She&#39;ll be so happy she faints, right?</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.699" end="00:14:02.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What surprise?</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.339" end="00:14:04.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.599" end="00:14:05.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll find out tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.199" end="00:14:07.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, then I&#39;ll try to come home</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.599" end="00:14:07.899" style="s2">early.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.799" end="00:14:14.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, the lawyer&#39;s already gone to Frost</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.599" end="00:14:15.701" style="s2">Industries to sign the contract. We can</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.199" end="00:14:16.401" style="s2">head over now.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.701" end="00:14:17.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.401" end="00:14:19.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two steamed buns, please.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.701" end="00:14:22.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:24.001" style="s2">Coming right up.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.401" end="00:14:25.801" style="s2">Young lady, your face is so red. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.001" end="00:14:28.001" style="s2">running a fever?</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.801" end="00:14:30.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really is a bit warm. Can I catch a</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.001" end="00:14:30.801" style="s2">chill last night?</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.401" end="00:14:38.401" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that my husband?</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.801" end="00:14:45.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, let&#39;s get in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.901" end="00:14:47.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought I heard Ellie call my name as</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.401" end="00:14:50.401" style="s2">honey, but she&#39;s never called me that. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.601" end="00:14:50.401" style="s2">must have misheard.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.701" end="00:14:58.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I out of my mind with fever? My</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.501" end="00:15:00.601" style="s2">husband delivers food. How could he be</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.101" end="00:15:01.901" style="s2">in a suit riding a luxury car?</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.601" end="00:15:04.401" style="s2">I better go buy some fever medicine</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.901" end="00:15:04.401" style="s2">fast.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.901" end="00:15:09.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Attorney Reed, on a day as important as</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.901" end="00:15:10.901" style="s2">this contract signing, isn&#39;t your boss</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.601" end="00:15:14.501" style="s2">going to show up?</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.901" end="00:15:15.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our boss values his privacy very much.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.501" end="00:15:19.401" style="s2">He&#39;s never appeared in public all these</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.801" end="00:15:19.401" style="s2">years. I hope you understand.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.501" end="00:15:22.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.501" end="00:15:24.001" style="s2">Mr. Frost, take a look at the contract</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.301" end="00:15:26.401" style="s2">terms. If everything&#39;s in order, you can</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.001" end="00:15:26.401" style="s2">sign.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.101" end="00:15:31.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do trust Star Tech.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.401" end="00:15:33.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all, your company is renowned</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.201" end="00:15:34.901" style="s2">overseas. You wouldn&#39;t bother coming all</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.101" end="00:15:37.201" style="s2">this way just to scam me. Then sign</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.901" end="00:15:37.201" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.101" end="00:15:52.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the big boss of Star Tech here? After</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.201" end="00:15:54.601" style="s2">today, our company will belong to Star</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.801" end="00:15:55.301" style="s2">Tech. I heard the second master got out</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.601" end="00:15:56.701" style="s2">of prison.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.301" end="00:15:58.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When he finds out Frost Industries was</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.701" end="00:15:58.901" style="s2">sold by his own brother, will he explode</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.101" end="00:16:00.301" style="s2">with rage?</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.901" end="00:16:01.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being fired won&#39;t change a thing. He was</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.301" end="00:16:02.601" style="s2">kicked off the board half a year ago,</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.501" end="00:16:03.601" style="s2">but the company&#39;s already been sold.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.601" end="00:16:04.901" style="s2">There&#39;s no turning back now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.601" end="00:16:07.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Who knows? He might end up</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.901" end="00:16:07.901" style="s2">doing even worse than us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.201" end="00:16:20.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, I&#39;m going to Frost Industries</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.301" end="00:16:21.002" style="s2">today to discuss a deal. Come along with</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.202" end="00:16:23.202" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.002" end="00:16:24.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frost Industries? For such an important</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.202" end="00:16:27.102" style="s2">project, are you sure you want me</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.402" end="00:16:27.102" style="s2">tagging along?</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.102" end="00:16:31.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re already married, and Ethan and I</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.102" end="00:16:33.602" style="s2">are getting married soon. I&#39;ve no reason</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.902" end="00:16:37.202" style="s2">to keep making life hard for you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.602" end="00:16:37.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, director. I&#39;ll work hard.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.102" end="00:16:43.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know who the boss of Frost</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.302" end="00:16:43.102" style="s2">Industries is?</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.502" end="00:16:47.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The current boss is Marcus Frost.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.702" end="00:16:49.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.702" end="00:16:51.902" style="s2">And he has a younger brother named</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.302" end="00:16:53.202" style="s2">Landon Frost.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.902" end="00:16:55.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon?</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.202" end="00:16:57.302" style="s2">That sounds just like my husband&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.102" end="00:16:59.902" style="s2">Not just similar. It&#39;s the exact same</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.302" end="00:17:01.402" style="s2">name. What a coincidence, isn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.902" end="00:17:03.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is a coincidence.</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.402" end="00:17:06.602" style="s2">But my husband&#39;s a delivery driver, not</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.002" end="00:17:06.602" style="s2">the second master of Frost Industries.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.802" end="00:17:10.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Attorney Reed, I have a younger brother</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.402" end="00:17:11.802" style="s2">named Landon Frost. If he comes here</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.002" end="00:17:14.002" style="s2">causing trouble, have security throw him</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.802" end="00:17:14.002" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.702" end="00:17:19.202" style="s2">Attorney Reed, that&#39;s him. That&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.702" end="00:17:20.502" style="s2">brother. He&#39;s clearly here to cause</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.202" end="00:17:21.402" style="s2">trouble. Have someone throw him out</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.502" end="00:17:22.802" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.402" end="00:17:26.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother,</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.802" end="00:17:28.102" style="s2">are you that afraid of me? Too bad.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.202" end="00:17:29.302" style="s2">What you fear most is exactly what</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.102" end="00:17:30.602" style="s2">becomes true.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.302" end="00:17:32.002" style="s2">Half a year ago, when you didn&#39;t pay me</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.602" end="00:17:34.102" style="s2">for the stock that this day would come,</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.002" end="00:17:35.902" style="s2">Mr. Frost, contact is done. Frost</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.102" end="00:17:38.102" style="s2">Industries is yours now. You&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.902" end="00:17:39.502" style="s2">owner of StarTech.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.102" end="00:17:41.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Roberts, these are the three</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.502" end="00:17:43.302" style="s2">designs we&#39;ve prepared for your company.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.002" end="00:17:45.802" style="s2">Please take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.302" end="00:17:47.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who designed the third one?</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.802" end="00:17:48.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Roberts, I designed the third one.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.502" end="00:17:50.402" style="s2">It&#39;s my first time designing business</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.802" end="00:17:51.502" style="s2">apparel. There must be flaws. Please do</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.402" end="00:17:53.102" style="s2">point them out.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.502" end="00:17:55.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one is composed, yet still has</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.102" end="00:17:55.702" style="s2">flair. Have a sample made based on your</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.102" end="00:17:57.302" style="s2">design.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.702" end="00:17:59.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.302" end="00:18:01.402" style="s2">Mrs. Robert, the jewelry you ordered has</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.002" end="00:18:01.402" style="s2">arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.302" end="00:18:06.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, what a beautiful bracelet. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.502" end="00:18:07.002" style="s2">emerald green all over. Clearly worth a</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.402" end="00:18:08.802" style="s2">fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.002" end="00:18:10.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. I ordered it on behalf of our</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.802" end="00:18:11.002" style="s2">boss. It must be a gift for the boss&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.502" end="00:18:12.402" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.002" end="00:18:13.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This bracelet must run at least six</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.402" end="00:18:14.802" style="s2">figures.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.102" end="00:18:16.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Someone as lovely as the boss is</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.802" end="00:18:18.802" style="s2">wife is sure to love such a pretty</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.302" end="00:18:18.802" style="s2">bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.402" end="00:18:23.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, such an expensive bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.303" end="00:18:24.503" style="s2">and it&#39;s broken.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.203" end="00:18:25.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw her lunge over and break the</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.503" end="00:18:26.003" style="s2">bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.103" end="00:18:27.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me. It was</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.003" end="00:18:28.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you looking at me? You wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.003" end="00:18:29.603" style="s2">get a look at the bracelet then clumsily</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.403" end="00:18:30.703" style="s2">knocked over and broke it. Don&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.603" end="00:18:32.303" style="s2">dare pin this on me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.703" end="00:18:33.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This bracelet cost a million. You broke</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.303" end="00:18:34.703" style="s2">it so you must pay for it otherwise I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.703" end="00:18:35.703" style="s2">calling the police.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.703" end="00:18:36.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A million? I don&#39;t have that kind of</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.703" end="00:18:37.103" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.103" end="00:18:39.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about that ex-con husband of yours?</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.103" end="00:18:40.103" style="s2">Have him pay for it. And Ms. Roberts,</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.103" end="00:18:41.503" style="s2">what a coincidence. She claims her</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.103" end="00:18:42.703" style="s2">husband&#39;s name is Landon Frost just like</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.503" end="00:18:43.803" style="s2">the second master of Frost Industries.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.703" end="00:18:45.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would Mr. Frost would never marry</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.803" end="00:18:46.903" style="s2">some low-class nobody like her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.403" end="00:18:48.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear that? The second master wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.903" end="00:18:50.203" style="s2">want you. Just cough up the money</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.203" end="00:18:50.803" style="s2">honestly. Can&#39;t pay, then off to prison</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.203" end="00:18:53.803" style="s2">you go.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.803" end="00:18:53.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.003" end="00:19:01.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ward, this woman broke the bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.303" end="00:19:04.303" style="s2">I bought from Mr. Frost. The one he</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.203" end="00:19:04.303" style="s2">meant to give to Mrs. Frost.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.303" end="00:19:10.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this the boss&#39;s wife?</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.303" end="00:19:13.403" style="s2">She really be the lady of the house? No</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.203" end="00:19:15.103" style="s2">way. I got to go tell the boss.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.403" end="00:19:16.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Roberts, call the cops and have her</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.103" end="00:19:18.803" style="s2">locked up right now. Once your boss gets</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.903" end="00:19:20.503" style="s2">here all hell&#39;s going to break loose.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.803" end="00:19:22.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I&#39;m calling the cops now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.503" end="00:19:23.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, don&#39;t call the police. It was</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.103" end="00:19:24.303" style="s2">Vanessa who pushed me. I didn&#39;t mean to</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.203" end="00:19:26.003" style="s2">knock into you. Don&#39;t believe me, go</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.303" end="00:19:27.403" style="s2">check the cameras. She&#39;s lying. Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.003" end="00:19:29.203" style="s2">Roberts, don&#39;t listen to her. Call the</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.403" end="00:19:31.703" style="s2">police right now. Save your story for</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.203" end="00:19:31.703" style="s2">the cops.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.118" end="00:19:35.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.303" end="00:19:36.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, your wife seems to be at the</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.203" end="00:19:38.503" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.503" end="00:19:41.303" style="s2">What&#39;s she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.503" end="00:19:41.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She know who I am?</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.403" end="00:19:47.103" style="s2">What did she think? I only gave her a</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.103" end="00:19:48.503" style="s2">little shove. I barely touched her. Was</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.103" end="00:19:49.903" style="s2">she trying to frame me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.503" end="00:19:52.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think she can&#39;t afford to pay it back</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.903" end="00:19:56.103" style="s2">so she is playing fainting, right?</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.503" end="00:19:58.003" style="s2">Ellie Hart, quit faking. Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.103" end="00:20:00.303" style="s2">She&#39;s not really out cold, is she? She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.003" end="00:20:02.003" style="s2">not looking right.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.303" end="00:20:04.503" style="s2">She&#39;s definitely faking it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.003" end="00:20:06.903" style="s2">Just you wait.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.503" end="00:20:06.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.203" end="00:20:09.903" style="s2">Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.303" end="00:20:11.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, isn&#39;t that the man on Ellie</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.903" end="00:20:12.903" style="s2">Hart&#39;s marriage certificate? Why did Ms.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.303" end="00:20:16.303" style="s2">Roberts call him Mr. Frost? Could he be</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.903" end="00:20:16.303" style="s2">the second master of Frost Industries?</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.403" end="00:20:20.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is she burning up? She running a</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.803" end="00:20:21.603" style="s2">fever?</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.103" end="00:20:22.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ward, that woman broke the million</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.603" end="00:20:24.205" style="s2">dollar bracelet I special ordered for</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.703" end="00:20:25.405" style="s2">Mr. Frost. Why is he still holding her?</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.205" end="00:20:26.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She fainted, so she&#39;s got to be rushed</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.405" end="00:20:27.905" style="s2">to the hospital. If something happens to</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.605" end="00:20:29.005" style="s2">her, are you going to take the blame? Go</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.905" end="00:20:31.405" style="s2">pull the footage from the security room.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.005" end="00:20:31.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.905" end="00:20:34.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do you think you&#39;re going?</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.105" end="00:20:37.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need the ladies&#39; room.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.105" end="00:20:38.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.305" end="00:20:40.905" style="s2">Until this is sorted out, you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.305" end="00:20:40.905" style="s2">going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.905" end="00:20:47.405" style="s2">You&#39;re awake.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.405" end="00:20:51.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you dressed like this? This suit</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.905" end="00:20:52.374" style="s2">looks crazy expensive. Where&#39;d you get</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.405" end="00:20:52.605" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.374" end="00:20:53.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.605" end="00:20:55.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t I say this morning I had a</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.605" end="00:20:57.505" style="s2">surprise for you? The truth is I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.405" end="00:20:59.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You found a new job? A security guard or</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.505" end="00:21:00.905" style="s2">a sales rep?</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.705" end="00:21:03.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I be the CEO of the whole</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.905" end="00:21:03.605" style="s2">corporation?</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.905" end="00:21:07.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow, ow. Stop pinching me, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.705" end="00:21:09.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s broad daylight. What are you</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.705" end="00:21:11.405" style="s2">dreaming about? We&#39;re ordinary folks. No</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.705" end="00:21:13.105" style="s2">point getting carried away. Oh, right.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.405" end="00:21:14.905" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I pass out at Frost Industries?</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.105" end="00:21:15.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Funny thing is I went to Frost</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.905" end="00:21:16.705" style="s2">Industries today.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.505" end="00:21:18.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got hired as a security guard at</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.705" end="00:21:19.805" style="s2">Frost Industries? Babe, that&#39;s amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.605" end="00:21:20.805" style="s2">The pay might not be much, but at least</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.805" end="00:21:21.905" style="s2">you won&#39;t be out in the sun and rain</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.805" end="00:21:23.005" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.905" end="00:21:24.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling, I</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.005" end="00:21:24.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t take a leave today. I have to</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.205" end="00:21:25.705" style="s2">go back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.705" end="00:21:26.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just got over your fever. Don&#39;t go</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.705" end="00:21:28.105" style="s2">to work today.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.305" end="00:21:31.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. My design director screwed me</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.105" end="00:21:31.405" style="s2">over. I have to get justice.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.505" end="00:21:40.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got some nerve</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.005" end="00:21:41.905" style="s2">causing trouble at Frost Industries.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.005" end="00:21:43.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.905" end="00:21:44.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The evidence is right there, and you</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.005" end="00:21:47.505" style="s2">still deny it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.705" end="00:21:49.305" style="s2">Take her to the police station.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.505" end="00:21:51.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no.</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.305" end="00:21:53.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, design director Cole took me to</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.505" end="00:21:55.105" style="s2">Frost Industries today.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.105" end="00:21:56.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard all about it. You broke Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.105" end="00:21:58.905" style="s2">Frost&#39;s million-dollar bracelet. How can</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.705" end="00:22:00.405" style="s2">you be such a troublemaker? Ellie Hart,</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.905" end="00:22:03.005" style="s2">consider yourself fired, effective</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.405" end="00:22:03.005" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.305" end="00:22:07.705" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.205" end="00:22:13.205" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.105" end="00:22:13.205" style="s2">Ellie Hart, hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.905" end="00:22:18.405" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.205" end="00:22:19.505" style="s2">Ellie Hart, I was wrong about you. Frost</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.405" end="00:22:21.305" style="s2">Industries didn&#39;t blame you over the</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.505" end="00:22:23.105" style="s2">bracelet. Actually, they specifically</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.305" end="00:22:24.405" style="s2">want you in charge of the order, so keep</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.105" end="00:22:25.506" style="s2">on top of this project, and there&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.405" end="00:22:26.506" style="s2">a nice bonus waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.506" end="00:22:28.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.506" end="00:22:29.306" style="s2">are you sure Frost Industries asked for</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.306" end="00:22:30.906" style="s2">me specifically?</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.306" end="00:22:32.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, they love your designs, so they</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.906" end="00:22:33.406" style="s2">want you on this project.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.506" end="00:22:34.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And do I still have to pay for the</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.406" end="00:22:36.106" style="s2">bracelet?</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.506" end="00:22:37.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They never mentioned it, so I guess you</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.106" end="00:22:38.506" style="s2">don&#39;t have to pay, right?</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.506" end="00:22:40.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.506" end="00:22:41.806" style="s2">Looks like their boss is pretty sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.006" end="00:22:43.406" style="s2">He knows the bracelet wasn&#39;t my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.806" end="00:22:44.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, get back to work and don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.406" end="00:22:46.406" style="s2">mess up again.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.106" end="00:22:46.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.706" end="00:22:49.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, your older brother slipped</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.306" end="00:22:51.106" style="s2">off to the airport while you were at the</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.506" end="00:22:52.606" style="s2">hospital. Should be boarding by now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.106" end="00:22:54.306" style="s2">Should we bring him back?</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.606" end="00:22:55.606" style="s2">Let him run. It won&#39;t be long before he</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.306" end="00:22:56.706" style="s2">crawls back on his own.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.606" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, so you&#39;ve already set the trap for</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.706" end="00:22:59.106" style="s2">him overseas.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.406" end="00:23:00.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, but I won&#39;t let him die. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.106" end="00:23:02.006" style="s2">making him live a life like this.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.706" end="00:23:03.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm. [clears throat] What about your</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.006" end="00:23:05.806" style="s2">wife? Is she all right?</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.506" end="00:23:07.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her fever&#39;s gone. She went back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.806" end="00:23:08.806" style="s2">No matter what, she won&#39;t believe I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.006" end="00:23:10.506" style="s2">the CEO. She insists I&#39;m a security</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.806" end="00:23:11.906" style="s2">guard. If I were your wife, I wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.506" end="00:23:13.806" style="s2">believe it either. She&#39;s so poor and</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.906" end="00:23:15.406" style="s2">ordinary. Why would a dashing CEO fall</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.806" end="00:23:17.106" style="s2">for her? Only you aren&#39;t picky. Do you</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.406" end="00:23:18.706" style="s2">know why I love her? Because in her</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.106" end="00:23:20.406" style="s2">eyes, I&#39;m not the lofty second master of</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.706" end="00:23:21.706" style="s2">Frost Industries. With her, I get to</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.406" end="00:23:24.306" style="s2">feel the genuine affection of an</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.706" end="00:23:26.306" style="s2">ordinary man, and that&#39;s a first for me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.306" end="00:23:28.306" style="s2">So you&#39;re planning to keep hiding it?</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.306" end="00:23:29.306" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.306" end="00:23:30.806" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.306" end="00:23:32.806" style="s2">In about half a week, my mother will be</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.806" end="00:23:34.806" style="s2">discharged from the care home.</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.806" end="00:23:36.506" style="s2">When that happens, I plan to introduce</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.806" end="00:23:37.706" style="s2">Ellie to the whole family,</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.506" end="00:23:39.306" style="s2">and then she&#39;ll naturally learn who I</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.706" end="00:23:41.306" style="s2">am.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.306" end="00:23:43.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t Mrs. Frost still out of it? Has</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.306" end="00:23:44.506" style="s2">she gotten better?</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.006" end="00:23:45.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.506" end="00:23:48.406" style="s2">If she learns I&#39;ve settled down, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.806" end="00:23:48.406" style="s2">be overjoyed.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.706" end="00:23:53.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My fever&#39;s long gone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.106" end="00:23:55.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is a 7,000 a month job really worth</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.806" end="00:23:58.006" style="s2">working yourself ragged over?</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.606" end="00:23:59.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just graduated not long ago. Landing a</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.006" end="00:24:01.606" style="s2">7,000 a month job is already pretty</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.806" end="00:24:03.506" style="s2">good. Plus, I&#39;ve got the Frost</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.606" end="00:24:05.006" style="s2">Industries project now. If I pull it</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.506" end="00:24:06.606" style="s2">off, there&#39;s even a bonus.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.006" end="00:24:07.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie Hart, if you suddenly got rich one</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.606" end="00:24:09.106" style="s2">day, what would you do?</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.606" end="00:24:12.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rich overnight, morling dead from</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.106" end="00:24:12.506" style="s2">overwork with these endless shifts.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.706" end="00:24:15.406" style="s2">You made this?</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.206" end="00:24:19.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.206" end="00:24:22.506" style="s2">You&#39;ve been sick.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.606" end="00:24:22.506" style="s2">Better to eat at home.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.706" end="00:24:25.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say you couldn&#39;t cook?</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.506" end="00:24:27.306" style="s2">Hey, this is pretty good.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.906" end="00:24:28.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I looked up recipes online and followed</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.306" end="00:24:31.307" style="s2">them. Touched?</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.607" end="00:24:32.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon Frost, you&#39;re so good to me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.307" end="00:24:34.908" style="s2">What did you do to end up in there</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.408" end="00:24:34.908" style="s2">before?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.908" end="00:24:42.107" style="s2">Ellie, I heard Vanessa got arrested.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.207" end="00:24:43.507" style="s2">That&#39;s the best news ever. Now that</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.107" end="00:24:46.408" style="s2">she&#39;s out, you think the boss might make</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.507" end="00:24:46.408" style="s2">you design director?</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.307" end="00:24:52.507" style="s2">Him? Isn&#39;t he that prisoner who harassed</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.107" end="00:24:54.007" style="s2">you at the jail? Ellie, what&#39;s he doing</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.507" end="00:24:55.507" style="s2">in your place?</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.007" end="00:24:57.807" style="s2">Is he here to rob the place?</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.507" end="00:25:00.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie is my wife. Being in my own wife&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.807" end="00:25:01.707" style="s2">home can hardly count as burglary.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.607" end="00:25:03.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.707" end="00:25:04.408" style="s2">You two got married?</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.507" end="00:25:05.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want me to show you the marriage</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.408" end="00:25:07.007" style="s2">certificate?</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.107" end="00:25:08.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, have you lost your mind? Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.007" end="00:25:10.107" style="s2">you remember what you told me? You said</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.507" end="00:25:12.007" style="s2">crushing on guys is fine, but never lose</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.107" end="00:25:13.707" style="s2">your head. He&#39;s an ex-con. What if he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.007" end="00:25:14.707" style="s2">a killer? Ellie, do you even care about</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.707" end="00:25:16.408" style="s2">your own life?</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.707" end="00:25:17.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daisy, calm down. I&#39;ve got nothing. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.408" end="00:25:18.807" style="s2">not going to kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.507" end="00:25:21.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may not have money, but you&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.807" end="00:25:23.207" style="s2">looks. What if he&#39;s after your body?</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.207" end="00:25:25.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as he&#39;s not after my life.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.207" end="00:25:26.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. But you get married such a huge</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.007" end="00:25:28.107" style="s2">deal and you didn&#39;t even tell me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.807" end="00:25:29.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t tell you and I didn&#39;t tell my</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.107" end="00:25:31.207" style="s2">parents either. You weren&#39;t like driven</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.908" end="00:25:32.207" style="s2">by that jerk and jumped into a quickie</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.207" end="00:25:33.408" style="s2">marriage, were you? If I didn&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.207" end="00:25:35.007" style="s2">married fast, what if Vanessa kept</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.408" end="00:25:36.507" style="s2">coming after me? Love I can lose, but my</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.007" end="00:25:38.007" style="s2">job I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.507" end="00:25:38.908" style="s2">Fine. Turns out I was wrong. Even after</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.007" end="00:25:40.007" style="s2">I got married, Vanessa still wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.908" end="00:25:41.107" style="s2">let me go. She took me to Frost</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.007" end="00:25:42.507" style="s2">Industries today, set me up trying to</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.107" end="00:25:43.707" style="s2">land me in jail, and instead she landed</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.507" end="00:25:45.607" style="s2">herself in jail. That&#39;s what they call</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.707" end="00:25:48.007" style="s2">karma. Ellie, now that Vanessa&#39;s gone,</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.607" end="00:25:51.607" style="s2">you&#39;re only going to climb higher.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.007" end="00:25:53.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done chatting? Can we finally eat?</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.607" end="00:25:56.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daisy, want to stay for a bite?</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.207" end="00:25:56.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nah, I won&#39;t be a third wheel.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.908" end="00:26:03.307" style="s2">800 grand, all my savings, every cent</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.007" end="00:26:04.707" style="s2">gone. I was supposed to buy a house with</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.307" end="00:26:06.307" style="s2">you and now I&#39;ve got nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.707" end="00:26:07.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop crying. At least you&#39;re not going</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.307" end="00:26:08.007" style="s2">to jail. Money can always be earned</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.607" end="00:26:09.607" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.007" end="00:26:10.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all Ellie Hart&#39;s fault. If it</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.607" end="00:26:11.707" style="s2">weren&#39;t for her, I&#39;d never have fallen</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.908" end="00:26:12.807" style="s2">flat on my face.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.707" end="00:26:13.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just think of it as paying to ward off</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.807" end="00:26:14.307" style="s2">misfortune. Ellie Hart won&#39;t be able to</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.908" end="00:26:15.707" style="s2">touch you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.307" end="00:26:17.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her husband is Landon Frost, the second</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.707" end="00:26:18.408" style="s2">master of Frost Industries. Today at</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.207" end="00:26:19.607" style="s2">Frost Industries, I heard people call</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.408" end="00:26:21.107" style="s2">him Mr. Frost myself.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.607" end="00:26:22.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. If her husband were the second</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.107" end="00:26:23.408" style="s2">master of the Frost family, she&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.207" end="00:26:24.908" style="s2">bragging about it non-stop.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.408" end="00:26:26.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Ellie Hart doesn&#39;t seem to know</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.908" end="00:26:27.307" style="s2">who her husband is. Could it be that</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.207" end="00:26:28.307" style="s2">Landon Frost never told her?</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.307" end="00:26:28.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not planning to make a real society</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.307" end="00:26:29.507" style="s2">lady.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.507" end="00:26:31.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have to split them up before Ellie</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.507" end="00:26:32.709" style="s2">finds out Landon &#39;s real identity.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.009" end="00:26:34.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got a plan.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.709" end="00:26:36.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Though he&#39;s been to prison, he now cooks</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.409" end="00:26:37.709" style="s2">and even does the dishes on his own.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.109" end="00:26:39.709" style="s2">That alone shows he truly wants a life</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.709" end="00:26:40.909" style="s2">with me. Whatever he did wrong before, I</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.709" end="00:26:42.509" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t bring it up again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.909" end="00:26:43.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, I felt awful about hurting you</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.509" end="00:26:44.209" style="s2">last night.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.209" end="00:26:44.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your technique really could use some</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.209" end="00:26:46.209" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.709" end="00:26:49.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why don&#39;t we try again tonight? After</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.209" end="00:26:49.709" style="s2">all, practice makes perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.809" end="00:26:58.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is mom calling? Could she know about</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.809" end="00:26:58.109" style="s2">us?</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.509" end="00:27:02.709" style="s2">Mom, I didn&#39;t mean to keep it from you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.209" end="00:27:04.309" style="s2">I was planning to bring him home to meet</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.709" end="00:27:05.509" style="s2">you all over the long holiday.</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.309" end="00:27:07.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something as big as marriage and you do</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.509" end="00:27:09.609" style="s2">it behind my back? Ellie Hart, did all</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.209" end="00:27:11.409" style="s2">your schooling go to your dog&#39;s head?</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.609" end="00:27:13.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I have to get to work. I&#39;ll explain</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.409" end="00:27:14.309" style="s2">everything when I get home. Why don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.109" end="00:27:16.309" style="s2">you take the day off and keep mom</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.309" end="00:27:18.009" style="s2">company? Since you earn less than me, it</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.309" end="00:27:20.909" style="s2">makes more sense for me to work.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.009" end="00:27:20.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, okay.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.009" end="00:27:25.109" style="s2">I haven&#39;t even won Ellie over, and now</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.909" end="00:27:27.009" style="s2">her mom shows up.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.109" end="00:27:27.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, mind if I make a call to take the</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.009" end="00:27:29.609" style="s2">day off?</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.909" end="00:27:31.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead. You&#39;ve already married my</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.609" end="00:27:33.509" style="s2">daughter. What could I possibly stop you</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.309" end="00:27:35.209" style="s2">from doing?</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.509" end="00:27:37.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I&#39;m not coming into the office</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.209" end="00:27:39.209" style="s2">today. Got to take a day off. Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.309" end="00:27:40.209" style="s2">what&#39;s wrong? My mother-in-law&#39;s here. I</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.209" end="00:27:41.709" style="s2">have to entertain her today.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.209" end="00:27:42.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woah, aren&#39;t you from I mean, isn&#39;t she</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.709" end="00:27:44.509" style="s2">from the countryside? Why did she</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.609" end="00:27:45.909" style="s2">suddenly show up? She came all night.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.509" end="00:27:47.009" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t seem too happy with me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.909" end="00:27:48.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Handsome and charming as you are, how</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.009" end="00:27:50.009" style="s2">could she be unhappy? Got it, boss. Whip</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.809" end="00:27:50.609" style="s2">out that money power of yours and win</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.009" end="00:27:52.009" style="s2">her over.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.609" end="00:27:53.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re throwing money at it works?</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.009" end="00:27:55.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. What do poor people need</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.309" end="00:27:56.909" style="s2">most? Money.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.909" end="00:27:58.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.909" end="00:27:59.409" style="s2">I mean, mom</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.109" end="00:28:00.509" style="s2">I know the marriage was sudden, but let</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.409" end="00:28:02.809" style="s2">me explain.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.509" end="00:28:03.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been to prison?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.809" end="00:28:04.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.609" end="00:28:06.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;ve been to prison, then there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.709" end="00:28:08.009" style="s2">nothing to discuss. You must have forced</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.509" end="00:28:09.909" style="s2">my daughter to marry you. Otherwise, how</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.009" end="00:28:11.809" style="s2">could she ever fancy a brute like you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.909" end="00:28:13.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;ve reformed. Just judge me by</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.809" end="00:28:15.009" style="s2">what I do from here on.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.209" end="00:28:16.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much do you even make a month? You</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.009" end="00:28:17.409" style="s2">don&#39;t even have a place of your own.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.209" end="00:28:20.209" style="s2">You&#39;re sponging off my daughter&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.409" end="00:28:23.509" style="s2">rental. A grown man, aren&#39;t you ashamed?</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.209" end="00:28:25.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Time to unleash my money power.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.509" end="00:28:28.309" style="s2">Mom, take this card. Consider it the</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.309" end="00:28:30.209" style="s2">betrothal gift for Ellie.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.309" end="00:28:30.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this really your card? How much is in</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.209" end="00:28:32.009" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.609" end="00:28:34.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course it&#39;s mine. It&#39;s got</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.009" end="00:28:36.110" style="s2">$188,888,000</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.310" end="00:28:37.910" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.110" end="00:28:38.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you talking real money or monopoly</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.910" end="00:28:39.810" style="s2">money?</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.410" end="00:28:41.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, let me be straight with you. Yes,</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.810" end="00:28:43.310" style="s2">I&#39;ve been to prison, but I&#39;m rich.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.610" end="00:28:44.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t dirty money, is it? I want no</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.310" end="00:28:45.210" style="s2">part of dirty money. It&#39;ll get me</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.610" end="00:28:46.610" style="s2">arrested.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.210" end="00:28:47.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not dirty money. I earned it all</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.610" end="00:28:49.810" style="s2">honestly through business.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.810" end="00:28:51.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you were so law-abiding, how&#39;d you</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.810" end="00:28:53.910" style="s2">end up in jail? What honest business</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.710" end="00:28:56.010" style="s2">makes over 100 million? The more I look</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.910" end="00:28:57.710" style="s2">at you, the shadier you seem. No, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.010" end="00:28:59.410" style="s2">making my daughter divorce you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.710" end="00:29:03.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why isn&#39;t the money working? I have to</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.410" end="00:29:03.010" style="s2">win over her mom before Ellie gets home.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.910" end="00:29:10.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, Vanessa&#39;s back at the company.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.710" end="00:29:12.810" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say last night she got</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.810" end="00:29:14.710" style="s2">arrested? Released that fast? She&#39;s got</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.810" end="00:29:16.610" style="s2">money. Word is she paid the jewelry</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.710" end="00:29:18.610" style="s2">company 800 grand to settle it. She</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.610" end="00:29:20.110" style="s2">tried to frame me, but ended up bleeding</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.610" end="00:29:21.310" style="s2">buckets herself.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.110" end="00:29:22.610" style="s2">Guess she won&#39;t be so quick to hurt</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.310" end="00:29:24.410" style="s2">people again.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.610" end="00:29:25.810" style="s2">Can&#39;t be sure. I thought with her</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.410" end="00:29:27.510" style="s2">arrested the boss would fire her and</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.810" end="00:29:29.510" style="s2">promote you, but turns out she&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.510" end="00:29:31.610" style="s2">the design director.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.510" end="00:29:33.210" style="s2">I don&#39;t have enough seniority.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.610" end="00:29:35.510" style="s2">Even if Vanessa steps down, the director</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.210" end="00:29:37.010" style="s2">spot would never be mine. Darling,</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.510" end="00:29:38.910" style="s2">you&#39;re overthinking it. You&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.010" end="00:29:40.710" style="s2">senior enough, but is she? I heard she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.910" end="00:29:42.110" style="s2">related to the boss. No wonder the boss</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.710" end="00:29:44.010" style="s2">wanted to fire me without even hearing</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.110" end="00:29:46.310" style="s2">me out yesterday. How can the boss do</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.010" end="00:29:49.010" style="s2">this? Ellie, once you finish the Frost</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.310" end="00:29:50.810" style="s2">Industries order, let&#39;s jump ship.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.010" end="00:29:52.310" style="s2">Otherwise, with Vanessa&#39;s petty grudges,</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.810" end="00:29:54.310" style="s2">she&#39;ll keep coming for you. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.310" end="00:29:57.410" style="s2">right. But for now, let&#39;s just finish</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.310" end="00:29:59.210" style="s2">the Frost Industries order well.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.410" end="00:30:01.510" style="s2">Ellie Hart, you must be feeling pretty</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.210" end="00:30:02.910" style="s2">smug, huh? Aren&#39;t you the smug one? You</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.510" end="00:30:04.510" style="s2">still owe me an explanation for your</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.910" end="00:30:07.710" style="s2">lies yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.510" end="00:30:09.410" style="s2">Want me to explain myself to you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.710" end="00:30:11.110" style="s2">Who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.410" end="00:30:12.710" style="s2">Think one little hiccup lets you steal</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.110" end="00:30:14.310" style="s2">my position? You&#39;re absolutely</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.710" end="00:30:15.710" style="s2">unreasonable. If I were really</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.310" end="00:30:17.110" style="s2">unreasonable, I wouldn&#39;t have brought</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.710" end="00:30:19.210" style="s2">your designs to Frost Industries</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.110" end="00:30:20.810" style="s2">yesterday. You brought my designs over</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.210" end="00:30:22.310" style="s2">because you were sure Frost Industries</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.810" end="00:30:24.810" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t like them.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.310" end="00:30:27.310" style="s2">You&#39;re way too arrogant.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.810" end="00:30:28.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Stop arguing. Yesterday&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.310" end="00:30:30.110" style="s2">No more fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.710" end="00:30:32.410" style="s2">Whoever needs to reflect, reflect.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.110" end="00:30:35.410" style="s2">Whoever has work to do, get to it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.410" end="00:30:35.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, I&#39;m going to work.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.112" end="00:30:43.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, do you know about Ellie and her</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.812" end="00:30:46.112" style="s2">ex-boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.312" end="00:30:48.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I do. Ethan&#39;s a good man. Good</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.112" end="00:30:49.512" style="s2">family, good education, good job, and</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.112" end="00:30:50.212" style="s2">most importantly, he&#39;s never been to</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.512" end="00:30:51.512" style="s2">prison.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.212" end="00:30:53.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, he&#39;s never been to prison, but he</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.512" end="00:30:55.612" style="s2">cheats. You&#39;ve got life experience. Do</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.612" end="00:30:58.312" style="s2">you think a cheater is worth keeping?</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.612" end="00:31:00.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan cheated? Ellie never told me. When</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.312" end="00:31:00.812" style="s2">did this happen? How could Ethan do</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.012" end="00:31:03.112" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.812" end="00:31:05.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a few days ago. So you see, I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.112" end="00:31:08.012" style="s2">better choice, right?</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.612" end="00:31:09.712" style="s2">Why are you still hesitating?</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.012" end="00:31:12.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The cheater and the ex-con, neither</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.712" end="00:31:13.212" style="s2">one&#39;s worth keeping.</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.112" end="00:31:15.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.212" end="00:31:17.912" style="s2">I hear Ellie has a little brother.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.212" end="00:31:19.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. He&#39;s still in school.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.912" end="00:31:20.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you love your son?</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.212" end="00:31:22.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.712" end="00:31:24.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If one day your son broke the law to</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.212" end="00:31:25.412" style="s2">protect you and got locked up, would you</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.112" end="00:31:27.912" style="s2">think he still deserves to marry and</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.412" end="00:31:30.212" style="s2">have a family?</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.912" end="00:31:30.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course he does. He did it to protect</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.212" end="00:31:32.212" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.812" end="00:31:33.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If your son can,</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.212" end="00:31:34.612" style="s2">then so can I.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.312" end="00:31:36.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got locked up because you were</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.612" end="00:31:38.512" style="s2">protecting your mom?</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.912" end="00:31:41.486" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can question my family background or</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.512" end="00:31:42.912" style="s2">my job, but I swear I&#39;m a good man.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.486" end="00:31:45.112" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.912" end="00:31:46.912" style="s2">I&#39;d never do anything to hurt Ellie.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.112" end="00:31:48.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not bad in the looks department either.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.912" end="00:31:49.712" style="s2">It&#39;s just your circumstances are too</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.312" end="00:31:51.012" style="s2">poor to match my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.712" end="00:31:52.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, how much betrothal gift do you</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.012" end="00:31:54.312" style="s2">want? Name your number. I swear I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.912" end="00:31:55.912" style="s2">it together for you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.312" end="00:31:57.512" style="s2">I threw too much at her at once. No</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.912" end="00:31:59.112" style="s2">wonder she didn&#39;t believe me. I&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.512" end="00:32:01.912" style="s2">to trickle it out gradually.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.112" end="00:32:04.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It should at least be this much, right?</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.912" end="00:32:06.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. 800 grand. That&#39;s a good number,</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.912" end="00:32:08.712" style="s2">a lucky number. I&#39;ll have it sent right</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.412" end="00:32:08.712" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.212" end="00:32:17.212" style="s2">Mom, here&#39;s the betrothal gift you</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.512" end="00:32:21.312" style="s2">wanted. 800 grand. Count it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.212" end="00:32:22.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said 80,000, not 800 grand.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.312" end="00:32:25.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t expect that Ellie Hart was only</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.912" end="00:32:26.812" style="s2">worth 80,000 in her mom&#39;s heart.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.112" end="00:32:28.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you get all this money? It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.812" end="00:32:30.012" style="s2">clean money, right?</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.012" end="00:32:32.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I ran a small business before and</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.012" end="00:32:33.512" style="s2">saved up a little. Take this back and</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.012" end="00:32:34.512" style="s2">keep it for little Oliver&#39;s future bride</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.512" end="00:32:36.012" style="s2">price.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.512" end="00:32:38.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back in our village, all it takes is a</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.012" end="00:32:40.413" style="s2">couple of goats to bring home a bride.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.312" end="00:32:42.413" style="s2">How about I keep my 80,000 and you take</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.413" end="00:32:44.313" style="s2">the rest to buy a house with Ellie?</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.413" end="00:32:45.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you take it all. I already have a</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.313" end="00:32:46.413" style="s2">place. I&#39;ll take Ellie there before</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.813" end="00:32:48.013" style="s2">long.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.413" end="00:32:49.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.013" end="00:32:52.413" style="s2">And who&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.213" end="00:32:53.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s Ma&#39;am, I&#39;m a friend of Landon&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.413" end="00:32:54.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you do?</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.313" end="00:32:58.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m his assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.613" end="00:33:00.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, an errand boy.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.113" end="00:33:02.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure know a lot, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.113" end="00:33:04.513" style="s2">Mom, have some water.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.613" end="00:33:05.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, even though you gave me 800,000, I</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:06.713" style="s2">still have to wait until my daughter</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.613" end="00:33:08.113" style="s2">comes back and have a good talk with</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.713" end="00:33:09.413" style="s2">her. If you forced her into this</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.113" end="00:33:10.113" style="s2">marriage, then I don&#39;t want a single</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.413" end="00:33:11.713" style="s2">cent.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.113" end="00:33:12.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t force her. You&#39;ll see when she</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.713" end="00:33:14.513" style="s2">gets back.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.913" end="00:33:15.713" style="s2">Oh, by the way, who told you Ellie and I</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.513" end="00:33:17.813" style="s2">got married?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.713" end="00:33:19.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That cheater. Just saying his name gets</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.813" end="00:33:21.113" style="s2">me angry. My daughter was with him for</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.413" end="00:33:22.513" style="s2">two years doing his laundry and cooking,</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.113" end="00:33:24.013" style="s2">swallowing her pride, going along with</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.513" end="00:33:25.213" style="s2">everything, and then he went and found</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.013" end="00:33:26.813" style="s2">himself a mistress.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.213" end="00:33:27.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I really do have to thank him. If</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.813" end="00:33:29.613" style="s2">it weren&#39;t for him, Ellie and I would</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.813" end="00:33:31.413" style="s2">never have made it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.613" end="00:33:32.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know that guy is infertile?</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.413" end="00:33:33.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.113" end="00:33:35.313" style="s2">Ellie never told me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.213" end="00:33:37.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s infertile, and to spare his pride,</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.313" end="00:33:39.013" style="s2">I never even let my daughter tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.313" end="00:33:42.713" style="s2">Yet he still had the nerve to abandon</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.013" end="00:33:42.713" style="s2">her. He&#39;ll get what he deserves.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.113" end="00:33:53.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have someone look into Ethan Brooks. He</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.913" end="00:33:56.613" style="s2">suddenly called my mother-in-law over.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.613" end="00:33:56.613" style="s2">He might be up to something.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.713" end="00:34:00.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, since you&#39;ve taken on the Frost</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.413" end="00:34:01.913" style="s2">Industries project, do it well. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.313" end="00:34:03.413" style="s2">embarrass our company.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.913" end="00:34:05.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You called me here just to say that?</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.413" end="00:34:07.813" style="s2">Honestly, I really do dislike you,</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.813" end="00:34:10.013" style="s2">Director Cole. You were the mistress who</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.813" end="00:34:12.213" style="s2">stole my fiancé. How dare you dislike</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.013" end="00:34:14.913" style="s2">me? Besides, I handed the scumbag right</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.213" end="00:34:16.613" style="s2">to you. Shouldn&#39;t you be grateful to me?</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.913" end="00:34:18.213" style="s2">I have no idea what Ethan ever saw in</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.613" end="00:34:19.913" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.213" end="00:34:21.913" style="s2">Dating you for two years was practically</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.913" end="00:34:23.313" style="s2">a stain on his record.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.913" end="00:34:25.313" style="s2">If you like him that much, then marry</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.313" end="00:34:26.813" style="s2">him already before his cheating habit</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.313" end="00:34:29.413" style="s2">flares up and he sneaks off with someone</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.813" end="00:34:29.413" style="s2">else again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.913" end="00:34:36.113" style="s2">This is a fabric supplier we&#39;ve worked</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.313" end="00:34:37.613" style="s2">with long-term. They just got a batch of</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.113" end="00:34:39.513" style="s2">high-end polyester fabric with great</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.613" end="00:34:41.014" style="s2">wrinkle resistance. Reach out to their</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.513" end="00:34:42.914" style="s2">Mr. Vincent and see if you can close a</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.014" end="00:34:45.514" style="s2">deal at a good price. That way we cut</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.914" end="00:34:46.914" style="s2">costs and turn out better product.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.514" end="00:34:47.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;ll set up the meeting right</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.914" end="00:34:48.714" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.814" end="00:34:50.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie,</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.714" end="00:34:52.414" style="s2">I didn&#39;t really want to help you, but we</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.614" end="00:34:53.914" style="s2">already offended Frost Industries once</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.414" end="00:34:56.014" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.914" end="00:34:57.814" style="s2">We can&#39;t afford to do it again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.014" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. For my own sake, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.814" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">the most of this chance.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.214" end="00:35:06.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, what did our director want with</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.714" end="00:35:10.314" style="s2">you? She&#39;s definitely up to no good.</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.814" end="00:35:11.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She introduced me to a fabric supplier.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.314" end="00:35:14.014" style="s2">From what I can see, they&#39;ve worked with</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.914" end="00:35:15.414" style="s2">our company a few times.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.014" end="00:35:17.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would she be so nice and set you up</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.414" end="00:35:18.414" style="s2">with a fabric supplier? She&#39;s afraid</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.114" end="00:35:21.014" style="s2">that if I botch the deal, I&#39;d offend</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.414" end="00:35:22.914" style="s2">Frost Industries.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.014" end="00:35:24.314" style="s2">After all, we both represent the company</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.914" end="00:35:26.154" style="s2">and she&#39;s worried that if it goes south,</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.314" end="00:35:26.814" style="s2">the Frost would take it out on the firm.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.154" end="00:35:27.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.814" end="00:35:29.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woah, she actually has that much</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.914" end="00:35:30.514" style="s2">foresight?</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.214" end="00:35:31.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget about her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.514" end="00:35:35.314" style="s2">Even if she hadn&#39;t come to me today, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.914" end="00:35:35.314" style="s2">still have to visit these suppliers.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.014" end="00:35:45.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, the short drama&#39;s good, right?</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.114" end="00:35:47.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So good, so good. I&#39;ve never seen TV</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.714" end="00:35:48.214" style="s2">this good back in the mountains.</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.769" end="00:35:50.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.214" end="00:35:51.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, this is called a short drama. The</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.114" end="00:35:53.009" style="s2">dramas on this app are all funded by our</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.614" end="00:35:54.214" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.009" end="00:35:55.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.214" end="00:35:57.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.914" end="00:35:59.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I just scare Mom again?</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.914" end="00:36:00.914" style="s2">I meant the dramas on this app are all</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.214" end="00:36:02.414" style="s2">amazing. Just open any one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.914" end="00:36:04.114" style="s2">They&#39;re all wonderful.</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.414" end="00:36:05.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, can I take this with me when I</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.114" end="00:36:07.714" style="s2">leave?</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.714" end="00:36:09.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Ellie&#39;s almost off work. How</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.714" end="00:36:10.614" style="s2">about I go pick her up now?</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.114" end="00:36:12.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go with you. I&#39;ve never seen where</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.614" end="00:36:14.614" style="s2">my daughter worked.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.314" end="00:36:14.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.714" end="00:36:21.514" style="s2">Ellie, it&#39;s always been your director</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.014" end="00:36:23.214" style="s2">Cole dealing with me before. This is the</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.514" end="00:36:25.214" style="s2">first time I&#39;ve met you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.214" end="00:36:26.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vincent, though this is our first</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.214" end="00:36:28.514" style="s2">time meeting, I&#39;ve long heard of your</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.714" end="00:36:30.345" style="s2">name. Let me toast to you with this</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.514" end="00:36:32.365" style="s2">glass.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.345" end="00:36:32.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.414" end="00:36:39.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Ellie?</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.414" end="00:36:41.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her assistant said she went to see a</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.514" end="00:36:43.714" style="s2">fabric supplier. She went to a business</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.114" end="00:36:46.816" style="s2">dinner without even telling me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.714" end="00:36:46.816" style="s2">Mom, let me call her to confirm.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.116" end="00:36:50.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.916" end="00:36:51.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, your director Cole has told me</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.116" end="00:36:52.916" style="s2">about you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.916" end="00:36:54.016" style="s2">She said she brought you in during</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.916" end="00:36:55.516" style="s2">campus recruiting.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.016" end="00:36:57.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Back then she didn&#39;t really want</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.516" end="00:36:58.516" style="s2">to hire me, but our mutual HR person</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.216" end="00:36:59.916" style="s2">found out we&#39;re from the same hometown</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.516" end="00:37:01.716" style="s2">and talked her into taking me on.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.916" end="00:37:03.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. I heard Frost Industries like</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.716" end="00:37:05.216" style="s2">your designs. You&#39;re really talented.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.716" end="00:37:06.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You flatter me, Mr. Vincent.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.216" end="00:37:07.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie,</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.116" end="00:37:09.116" style="s2">you&#39;re so pretty.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.616" end="00:37:11.416" style="s2">I bet a lot of the men at your company</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.116" end="00:37:13.516" style="s2">chase after you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.416" end="00:37:17.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vincent, I&#39;m already married.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.516" end="00:37:18.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, that&#39;s fine. I&#39;m married, too.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.016" end="00:37:20.816" style="s2">Ellie, keep me company tonight and</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.816" end="00:37:22.616" style="s2">tomorrow we can sign the contract. I can</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.816" end="00:37:23.616" style="s2">give you my best price.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.616" end="00:37:26.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vincent, I think you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.616" end="00:37:27.716" style="s2">misunderstood.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.316" end="00:37:29.516" style="s2">Yes, I do want to close the deal at a</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.716" end="00:37:30.716" style="s2">better price, but I won&#39;t sell myself</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.516" end="00:37:34.116" style="s2">for it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.716" end="00:37:34.116" style="s2">Mr. Vincent, I&#39;ll take my leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.316" end="00:37:43.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, you&#39;re still too young, but I</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.316" end="00:37:45.516" style="s2">like young ones like you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.716" end="00:37:48.291" style="s2">Let&#39;s have some fun tonight. Tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.516" end="00:37:50.311" style="s2">I&#39;ll sign the contract with you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.291" end="00:37:50.311" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.216" end="00:37:57.316" style="s2">Why won&#39;t Ellie&#39;s phone connect?</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.116" end="00:38:01.916" style="s2">Eric, get someone to track my wife&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.316" end="00:38:04.216" style="s2">phone right now. I can&#39;t reach her.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.916" end="00:38:04.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.016" end="00:38:11.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My daughter&#39;s not in trouble, is she?</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.316" end="00:38:11.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll find her soon.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.516" end="00:38:18.916" style="s2">Vanessa, I&#39;ve gotten Ellie into bed just</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.416" end="00:38:21.116" style="s2">like you instructed.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.916" end="00:38:23.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Take plenty of racy photos of her</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.116" end="00:38:24.816" style="s2">and send them to me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.216" end="00:38:26.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bet. That little thing&#39;s married,</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.816" end="00:38:29.416" style="s2">but she still looks fresh and tender.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.416" end="00:38:30.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You old pervert, just go get it done.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.416" end="00:38:33.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, hello there, my little beauty.</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.916" end="00:38:33.616" style="s2">Here I come.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.726" end="00:38:41.816" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.416" end="00:38:43.116" style="s2">The tracker shows our lady is in this</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.816" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.116" end="00:38:46.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My poor daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.516" end="00:38:49.117" style="s2">She has no power, no connections. She</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.516" end="00:38:50.617" style="s2">came to this big city all on her own.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.117" end="00:38:52.517" style="s2">Seeing her get bullied while I can&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.617" end="00:38:53.417" style="s2">a thing, I&#39;m so useless.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.517" end="00:38:56.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eric, take good care of my</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.417" end="00:38:56.517" style="s2">mother-in-law. Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.617" end="00:39:06.217" style="s2">Who the hell is it?</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.617" end="00:39:14.317" style="s2">You dare touch my woman?</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.417" end="00:39:14.317" style="s2">Are you asking to die?</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.617" end="00:39:18.417" style="s2">Who the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.817" end="00:39:23.117" style="s2">Listen up. This is Landon Frost, the CEO</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.417" end="00:39:26.517" style="s2">of Frost Industries. They call him the</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.117" end="00:39:28.417" style="s2">second master of the Frost family.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.517" end="00:39:31.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow, my head hurts so much.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.417" end="00:39:31.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.017" end="00:39:35.517" style="s2">Hey buddy, I had no idea Ellie belonged</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.717" end="00:39:37.517" style="s2">to the second master. Nobody ever told</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.517" end="00:39:38.917" style="s2">me. Even with 100 times the courage, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.517" end="00:39:42.117" style="s2">never have dared mess with that.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.917" end="00:39:44.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save that speech for the police.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.117" end="00:39:46.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m pregnant with Mr. Vincent&#39;s baby. I</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.417" end="00:39:48.817" style="s2">have to have it so I can claim a share</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.317" end="00:39:50.217" style="s2">of the Vincent estate later. For now, I</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.817" end="00:39:51.617" style="s2">need to find some sucker to take the</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.217" end="00:39:53.717" style="s2">fall.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.617" end="00:39:55.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa, what&#39;s that in your hand?</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.717" end="00:39:57.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, I missed my period this month, so</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.417" end="00:39:58.917" style="s2">I went to the hospital for a check.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.417" end="00:40:01.117" style="s2">Turns out I&#39;m pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.917" end="00:40:01.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.717" end="00:40:08.117" style="s2">We&#39;ve barely done it a few times. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.117" end="00:40:10.217" style="s2">that easy to get knocked up?</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.117" end="00:40:12.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It just shows how virile you are.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.217" end="00:40:14.517" style="s2">You got me pregnant just like that.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.517" end="00:40:16.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s wonderful. My mom dreams of being</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.517" end="00:40:17.717" style="s2">a grandma. Vanessa, let&#39;s get married.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.117" end="00:40:19.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm, we need to hold the wedding quickly</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.717" end="00:40:20.317" style="s2">before my belly gets big and the wedding</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.217" end="00:40:21.517" style="s2">suit stops looking good.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.317" end="00:40:23.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, yeah. Don&#39;t worry about the</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.517" end="00:40:24.917" style="s2">wedding. My parents will handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.317" end="00:40:26.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the bride price?</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.917" end="00:40:28.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember my parents saved some money</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.217" end="00:40:29.617" style="s2">for retirement. I&#39;ll have them use it as</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.217" end="00:40:31.617" style="s2">your bride price.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.617" end="00:40:34.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, you&#39;re so good to me. I knew I</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.617" end="00:40:34.517" style="s2">picked the right man.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.217" end="00:40:41.217" style="s2">I actually dreamed my husband was the</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.617" end="00:40:43.178" style="s2">second young master of the Frost family.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.217" end="00:40:43.417" style="s2">What a beautiful dream.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.178" end="00:40:45.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.417" end="00:40:47.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, you&#39;re awake. Does anything feel</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.217" end="00:40:49.317" style="s2">off? Should I call the doctor in?</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.817" end="00:40:50.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.317" end="00:40:51.718" style="s2">Ellie, you slept right through</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.318" end="00:40:52.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the whole night. Thank goodness you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.718" end="00:40:54.018" style="s2">awake.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.718" end="00:40:55.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.018" end="00:40:57.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks to Landon, or else that old man</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.818" end="00:40:59.618" style="s2">would have ruined you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.718" end="00:41:00.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last night the drink I had last night</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.618" end="00:41:02.318" style="s2">was spiked.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.918" end="00:41:04.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all over. That Vincent guy has been</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.318" end="00:41:06.818" style="s2">taken in by the police. Ellie, from now</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.118" end="00:41:08.218" style="s2">on don&#39;t go to business dinners alone.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.818" end="00:41:09.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you getting up? Lie back down.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.218" end="00:41:09.618" style="s2">Let me go call the doctor to check on</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.418" end="00:41:12.218" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.618" end="00:41:13.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine now. I can go home.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.218" end="00:41:13.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re worried about the hospital bill,</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.218" end="00:41:15.118" style="s2">aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.718" end="00:41:16.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon, we haven&#39;t bought a house yet</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.118" end="00:41:17.718" style="s2">and we haven&#39;t had a wedding. Do you</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.218" end="00:41:18.818" style="s2">know how much all of that costs?</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.718" end="00:41:20.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll worry about all of that. You lie</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.818" end="00:41:22.518" style="s2">down now. I&#39;ll go call the doctor to</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.018" end="00:41:22.518" style="s2">check on you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.318" end="00:41:25.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, who called you here? Let me guess.</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.718" end="00:41:26.918" style="s2">Was it Ethan?</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.518" end="00:41:28.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm. Landon told me everything. Ethan</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.918" end="00:41:29.718" style="s2">had a mistress on the side, then here I</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.218" end="00:41:31.018" style="s2">thought he&#39;d be a fine son-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.718" end="00:41:31.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not sad anymore. Landon&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.018" end="00:41:33.118" style="s2">really good to me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.718" end="00:41:35.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see that he really cares about</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.118" end="00:41:36.818" style="s2">you. Oh, by the way, he gave me 800,000</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.118" end="00:41:40.318" style="s2">as bride price yesterday. Is his family</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.818" end="00:41:40.318" style="s2">that rich? Have you met his parents?</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.418" end="00:41:46.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello? Boss, I&#39;ve sent Ethan&#39;s files to</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.218" end="00:41:48.618" style="s2">your inbox. He&#39;s from an ordinary family</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.918" end="00:41:50.018" style="s2">with an ordinary job. He has low sperm</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.618" end="00:41:51.318" style="s2">count, but he doesn&#39;t know it himself.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.018" end="00:41:52.818" style="s2">His girlfriend is our lady&#39;s boss. Her</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.318" end="00:41:54.018" style="s2">name&#39;s Vanessa Cole and she&#39;s a relative</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.818" end="00:41:55.418" style="s2">of the styling house&#39;s owner.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.018" end="00:41:56.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.418" end="00:41:58.218" style="s2">Oh, and that fat guy who bullied our</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.718" end="00:41:59.918" style="s2">lady last night said Vanessa put him up</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.218" end="00:42:01.118" style="s2">to it. I couldn&#39;t figure out why a big</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.918" end="00:42:02.318" style="s2">shot would take orders from her, so I</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.118" end="00:42:03.418" style="s2">followed that lead and found the two of</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.318" end="00:42:04.918" style="s2">them are having an affair.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.418" end="00:42:05.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go collect evidence. It&#39;ll come in handy</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.918" end="00:42:05.918" style="s2">later.</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.318" end="00:42:07.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.918" end="00:42:09.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you met his parents?</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.518" end="00:42:10.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, we&#39;re not that close yet. If you</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.618" end="00:42:12.918" style="s2">hadn&#39;t traveled all this way, he</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.618" end="00:42:14.218" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t even know about my family.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.918" end="00:42:15.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really can&#39;t understand you young</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.218" end="00:42:16.618" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.218" end="00:42:17.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you and dad married after meeting</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.618" end="00:42:19.618" style="s2">just one time?</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.818" end="00:42:21.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, your dad and I married after one</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.618" end="00:42:23.518" style="s2">meeting, but at least our two families</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.618" end="00:42:25.818" style="s2">knew each other inside out.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.518" end="00:42:26.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both families were dead broke, so what</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.818" end="00:42:27.918" style="s2">does it matter whether we knew each</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.818" end="00:42:31.418" style="s2">other or not?</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.918" end="00:42:32.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh. What you say actually makes sense.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.418" end="00:42:34.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our family&#39;s so poor that even if I</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.818" end="00:42:35.718" style="s2">married a man with my eyes closed, it&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.418" end="00:42:37.718" style="s2">still be marrying up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.718" end="00:42:39.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say that. I had a fortune teller</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.718" end="00:42:42.018" style="s2">read your fortune and he said you have</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.118" end="00:42:43.318" style="s2">good luck and will enjoy a blessed life.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.018" end="00:42:44.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, back then I trusted your words too</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.318" end="00:42:46.918" style="s2">much, which is why I catered to Ethan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:48.418" style="s2">every whim. Now I&#39;ve seen the light.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.918" end="00:42:50.718" style="s2">Relying on yourself beats relying on any</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.418" end="00:42:50.718" style="s2">man.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.920" end="00:42:59.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.720" end="00:43:04.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife can be discharged, but from</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.820" end="00:43:05.820" style="s2">here on, be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.720" end="00:43:07.920" style="s2">If you two are planning to have</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.820" end="00:43:10.220" style="s2">children, she mustn&#39;t take random</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.920" end="00:43:13.220" style="s2">medication.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.220" end="00:43:13.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, we&#39;ll be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.020" end="00:43:21.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, your dad called and asked me to</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.820" end="00:43:22.920" style="s2">come home. I&#39;ll have to leave this</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.120" end="00:43:24.920" style="s2">afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.920" end="00:43:26.820" style="s2">As for you and Landon, since you two</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.920" end="00:43:29.020" style="s2">truly care for each other, we elders</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.820" end="00:43:31.020" style="s2">won&#39;t stand in your way, but the proper</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.020" end="00:43:33.220" style="s2">formalities still have to happen.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.020" end="00:43:35.020" style="s2">Landon, come to our place another day to</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.220" end="00:43:36.920" style="s2">formally ask for our daughter&#39;s hand,</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.020" end="00:43:38.820" style="s2">and then we&#39;ll discuss the wedding. Even</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.920" end="00:43:40.320" style="s2">though our family&#39;s poor, we still need</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.820" end="00:43:41.320" style="s2">a proper wedding when giving away our</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.320" end="00:43:43.520" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.320" end="00:43:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, mom. I&#39;ll come over soon to ask for</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.520" end="00:43:46.720" style="s2">her hand and set the wedding date.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.120" end="00:43:50.620" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.020" end="00:43:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vincent, my brother had something look</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.620" end="00:43:53.720" style="s2">into you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.520" end="00:43:55.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you? And who&#39;s your brother? Why</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.720" end="00:43:57.420" style="s2">is your brother investigating me?</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.220" end="00:43:59.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Marcus Frost of Frost Industries.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.420" end="00:44:00.820" style="s2">My brother&#39;s name is Landon Frost.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.120" end="00:44:02.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, why is your brother</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.820" end="00:44:04.320" style="s2">investigating me? What does he want?</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.620" end="00:44:05.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s with your ex now, so he wants to go</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.320" end="00:44:06.720" style="s2">after you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.520" end="00:44:08.520" style="s2">If you still want to stay on your feet</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.720" end="00:44:09.120" style="s2">in Riverside, you need to come up with a</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.520" end="00:44:11.220" style="s2">plan.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.120" end="00:44:11.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just a nobody. What could I possibly</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.220" end="00:44:13.220" style="s2">do?</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.620" end="00:44:14.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s going to Ellie&#39;s hometown to ask</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.220" end="00:44:17.620" style="s2">for her hand next week. That might be</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.920" end="00:44:17.620" style="s2">your chance.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.420" end="00:44:23.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, Ethan and I are getting married.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.520" end="00:44:25.020" style="s2">Here&#39;s the invitation.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.020" end="00:44:25.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll see if I&#39;m free then.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.020" end="00:44:27.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.820" end="00:44:27.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you taking your husband back to your</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.020" end="00:44:29.020" style="s2">hometown?</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.820" end="00:44:30.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know I&#39;m taking my husband to</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.020" end="00:44:31.820" style="s2">my hometown?</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.220" end="00:44:33.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that hard to guess? You eloped</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.820" end="00:44:34.420" style="s2">without telling your family. Now that</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.320" end="00:44:35.420" style="s2">you&#39;ve got the marriage license, of</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.420" end="00:44:36.520" style="s2">course you&#39;d bring him home to meet</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.420" end="00:44:38.220" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.520" end="00:44:39.820" style="s2">Director Cole, that Mr. Vincent you</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.220" end="00:44:41.020" style="s2">introduced me to yesterday, do you know</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.820" end="00:44:42.420" style="s2">him well?</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.020" end="00:44:45.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vincent and I only deal with each</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.420" end="00:44:45.920" style="s2">other professionally, not close.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.120" end="00:44:47.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.920" end="00:44:49.220" style="s2">aren&#39;t you curious about what happened</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.120" end="00:44:50.820" style="s2">between him and me last night?</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.220" end="00:44:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vincent&#39;s phone has been dead since</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.820" end="00:44:54.220" style="s2">last night. I wonder whether things</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.720" end="00:44:55.621" style="s2">worked out or not.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.220" end="00:44:56.621" style="s2">Did you close the price deal with Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.621" end="00:44:57.721" style="s2">Vincent?</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.621" end="00:44:59.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.721" end="00:45:00.421" style="s2">But this morning, Mr. Vincent&#39;s wife got</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.121" end="00:45:01.321" style="s2">in touch with me and gave me his best</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.421" end="00:45:02.521" style="s2">price.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.321" end="00:45:03.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you get in contact with Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.521" end="00:45:05.121" style="s2">Vincent&#39;s wife?</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.221" end="00:45:07.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That curious, are you? Then go ask Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.121" end="00:45:08.821" style="s2">Vincent&#39;s wife yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.321" end="00:45:10.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That Vincent guy was bailed out by his</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.821" end="00:45:12.321" style="s2">wife and taken away.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.321" end="00:45:13.721" style="s2">He dumped all the blame onto Vanessa,</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.321" end="00:45:15.221" style="s2">and he provided their call records as</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.721" end="00:45:17.321" style="s2">proof.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.221" end="00:45:18.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That woman, Vanessa, how is she so</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.321" end="00:45:19.921" style="s2">vicious?</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.621" end="00:45:21.821" style="s2">I meant to use this to have her locked</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.921" end="00:45:23.221" style="s2">up, but it turned out she&#39;s pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.821" end="00:45:24.621" style="s2">Our law grants special leniency to</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.221" end="00:45:26.021" style="s2">pregnant women.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.621" end="00:45:28.121" style="s2">Whose baby is it?</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.021" end="00:45:29.521" style="s2">Ethan&#39;s infertile, so her baby&#39;s father</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.121" end="00:45:31.721" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t happen to be that Vincent guy,</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.521" end="00:45:33.621" style="s2">would it? I&#39;ll go check.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.721" end="00:45:36.121" style="s2">If the baby is Vincent&#39;s, then I have an</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.621" end="00:45:36.121" style="s2">idea.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.121" end="00:45:41.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fully recovered now. I want to see</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.521" end="00:45:44.821" style="s2">my daughter-in-law. Take me to her house</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.821" end="00:45:44.821" style="s2">this very moment.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.621" end="00:45:50.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.121" end="00:45:51.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know why, but my left eyelid</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.621" end="00:45:53.121" style="s2">keeps twitching.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.721" end="00:45:54.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Left eye twitches mean money&#39;s coming,</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.121" end="00:45:55.121" style="s2">Ellie. You&#39;re about to get rich.</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.961" end="00:45:56.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.121" end="00:45:58.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think it&#39;s not money coming, but pure</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.721" end="00:45:59.421" style="s2">exhaustion.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.121" end="00:46:02.021" style="s2">I can&#39;t take it. I need to take some</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.421" end="00:46:02.021" style="s2">time off.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.786" end="00:46:06.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.621" end="00:46:09.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is where my son and</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.921" end="00:46:11.121" style="s2">daughter-in-law live?</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.421" end="00:46:13.321" style="s2">My son grew up with a silver spoon in</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.121" end="00:46:14.921" style="s2">his mouth. How can he bear such a hard</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.321" end="00:46:16.121" style="s2">life? The second master spent half a</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.921" end="00:46:17.887" style="s2">year in prison. He&#39;s probably been</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.121" end="00:46:18.821" style="s2">through a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.887" end="00:46:21.221" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.821" end="00:46:22.521" style="s2">It&#39;s all my fault. If not for me, my son</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.221" end="00:46:24.121" style="s2">never would have gone to prison.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.521" end="00:46:25.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, please don&#39;t say that. I heard</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.121" end="00:46:27.221" style="s2">the second master and his lady met in</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.521" end="00:46:30.421" style="s2">prison. If he hadn&#39;t gone to prison, I</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.221" end="00:46:30.421" style="s2">doubt he would have married so quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.921" end="00:46:34.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.921" end="00:46:37.421" style="s2">I can&#39;t wait to meet my daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.921" end="00:46:39.021" style="s2">She must be someone kind and lovely.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.421" end="00:46:40.621" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;ll be twice as good to</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.021" end="00:46:41.421" style="s2">her so she knows she married the right</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.621" end="00:46:43.021" style="s2">man.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.421" end="00:46:44.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, it seems the second master never</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.021" end="00:46:45.921" style="s2">told his lady about our family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.221" end="00:46:48.221" style="s2">background, and you came over without</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.921" end="00:46:50.321" style="s2">telling him. Won&#39;t that be a problem?</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.221" end="00:46:52.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son&#39;s never been in love. He has no</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.321" end="00:46:53.721" style="s2">idea how to spoil a wife.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.321" end="00:46:55.922" style="s2">I&#39;m done waiting for him to catch a</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.721" end="00:46:58.723" style="s2">clue, so I&#39;ll be the one to spoil my</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.922" end="00:46:58.723" style="s2">daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.622" end="00:47:08.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You! Who are you? Why are you in my</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.122" end="00:47:08.622" style="s2">house?</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.023" end="00:47:12.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must be Ellie, right? I&#39;m so sorry I</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.223" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">didn&#39;t let you know before showing up at</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.622" end="00:47:16.422" style="s2">your place.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.422" end="00:47:17.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, you don&#39;t look like a bad person,</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.422" end="00:47:19.323" style="s2">but how could you just barge into</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.723" end="00:47:21.523" style="s2">someone&#39;s home? Don&#39;t you know that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.323" end="00:47:24.023" style="s2">against the law?</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.523" end="00:47:25.922" style="s2">And how did you get in?</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.023" end="00:47:28.122" style="s2">How do you have a key to my place?</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.922" end="00:47:29.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, we had your landlord let us in.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.122" end="00:47:31.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.422" end="00:47:33.323" style="s2">You&#39;re calling me ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.223" end="00:47:34.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am. My mistress was so eager to</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.323" end="00:47:36.323" style="s2">meet you that she didn&#39;t let you know in</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.622" end="00:47:37.823" style="s2">advance.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.323" end="00:47:40.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and Landon</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.823" end="00:47:42.723" style="s2">you look so much alike.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.023" end="00:47:45.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you be Ellie? I&#39;m Landon&#39;s mother,</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.723" end="00:47:45.622" style="s2">your mother-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.723" end="00:47:48.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, Landon never told me you were</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.223" end="00:47:50.823" style="s2">coming.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.922" end="00:47:52.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been at the care home. He has no</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.823" end="00:47:54.122" style="s2">idea I came to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.823" end="00:47:55.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you unwell?</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.122" end="00:47:57.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been sick for half a year, but I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.823" end="00:47:59.523" style="s2">much better now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.323" end="00:48:01.422" style="s2">Seeing you makes me especially happy.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.523" end="00:48:03.323" style="s2">Ellie, you&#39;re exactly what I imagined.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.422" end="00:48:05.223" style="s2">My son is truly to have married you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.323" end="00:48:07.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Judging by her mother-in-law&#39;s dress and</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.223" end="00:48:09.422" style="s2">manner, she doesn&#39;t seem like an</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.122" end="00:48:11.723" style="s2">ordinary person.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.422" end="00:48:13.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, this is a gift for you. There are</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.723" end="00:48:15.223" style="s2">80 million in it, a thank you for</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.622" end="00:48:18.523" style="s2">calling me mom.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.223" end="00:48:19.422" style="s2">From now on, no more calling me auntie.</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.523" end="00:48:21.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 80 million?</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.422" end="00:48:22.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm. It&#39;s just a small token. Landon</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.622" end="00:48:23.723" style="s2">will give you your bride price</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.723" end="00:48:27.723" style="s2">separately.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.723" end="00:48:30.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, is your family really that rich?</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.723" end="00:48:31.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eric, I need to find time to take Ellie</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.023" end="00:48:33.023" style="s2">back to her hometown to formally ask for</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.823" end="00:48:34.723" style="s2">her hand.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.023" end="00:48:35.922" style="s2">We&#39;re already married on paper, but the</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.723" end="00:48:36.922" style="s2">proper etiquette still has to be</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.922" end="00:48:38.622" style="s2">observed.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.922" end="00:48:39.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. I&#39;ll have the gifts prepared</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.622" end="00:48:41.323" style="s2">right away.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.723" end="00:48:43.922" style="s2">Her relatives probably all know I did</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.323" end="00:48:45.523" style="s2">time, so we can&#39;t keep it low key.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.922" end="00:48:47.823" style="s2">I refuse to let Ellie lose face back in</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.523" end="00:48:49.323" style="s2">her village. Then I&#39;ll bring extra staff</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.823" end="00:48:50.823" style="s2">and extra gifts.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.323" end="00:48:53.023" style="s2">I promise the hates will hold their</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.823" end="00:48:54.523" style="s2">heads high through the whole village.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.023" end="00:48:58.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.523" end="00:49:00.224" style="s2">Mom, is your family really that rich?</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.023" end="00:49:02.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hasn&#39;t that boy Landon told you?</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.224" end="00:49:03.924" style="s2">The Frosts have been Riverside&#39;s richest</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.024" end="00:49:05.124" style="s2">family for over a decade.</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.924" end="00:49:06.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Land?</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.124" end="00:49:07.724" style="s2">He&#39;s the second master of Frost</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.524" end="00:49:09.624" style="s2">Industries?</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.724" end="00:49:11.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, don&#39;t blame Landon for not</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.624" end="00:49:12.924" style="s2">telling you. He was probably afraid of</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.524" end="00:49:15.524" style="s2">scaring you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.924" end="00:49:16.824" style="s2">He never meant to hide it from you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.524" end="00:49:17.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have a place to stay?</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.824" end="00:49:19.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.424" end="00:49:21.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should move in with me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.024" end="00:49:22.624" style="s2">Whatever reason you went to prison, now</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.024" end="00:49:25.024" style="s2">that we&#39;re married, I hope you turn over</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.624" end="00:49:26.124" style="s2">a new leaf and start fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.024" end="00:49:27.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, sure.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.124" end="00:49:29.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought he came from a poor</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.324" end="00:49:31.224" style="s2">background, so I insisted he move into</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.524" end="00:49:33.624" style="s2">my rented apartment with me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.224" end="00:49:35.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your place?</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.624" end="00:49:37.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m renting it. I can&#39;t afford to buy a</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.524" end="00:49:39.624" style="s2">house yet.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.324" end="00:49:40.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This rundown place is rented?</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.624" end="00:49:41.524" style="s2">Ellie, you</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.124" end="00:49:43.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you looking down on me for being</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.524" end="00:49:44.924" style="s2">poor? You&#39;re not exactly capable</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.424" end="00:49:47.124" style="s2">yourself. How can you look down on</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.924" end="00:49:49.124" style="s2">anyone else?</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.124" end="00:49:51.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said I&#39;m not capable?</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.124" end="00:49:52.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What skills do you have? You just got</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.024" end="00:49:54.024" style="s2">out of prison.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.424" end="00:49:56.824" style="s2">Right now you probably can&#39;t even land a</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.024" end="00:49:56.824" style="s2">decent job.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.824" end="00:50:01.424" style="s2">Since you don&#39;t want me supporting you,</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.024" end="00:50:03.924" style="s2">you&#39;ll have to earn your own keep.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.424" end="00:50:06.824" style="s2">To help him stand on his own, I signed</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.924" end="00:50:09.724" style="s2">him up as a delivery rider.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.824" end="00:50:12.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, don&#39;t be angry. When Landon gets</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.724" end="00:50:15.524" style="s2">back, I&#39;ll give him a piece of my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.624" end="00:50:17.424" style="s2">How dare he hide his identity from his</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.524" end="00:50:19.924" style="s2">own wife?</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.424" end="00:50:19.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re awake.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.824" end="00:50:23.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you dressed like this? This suit</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.324" end="00:50:25.024" style="s2">looks crazy expensive. Where&#39;d you get</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.924" end="00:50:26.024" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.024" end="00:50:27.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t I say this morning I had a</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.024" end="00:50:29.924" style="s2">surprise for you? The truth is I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.924" end="00:50:32.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You found a new job? A security guard or</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.924" end="00:50:33.424" style="s2">a sales rep?</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.124" end="00:50:34.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I be the CEO of the whole</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.424" end="00:50:36.924" style="s2">corporation?</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.624" end="00:50:39.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The truth is Landon never meant to hide</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.924" end="00:50:40.524" style="s2">his real identity from me. I was the one</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.224" end="00:50:42.324" style="s2">who never believed him.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.524" end="00:50:44.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t yell at him. It&#39;s not his</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.324" end="00:50:46.924" style="s2">fault. He didn&#39;t hide it on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.724" end="00:50:48.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as you don&#39;t resent him.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.924" end="00:50:50.924" style="s2">Ellie, now that you know about our</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.624" end="00:50:54.024" style="s2">family, can you and Landon move into the</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.924" end="00:50:54.024" style="s2">Frost manor tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.424" end="00:50:58.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, maybe we can talk about it when</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.224" end="00:50:59.424" style="s2">Landon comes back. Or should I call him</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.524" end="00:51:01.924" style="s2">right now?</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.424" end="00:51:01.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.824" end="00:51:05.825" style="s2">Landon, your is here.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.925" end="00:51:06.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.825" end="00:51:08.625" style="s2">Mom went to our place?</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.925" end="00:51:10.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mom says your family is Riverside&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.625" end="00:51:11.625" style="s2">richest and that you&#39;re the second</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.125" end="00:51:14.125" style="s2">master of the Frosts.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.625" end="00:51:16.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t think my mom is crazy, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.125" end="00:51:20.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I&#39;m just laying out back in</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.025" end="00:51:20.125" style="s2">In your eyes, I&#39;m just an idiot, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.825" end="00:51:24.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Landon says he&#39;s on his way back.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.025" end="00:51:27.125" style="s2">Let me brew you some tea.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.425" end="00:51:30.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, sit and talk with me a while. The</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.125" end="00:51:31.925" style="s2">more I look at you, the more I like you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.125" end="00:51:34.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, my family is poor.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.925" end="00:51:35.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, but what does that matter? Now</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.125" end="00:51:37.425" style="s2">that you&#39;ve married into our family,</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.725" end="00:51:39.125" style="s2">Landon&#39;s money is your money.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.425" end="00:51:41.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you really don&#39;t look down on me?</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.125" end="00:51:43.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I look down on you? My son has</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.325" end="00:51:44.025" style="s2">been to prison and you never look down</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.125" end="00:51:45.625" style="s2">on him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.025" end="00:51:47.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s partly because Landon had been to</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.625" end="00:51:48.625" style="s2">prison that I never believed he was</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.125" end="00:51:51.025" style="s2">rich. Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.625" end="00:51:52.425" style="s2">if Landon is so rich, why did he end up</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.025" end="00:51:54.725" style="s2">in prison?</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.425" end="00:51:54.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.425" end="00:52:01.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why are you here? Why didn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.525" end="00:52:03.325" style="s2">tell me you were coming?</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.625" end="00:52:04.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you were staying here and I</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.325" end="00:52:06.625" style="s2">figured you&#39;d hidden your real identity</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.825" end="00:52:07.425" style="s2">from Ellie. How could you keep it from</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.625" end="00:52:09.025" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.425" end="00:52:10.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, he did tell me he was rich. I just</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.025" end="00:52:11.525" style="s2">didn&#39;t believe him. Please don&#39;t scold</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.525" end="00:52:13.625" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.525" end="00:52:15.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. This is the last time. No more</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.625" end="00:52:16.925" style="s2">deceiving Ellie and move her out right</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.125" end="00:52:18.225" style="s2">away. You&#39;re the CEO of Frost</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.925" end="00:52:19.525" style="s2">Industries. How can you let Ellie</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.225" end="00:52:21.225" style="s2">struggle in a place like this?</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.525" end="00:52:22.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, yes. I&#39;ll have someone move us</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.225" end="00:52:24.625" style="s2">right now. But let me correct you on one</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.925" end="00:52:26.425" style="s2">thing. Living here with Ellie doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.625" end="00:52:28.325" style="s2">feel hard at all. I&#39;ve never known this</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.425" end="00:52:30.025" style="s2">simple kind of happiness before.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.325" end="00:52:31.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve had enough of it. Now it&#39;s time</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.025" end="00:52:32.625" style="s2">to take Ellie off to enjoy the good</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.625" end="00:52:33.625" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.625" end="00:52:35.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.625" end="00:52:36.625" style="s2">Mrs. Frost,</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.025" end="00:52:38.525" style="s2">I now formally invite you to move into</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.625" end="00:52:41.225" style="s2">the Frost manor with me and start our</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.525" end="00:52:41.225" style="s2">new life together.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.025" end="00:52:49.725" style="s2">Honey, this is our home from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.425" end="00:52:51.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I dreaming?</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.725" end="00:52:53.125" style="s2">Isn&#39;t the Cinderella story supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.125" end="00:52:54.725" style="s2">only exist in fairy tales?</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.125" end="00:52:56.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon, what do you even see in me?</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.725" end="00:52:58.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say it&#39;s because I am pretty. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.525" end="00:52:59.725" style="s2">been to your company. Any random female</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.025" end="00:53:01.525" style="s2">employee there is prettier than me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.725" end="00:53:03.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks are only one part of it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.525" end="00:53:04.725" style="s2">Don&#39;t you think we just fit together in</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.425" end="00:53:04.827" style="s2">life and in bed?</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.725" end="00:53:08.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.827" end="00:53:08.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; get it. You can shut up now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.727" end="00:53:13.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, neither my mother nor I care</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.227" end="00:53:14.427" style="s2">about matching social standing.</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.127" end="00:53:15.727" style="s2">So don&#39;t worry about us looking down on</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.427" end="00:53:18.527" style="s2">you or your family.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.727" end="00:53:18.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about your father?</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.627" end="00:53:22.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His father is dead.</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.427" end="00:53:24.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.727" end="00:53:26.427" style="s2">Don&#39;t you have an older brother?</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.327" end="00:53:28.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I have an older son, but the two</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.427" end="00:53:30.627" style="s2">brothers live their own separate lives</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.527" end="00:53:31.527" style="s2">and stay out of each other&#39;s way.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.627" end="00:53:33.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.527" end="00:53:33.927" style="s2">So who&#39;s in charge of Frost Industries</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.027" end="00:53:36.227" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.927" end="00:53:37.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your husband. Me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.227" end="00:53:39.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, aren&#39;t you something? You got out</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.927" end="00:53:40.327" style="s2">of prison and snatched the company out</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.227" end="00:53:41.827" style="s2">of your brother&#39;s hands?</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.327" end="00:53:43.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not really snatching. Landon was</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.827" end="00:53:44.827" style="s2">always the one running the company. His</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.427" end="00:53:46.527" style="s2">brother couldn&#39;t handle it. He nearly</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.827" end="00:53:48.327" style="s2">drove the company bankrupt.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.527" end="00:53:49.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, you&#39;re that impressive?</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.327" end="00:53:50.927" style="s2">I really couldn&#39;t see greatness before</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.527" end="00:53:51.427" style="s2">my eyes. I took you for a security</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.927" end="00:53:52.527" style="s2">guard.</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.427" end="00:53:55.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.527" end="00:53:56.727" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;ve got your back.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.027" end="00:53:59.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so capable.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.727" end="00:53:59.927" style="s2">I want to prove myself, too.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.127" end="00:54:03.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.427" end="00:54:06.027" style="s2">But if anyone gives you trouble, you</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.527" end="00:54:06.027" style="s2">have to tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.927" end="00:54:12.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I think we shouldn&#39;t have Landon</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.827" end="00:54:14.227" style="s2">come to our hometown to ask for my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.027" end="00:54:16.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not? Are you two getting divorced?</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.227" end="00:54:19.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, of course not. Our relationship is</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.427" end="00:54:20.727" style="s2">great. Our hometown is way too remote.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.127" end="00:54:22.127" style="s2">After the train to the city, you still</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.727" end="00:54:23.427" style="s2">have a 2-hour bus ride, and then you</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.127" end="00:54:25.327" style="s2">have to walk the rest of the way.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.427" end="00:54:27.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can&#39;t even handle a little hardship,</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.327" end="00:54:28.727" style="s2">and he wants to marry you? That Ethan</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.027" end="00:54:30.327" style="s2">Brooks came to our house before.</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.727" end="00:54:32.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t even bring up that scumbag</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.327" end="00:54:33.627" style="s2">Ethan Brooks. Landon is a thousand times</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.227" end="00:54:34.827" style="s2">better than him.</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.627" end="00:54:36.927" style="s2">I really don&#39;t want Landon to suffer</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.827" end="00:54:38.927" style="s2">that hardship. It&#39;s not necessary.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.927" end="00:54:40.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s so big and sturdy. There&#39;s no way</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.927" end="00:54:42.727" style="s2">he can&#39;t handle it. If he doesn&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.927" end="00:54:43.727" style="s2">ask for your hand, the villagers will</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.727" end="00:54:45.127" style="s2">gossip.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.727" end="00:54:47.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What others say has nothing to do with</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.127" end="00:54:49.527" style="s2">me. Besides, which son-in-law in our</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.127" end="00:54:51.127" style="s2">village ever paid an 80,000 bride price?</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.527" end="00:54:52.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, mom can&#39;t tell if you&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.127" end="00:54:54.727" style="s2">lovesick or gold digging. You should</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.927" end="00:54:54.927" style="s2">know the betrothal ceremony is a big</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.727" end="00:54:56.627" style="s2">deal.</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.927" end="00:54:58.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m both lovesick and gold digging.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.627" end="00:54:59.327" style="s2">Landon&#39;s family is just too rich. I</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.327" end="00:54:59.927" style="s2">don&#39;t see any need to put him through</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.327" end="00:55:01.927" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.927" end="00:55:03.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. For the sake of that 80,000 bride</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.927" end="00:55:05.327" style="s2">price, he doesn&#39;t have to come. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.527" end="00:55:07.133" style="s2">come to the city to see you instead.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.327" end="00:55:09.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.133" end="00:55:09.153" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.227" end="00:55:11.828" style="s2">When did you in here?</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.828" end="00:55:13.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard most of what you told your</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.828" end="00:55:14.428" style="s2">mother. You&#39;re not letting me go ask for</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.528" end="00:55:16.428" style="s2">your hand?</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.428" end="00:55:18.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My hometown is too remote. I was afraid</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.428" end="00:55:20.128" style="s2">you wouldn&#39;t handle the trip. Landon,</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.428" end="00:55:22.028" style="s2">marrying you must mean my ancestors are</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.128" end="00:55:25.028" style="s2">smiling down on me. I don&#39;t want you to</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.028" end="00:55:26.928" style="s2">suffer needlessly because of me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.028" end="00:55:28.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, let me buy your parents a place</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.928" end="00:55:30.528" style="s2">in Riverside. Later your little brother</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.828" end="00:55:32.928" style="s2">can come study here too.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.528" end="00:55:34.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You already gave my mother 80,000 as</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.928" end="00:55:36.628" style="s2">the bride price. That&#39;s enough for them</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.628" end="00:55:38.028" style="s2">to buy a house in the county town.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.628" end="00:55:39.328" style="s2">Even if I want to help my family, I</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.028" end="00:55:41.328" style="s2">don&#39;t need to trouble you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.328" end="00:55:43.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. If that 80,000 isn&#39;t enough as the</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.328" end="00:55:44.828" style="s2">bride price, I&#39;ll give you another sum.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.628" end="00:55:46.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.828" end="00:55:48.128" style="s2">Your mother gave me 80 million today. I</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.928" end="00:55:49.528" style="s2">can&#39;t even spend all of it in my</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.128" end="00:55:51.228" style="s2">lifetime.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.528" end="00:55:53.128" style="s2">Don&#39;t give me any more money.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.228" end="00:55:55.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, we never signed a prenup, so half</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.128" end="00:55:57.628" style="s2">of everything I own is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.528" end="00:55:59.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, you never made me sign a prenup.</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.628" end="00:56:00.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From the very start you weren&#39;t after my</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.128" end="00:56:00.928" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.128" end="00:56:03.128" style="s2">That&#39;s why I&#39;m willing to share</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.928" end="00:56:04.628" style="s2">everything I have with you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.128" end="00:56:07.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I dreaming?</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.628" end="00:56:09.028" style="s2">Why does this all feel so unreal?</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.028" end="00:56:09.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how about I help you verify it?</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.028" end="00:56:12.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm?</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.728" end="00:56:12.528" style="s2">How do you verify it?</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.633" end="00:56:14.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.494" end="00:56:23.128" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.228" end="00:56:24.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie,</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.128" end="00:56:27.128" style="s2">I sent Eric to your hometown to pick up</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.628" end="00:56:28.228" style="s2">your parents. Don&#39;t go to work today.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.128" end="00:56:29.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They probably won&#39;t arrive until</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.228" end="00:56:31.328" style="s2">tonight. That doesn&#39;t affect me going to</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.928" end="00:56:33.228" style="s2">work during the day.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.328" end="00:56:36.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, why don&#39;t you take the day off?</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.228" end="00:56:36.328" style="s2">My mom wants to chat with you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.328" end="00:56:41.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, Ellie. I&#39;d like to talk</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.128" end="00:56:42.928" style="s2">with you. After all, I don&#39;t know you</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.028" end="00:56:46.128" style="s2">that well yet.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.928" end="00:56:48.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, then I&#39;ll take the day off.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.128" end="00:56:50.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you keeping Ellie at home?</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.328" end="00:56:51.628" style="s2">She wants to work. Just let her go to</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.128" end="00:56:54.928" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.628" end="00:56:54.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Marcus is making a move.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.128" end="00:56:59.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother-in-law is here, so I have to</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.828" end="00:57:01.628" style="s2">keep her company today. I already asked</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.728" end="00:57:03.828" style="s2">Mr. Harris for the day off.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.628" end="00:57:05.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, how&#39;s your mother-in-law?</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.828" end="00:57:06.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s a lovely woman. She treats me with</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.528" end="00:57:08.328" style="s2">so much respect.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.628" end="00:57:09.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, besides you, not many sane women</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.328" end="00:57:09.929" style="s2">would marry her son anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.828" end="00:57:12.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.929" end="00:57:14.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; not like that, Daisy. It&#39;s complicated.</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.029" end="00:57:15.429" style="s2">Landon isn&#39;t your average ex-con.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.029" end="00:57:17.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know he&#39;s not average. He&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.429" end="00:57:19.129" style="s2">hottest ex-con out there.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.829" end="00:57:20.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s the second master of Frost</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.129" end="00:57:22.329" style="s2">Industries.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.029" end="00:57:23.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holy crap. Ellie, what did you say? Say</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.329" end="00:57:25.229" style="s2">that again.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.729" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband is the second master of the</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.229" end="00:57:29.529" style="s2">Frosts. Landon Frost, the boss of Frost</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.429" end="00:57:31.029" style="s2">Industries. Daisy, don&#39;t tell anyone</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.529" end="00:57:32.129" style="s2">about this. I don&#39;t want people to know</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.029" end="00:57:33.829" style="s2">for now.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.129" end="00:57:34.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Ellie, didn&#39;t I see you strike it</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.829" end="00:57:36.129" style="s2">rich?</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.729" end="00:57:38.129" style="s2">I never imagined your husband would be a</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.129" end="00:57:40.329" style="s2">mega millionaire. He did his identity</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.129" end="00:57:41.929" style="s2">test on you, right?</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.329" end="00:57:43.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, that&#39;s not it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.929" end="00:57:45.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, can Grandma pass the test? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.829" end="00:57:46.129" style="s2">hitching my wagon to you for the rest of</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.229" end="00:57:48.429" style="s2">my life.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.129" end="00:57:49.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, just focus on your work for now.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.429" end="00:57:52.329" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell you all about it when I come</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.829" end="00:57:54.229" style="s2">back to the office next week.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.329" end="00:57:55.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, I&#39;d like to talk to you about our</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.229" end="00:57:57.629" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.329" end="00:57:57.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.229" end="00:58:01.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon has an older brother named</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.729" end="00:58:03.929" style="s2">Marcus.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.929" end="00:58:05.829" style="s2">I raised Marcus myself. Since the two</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.929" end="00:58:07.029" style="s2">brothers were close in age, after I had</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.829" end="00:58:07.929" style="s2">Landon, I sent him to live with his</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.029" end="00:58:11.129" style="s2">grandfather.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.929" end="00:58:11.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is grandpa no longer with us?</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.129" end="00:58:14.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because the brothers never lived</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.229" end="00:58:16.829" style="s2">together growing up, they never got</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.629" end="00:58:18.529" style="s2">along. And I spoiled Marcus too much,</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.829" end="00:58:20.229" style="s2">which made him lazy and aimless, always</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.529" end="00:58:21.429" style="s2">trying to compete with Landon. Over the</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.229" end="00:58:24.329" style="s2">years, I&#39;ve become completely</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.429" end="00:58:24.329" style="s2">disappointed in him.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.829" end="00:58:32.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, Ellie took the second master</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.929" end="00:58:34.029" style="s2">back to her hometown today.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.029" end="00:58:35.329" style="s2">My hired men are tailing them. Just give</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.029" end="00:58:36.629" style="s2">the word and I&#39;ll send them to their</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.329" end="00:58:38.329" style="s2">maker.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.629" end="00:58:40.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many cars are they in?</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.329" end="00:58:42.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two. I hired a truck and it&#39;s rigged</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.529" end="00:58:43.929" style="s2">with a bomb. As soon as the cars reach</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.429" end="00:58:45.729" style="s2">the outskirts, we can make our move.</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.929" end="00:58:47.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excellent. Once my brother is dead,</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.729" end="00:58:48.529" style="s2">Frost Industries is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.229" end="00:58:50.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When that happens, I&#39;ll bring you into</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.529" end="00:58:51.529" style="s2">the company as an executive.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.029" end="00:58:53.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds good.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.529" end="00:58:56.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, did Marcus do something terrible?</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.929" end="00:58:57.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s done plenty of terrible things.</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.029" end="00:59:00.229" style="s2">Landon ending up in prison, that was all</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.829" end="00:59:01.729" style="s2">he&#39;s doing. Isn&#39;t that absurd? Over</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.229" end="00:59:03.629" style="s2">fighting for the family fortune, he</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.729" end="00:59:05.129" style="s2">crafted a vicious trap. I will never</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.629" end="00:59:07.229" style="s2">forgive him in this lifetime.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.129" end="00:59:09.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, please don&#39;t get upset. Be careful</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.229" end="00:59:11.529" style="s2">not to ruin your health.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.229" end="00:59:14.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all in the past. From now on, I</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.529" end="00:59:15.931" style="s2">only have one son, Landon. And you too,</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.231" end="00:59:17.231" style="s2">Ellie. I&#39;ll treat you like my own</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.931" end="00:59:18.831" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.231" end="00:59:21.031" style="s2">Right now, I just want you and Landon to</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.831" end="00:59:22.531" style="s2">do well, have plenty of kids and make</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.031" end="00:59:23.731" style="s2">this house lively and warm.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.531" end="00:59:24.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon doesn&#39;t seem to like kids all</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.731" end="00:59:26.931" style="s2">that much.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.531" end="00:59:28.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; True, but I love children. If you love</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.931" end="00:59:30.631" style="s2">them too, then never mind whether he</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.431" end="00:59:31.331" style="s2">does. Once the baby comes, we&#39;ll raise</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.631" end="00:59:32.731" style="s2">it together.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.331" end="00:59:34.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, let&#39;s just let things happen</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.731" end="00:59:35.931" style="s2">naturally. If I get pregnant, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.631" end="00:59:37.831" style="s2">definitely have the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.931" end="00:59:39.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as you&#39;re willing to have one.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.831" end="00:59:42.231" style="s2">Once the child is born, Landon will</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.431" end="00:59:42.231" style="s2">surely love it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.731" end="00:59:50.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa, I&#39;ve got great news for you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.831" end="00:59:54.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did the plan work?</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.931" end="00:59:54.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I blew up Landon and Ellie.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.026" end="00:59:56.031" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.631" end="00:59:57.231" style="s2">Once Marcus comes back to take over</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.031" end="00:59:58.031" style="s2">Frost Industries, I&#39;ll get in as an</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.231" end="00:59:59.631" style="s2">executive.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.031" end="01:00:01.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. Now that we&#39;ve latched onto</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.631" end="01:00:02.931" style="s2">Marcus, we&#39;re going straight to the top.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.331" end="01:00:04.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. If I hadn&#39;t gone after Landon,</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.931" end="01:00:05.731" style="s2">you better believe once Ellie found out</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.231" end="01:00:07.131" style="s2">his real identity, she&#39;d definitely come</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.731" end="01:00:08.231" style="s2">after us.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.131" end="01:00:09.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, we don&#39;t have to worry about that</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.231" end="01:00:09.831" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.031" end="01:00:11.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.831" end="01:00:11.831" style="s2">Let&#39;s knock off early tonight and go</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.131" end="01:00:14.131" style="s2">celebrate.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.831" end="01:00:14.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.831" end="01:00:20.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s so late. Why isn&#39;t Landon back yet?</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.131" end="01:00:21.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. He&#39;s probably working</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.231" end="01:00:23.331" style="s2">overtime at the office.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.631" end="01:00:24.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not answering my calls either.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.331" end="01:00:26.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just wait a little longer. He&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.631" end="01:00:27.831" style="s2">definitely be home tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.131" end="01:00:28.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm. Mom, you&#39;re not well. You should get</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.831" end="01:00:30.531" style="s2">some rest.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.631" end="01:00:32.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;m sure he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.531" end="01:00:32.931" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.431" end="01:00:38.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, did something happen? Didn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.631" end="01:00:40.631" style="s2">say your assistant would go to my</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.731" end="01:00:41.631" style="s2">hometown to pick up my parents?</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.631" end="01:00:43.431" style="s2">I called them and they say your</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.631" end="01:00:45.431" style="s2">assistant never showed up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.431" end="01:00:47.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My assistant did go. He just got into a</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.431" end="01:00:49.331" style="s2">car accident. Ellie, don&#39;t go to the</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.231" end="01:00:50.531" style="s2">office for a while.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.331" end="01:00:53.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.531" end="01:00:53.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because someone&#39;s trying to hurt us.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.431" end="01:00:59.431" style="s2">This might have something to do with my</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.631" end="01:01:01.131" style="s2">brother. So I want to get to the bottom</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.431" end="01:01:02.031" style="s2">of it and drag up everything along the</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.131" end="01:01:03.831" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.031" end="01:01:05.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is your assistant okay?</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.831" end="01:01:07.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s in the hospital, but his life isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.531" end="01:01:09.031" style="s2">in danger.</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.731" end="01:01:10.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we&#39;d been the ones going back to the</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.031" end="01:01:11.531" style="s2">hometown today, would we have been the</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.331" end="01:01:13.031" style="s2">ones hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.531" end="01:01:14.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.031" end="01:01:15.932" style="s2">Right now they think we&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.731" end="01:01:17.032" style="s2">That&#39;s why I&#39;m telling you to stay away</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.932" end="01:01:18.432" style="s2">from the office.</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.032" end="01:01:19.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does your brother really hate you that</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.432" end="01:01:21.532" style="s2">much?</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.432" end="01:01:22.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not hate. He wants the Frost family</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.532" end="01:01:24.332" style="s2">fortune.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.532" end="01:01:25.732" style="s2">If I died by accident legally all of it</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.332" end="01:01:28.232" style="s2">would go to him.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.732" end="01:01:29.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it&#39;s for the money. How despicable.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.232" end="01:01:30.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.332" end="01:01:32.232" style="s2">I&#39;ll strip him of everything. If he</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.932" end="01:01:34.632" style="s2">planned this bomb and crash I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.232" end="01:01:36.032" style="s2">sure he rots in prison for life.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.632" end="01:01:37.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll stay away from the office, but what</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.032" end="01:01:38.732" style="s2">about you?</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.132" end="01:01:39.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going either. I&#39;ll stay home</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.732" end="01:01:40.532" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.632" end="01:01:42.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.532" end="01:01:43.232" style="s2">So when do we get to go out roughly?</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.757" end="01:01:44.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.232" end="01:01:46.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This job was carried out through Ethan</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.532" end="01:01:47.932" style="s2">Brooks for my brother. So when the time</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.432" end="01:01:49.732" style="s2">comes we&#39;ll crash Ethan Brooks&#39;s wedding</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.932" end="01:01:51.932" style="s2">and give him a surprise.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.732" end="01:01:51.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.432" end="01:01:56.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome everyone to mine and Vanessa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.432" end="01:01:57.632" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.432" end="01:02:00.032" style="s2">Today I have some wonderful news to</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.632" end="01:02:00.032" style="s2">announce.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.632" end="01:02:09.332" style="s2">The good news is my wife Vanessa is</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.632" end="01:02:11.032" style="s2">pregnant. I&#39;m going to be a father.</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.332" end="01:02:13.032" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that Ellie and Landon? Weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.032" end="01:02:15.832" style="s2">they sent to the ICU after a car crash?</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.032" end="01:02:15.832" style="s2">Why are they at my wedding?</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.032" end="01:02:18.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weren&#39;t they badly hurt and in the</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.032" end="01:02:20.132" style="s2">hospital? Why are they here?</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.832" end="01:02:21.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you two whispering about up</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.132" end="01:02:23.732" style="s2">there? Vanessa you sent me an</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.832" end="01:02:26.032" style="s2">invitation. I accepted it so of course</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.732" end="01:02:28.232" style="s2">I&#39;d come. And Ethan sure you cheated,</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.032" end="01:02:30.432" style="s2">but I don&#39;t blame you. Not only do I not</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.232" end="01:02:31.632" style="s2">blame you I&#39;ve got a big gift coming</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.432" end="01:02:34.232" style="s2">your way.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.632" end="01:02:34.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What big gift?</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.432" end="01:02:36.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.432" end="01:02:38.732" style="s2">we went for a prenuptial physical</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.632" end="01:02:40.532" style="s2">before. This is your report. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.732" end="01:02:42.032" style="s2">never even seen it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.532" end="01:02:43.632" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you the least bit curious about</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.032" end="01:02:46.032" style="s2">what it says?</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.632" end="01:02:47.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your so-called big gift?</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.032" end="01:02:48.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you just announce some great news</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.532" end="01:02:49.532" style="s2">in front of everyone?</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.632" end="01:02:50.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.532" end="01:02:52.032" style="s2">Vanessa&#39;s pregnant. I&#39;m going to be a</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.832" end="01:02:53.432" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.032" end="01:02:55.032" style="s2">Ellie I know you&#39;ve held a grudge since</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.432" end="01:02:56.732" style="s2">I left you, but you can&#39;t have children</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.032" end="01:02:58.232" style="s2">so I had no choice. My family&#39;s counting</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.732" end="01:02:59.732" style="s2">on me to carry on the name. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.232" end="01:03:00.532" style="s2">expect me to die without an heir, can</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.732" end="01:03:01.932" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.532" end="01:03:02.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure you can carry on the Brooks</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.932" end="01:03:06.132" style="s2">name?</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.832" end="01:03:06.132" style="s2">Go on read your own report.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.432" end="01:03:13.332" style="s2">Don&#39;t look at it. Who knows if that</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.732" end="01:03:15.632" style="s2">report is even real?</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.332" end="01:03:19.333" style="s2">Ellie showing up here is nothing good.</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.632" end="01:03:19.333" style="s2">I will not let her ruin my wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.633" end="01:03:22.533" style="s2">What are you afraid of, design director</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.133" end="01:03:23.733" style="s2">Vanessa? Hm?</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.533" end="01:03:25.233" style="s2">Could it be you&#39;re scared Ethan will</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.733" end="01:03:25.833" style="s2">find out the baby you&#39;re carrying isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.233" end="01:03:27.933" style="s2">his?</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.833" end="01:03:29.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What nonsense are you spouting?</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.933" end="01:03:30.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it&#39;s not Ethan&#39;s, then whose would it</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.433" end="01:03:32.033" style="s2">be?</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.133" end="01:03:33.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop trying to drive a wedge between us.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.033" end="01:03:35.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, this is Ethan&#39;s medical report</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.933" end="01:03:37.233" style="s2">from 6 months ago. It shows he has</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.433" end="01:03:38.833" style="s2">azoospermia. The doctor said he could</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.233" end="01:03:40.433" style="s2">never father a child in his life, so the</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.833" end="01:03:41.733" style="s2">baby Vanessa is carrying isn&#39;t Ethan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.433" end="01:03:42.833" style="s2">at all.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.733" end="01:03:44.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;d have thought the happy news Ethan</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.833" end="01:03:46.033" style="s2">announced on his wedding day is actually</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.133" end="01:03:47.533" style="s2">a cuckold&#39;s crown. Poor guy.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.033" end="01:03:48.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So is this wedding still happening or</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.533" end="01:03:50.633" style="s2">not?</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.133" end="01:03:54.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. If I were Ethan, I&#39;d beat that</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.633" end="01:03:54.433" style="s2">seductress Vanessa to death right now.</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.633" end="01:04:02.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wretch. You&#39;re carrying another</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.433" end="01:04:03.933" style="s2">man&#39;s child and yet you dare to marry</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.033" end="01:04:04.733" style="s2">me? Believe me, I could kill you with my</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.933" end="01:04:06.733" style="s2">bare hands.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.733" end="01:04:08.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be rash, Ethan. That report is</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.733" end="01:04:11.833" style="s2">fake. Don&#39;t let Ellie fool you. She came</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.833" end="01:04:14.633" style="s2">here on purpose to ruin our wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.833" end="01:04:16.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, is the report fake?</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.633" end="01:04:19.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t believe it, go to the</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.133" end="01:04:21.333" style="s2">hospital and get tested again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.333" end="01:04:22.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why bother with all that? Isn&#39;t that man</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.333" end="01:04:24.933" style="s2">Landon, the second master of Frost</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.933" end="01:04:26.433" style="s2">Industries? Am I seeing things?</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.933" end="01:04:28.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw in the gossip news that he died in</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.433" end="01:04:30.833" style="s2">a car crash. Doesn&#39;t he look perfectly</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.233" end="01:04:32.033" style="s2">fine standing right here?</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.833" end="01:04:34.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you are?</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.033" end="01:04:35.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Ellie&#39;s husband and the CEO of Frost</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.033" end="01:04:37.433" style="s2">Industries.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.833" end="01:04:38.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What an honor to have Mr. Frost grace us</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.433" end="01:04:40.033" style="s2">with his presence.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.933" end="01:04:41.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.033" end="01:04:42.933" style="s2">You should be thanking Ellie.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.833" end="01:04:44.849" style="s2">Otherwise, you wouldn&#39;t be worthy of</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.933" end="01:04:45.933" style="s2">standing before me at all.</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.849" end="01:04:47.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.933" end="01:04:49.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, you said there&#39;s no need for</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.633" end="01:04:50.933" style="s2">all that trouble. What did you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.833" end="01:04:52.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa,</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.933" end="01:04:53.533" style="s2">you keep bullying my wife again and</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.333" end="01:04:55.033" style="s2">again. Do you know why I haven&#39;t done</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.533" end="01:04:56.733" style="s2">anything to you?</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.033" end="01:04:57.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, I didn&#39;t know Ellie was your</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.733" end="01:04:59.333" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.333" end="01:05:00.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More lies. When you brought Ellie to</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.333" end="01:05:03.033" style="s2">Frost Industries, you already knew who I</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.933" end="01:05:04.333" style="s2">was. Yet you quickly had your lover go</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.033" end="01:05:06.533" style="s2">after Ellie.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.333" end="01:05:07.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What lover? Mr. Frost, does Vanessa have</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.533" end="01:05:09.633" style="s2">a lover on the side?</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.533" end="01:05:10.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I don&#39;t. Stanley and I have nothing</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.633" end="01:05:12.633" style="s2">going on.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.733" end="01:05:15.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never even said who your lover was.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.633" end="01:05:16.333" style="s2">And you just blurted out yourself?</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.433" end="01:05:17.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.333" end="01:05:19.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you admit you had Stanley harass</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.933" end="01:05:20.835" style="s2">Ellie? Otherwise, how would you know I</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.533" end="01:05:21.735" style="s2">meant Staley?</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.835" end="01:05:23.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.735" end="01:05:25.035" style="s2">Mr. Frost, it&#39;s all a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.735" end="01:05:28.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan,</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.035" end="01:05:28.235" style="s2">I also have a big gift for you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.135" end="01:05:36.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That woman looked like the bride.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.935" end="01:05:38.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, that woman is the bride, but the</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.535" end="01:05:39.335" style="s2">man in there isn&#39;t the groom.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.135" end="01:05:41.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa?</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.335" end="01:05:42.735" style="s2">So this is your lover, Stanley?</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.335" end="01:05:44.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did see him before, but that was</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.735" end="01:05:47.035" style="s2">before you and I got together.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.735" end="01:05:49.935" style="s2">I ended things with him long ago. Please</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.035" end="01:05:49.935" style="s2">believe me, okay?</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.435" end="01:05:54.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You cheap liar, what else do you have to</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.035" end="01:05:56.535" style="s2">say?</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.635" end="01:05:58.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That chat is fake. The baby really is</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.535" end="01:05:58.935" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.035" end="01:06:04.335" style="s2">Who is Vanessa? GET OUT HERE RIGHT NOW.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.635" end="01:06:12.235" style="s2">You shameless snake, daring to seduce my</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.735" end="01:06:12.235" style="s2">husband? I&#39;LL BEAT YOU TO DEATH.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.535" end="01:06:15.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. FROST, MRS. FROST, I WAS wrong</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.935" end="01:06:16.135" style="s2">before, but I was only doing Vanessa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.235" end="01:06:17.335" style="s2">bidding.</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.135" end="01:06:18.735" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;m cutting all ties with</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.335" end="01:06:21.435" style="s2">Vanessa. I swear I&#39;ll never do something</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.735" end="01:06:21.435" style="s2">that shameful again.</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.375" end="01:06:28.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.535" end="01:06:28.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.635" end="01:06:32.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The baby&#39;s probably not going to</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.835" end="01:06:34.335" style="s2">survive.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.135" end="01:06:36.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, save me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.335" end="01:06:36.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stanley&#39;s here too. Let Stanley save</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.335" end="01:06:37.435" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.735" end="01:06:39.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, [clears throat] this is your</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.435" end="01:06:41.235" style="s2">wedding. If someone ends up dead here,</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.335" end="01:06:44.335" style="s2">you&#39;ll be implicated too. Take Vanessa</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.235" end="01:06:44.335" style="s2">to the hospital now.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.635" end="01:06:49.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, you&#39;re not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.435" end="01:06:51.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost,</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.835" end="01:06:52.435" style="s2">Vanessa is bleeding.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.435" end="01:06:53.835" style="s2">Even though I&#39;m done with her, I still</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.435" end="01:06:55.935" style="s2">need to get her to the hospital first.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.835" end="01:06:57.235" style="s2">Someone will take her to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.935" end="01:06:59.135" style="s2">You just stay right here and wait for</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.235" end="01:07:00.635" style="s2">your karma.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.135" end="01:07:02.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What karma? Mr. Frost, what are you</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.635" end="01:07:04.135" style="s2">talking about? I don&#39;t understand.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.935" end="01:07:05.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The police found you&#39;re connected to the</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.135" end="01:07:07.735" style="s2">explosion on the outskirts of town two</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.835" end="01:07:09.735" style="s2">weeks ago.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.735" end="01:07:10.935" style="s2">If you don&#39;t confess who&#39;s behind it,</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.735" end="01:07:13.335" style="s2">probably won&#39;t live to see tomorrow&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.935" end="01:07:13.335" style="s2">sun.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.735" end="01:07:18.435" style="s2">We&#39;re with Riverside PD. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.835" end="01:07:19.235" style="s2">suspected of attempted murder. Come with</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.435" end="01:07:20.635" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.235" end="01:07:21.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could this happen?</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.635" end="01:07:24.336" style="s2">I left no trace at all. How did they</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.836" end="01:07:24.336" style="s2">find out?</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.836" end="01:07:29.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;ve arrested Ethan, you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.136" end="01:07:31.936" style="s2">arrest me. I had nothing to do with the</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.936" end="01:07:34.036" style="s2">explosion. This time I really had</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.936" end="01:07:36.036" style="s2">nothing to do with it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.036" end="01:07:37.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you had Staley humiliate my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.036" end="01:07:38.636" style="s2">Did you think that was all water under</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.336" end="01:07:40.536" style="s2">the bridge?</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.636" end="01:07:43.636" style="s2">You&#39;ve likely lost the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.536" end="01:07:45.736" style="s2">Now it&#39;s time for you to face the law.</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.636" end="01:07:48.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.736" end="01:07:48.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.236" end="01:08:01.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, what brings you here? And you</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.936" end="01:08:02.636" style="s2">brought the missus along too? Now I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.436" end="01:08:04.636" style="s2">all embarrassed.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.636" end="01:08:06.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were you just playing games?</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.636" end="01:08:08.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh the doctor told me to keep my joints</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.736" end="01:08:10.436" style="s2">moving. And hey, my fingers need</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.336" end="01:08:13.136" style="s2">exercise too, right?</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.436" end="01:08:14.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eric, good to see you&#39;re okay.</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.136" end="01:08:16.236" style="s2">I was so worried that I had him bring me</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.536" end="01:08:18.136" style="s2">here to see you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.236" end="01:08:19.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.136" end="01:08:21.036" style="s2">Mr. Frost knew there&#39;d be an ambush on</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.636" end="01:08:23.336" style="s2">the road, so he gave me a blast-proof</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.036" end="01:08:23.336" style="s2">car.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.236" end="01:08:28.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A broken bone takes 100 days to heal.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.936" end="01:08:29.436" style="s2">This leg won&#39;t be better for at least 3</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.536" end="01:08:31.336" style="s2">months.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.436" end="01:08:32.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost gave me 3 months of paid sick</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.336" end="01:08:35.036" style="s2">leave, so I&#39;ll definitely recover</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.536" end="01:08:36.336" style="s2">perfectly.</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.036" end="01:08:38.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.336" end="01:08:40.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feel better now? Let&#39;s go before we keep</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.136" end="01:08:40.736" style="s2">him from his games.</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.536" end="01:08:51.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, thanks for driving me to work.</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.036" end="01:08:53.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once you finish the order you&#39;re working</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.236" end="01:08:55.236" style="s2">on, quit your job.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.436" end="01:08:57.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was planning to, actually.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.236" end="01:08:58.736" style="s2">My boss is related to Vanessa. Now that</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.536" end="01:09:00.336" style="s2">Vanessa and I are at each other&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.736" end="01:09:02.136" style="s2">throats, it&#39;s better if I switch</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.336" end="01:09:04.336" style="s2">companies.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.136" end="01:09:05.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, you finally made it to work. Do</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.336" end="01:09:07.736" style="s2">you know I&#39;ve been waiting here for you</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.336" end="01:09:09.636" style="s2">every single day? I&#39;ve got a juicy piece</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.736" end="01:09:13.136" style="s2">of gossip to share with you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.636" end="01:09:14.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What gossip? Are you pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.136" end="01:09:16.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Vanessa.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.536" end="01:09:18.636" style="s2">She got arrested.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.836" end="01:09:20.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not even juicy. I want to hear</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.636" end="01:09:21.936" style="s2">all about you. Tell me about your</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.336" end="01:09:23.836" style="s2">billionaire husband. He&#39;s my only</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.936" end="01:09:25.938" style="s2">connection to the high society. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.836" end="01:09:29.338" style="s2">met him before. Apart from being rich</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.938" end="01:09:29.338" style="s2">and handsome, he&#39;s just like us.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.438" end="01:09:32.338" style="s2">Did you sort out the fabric in the</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.538" end="01:09:33.938" style="s2">factory I asked you to follow up on?</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.338" end="01:09:34.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All settled. I&#39;ll bring the samples over</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.938" end="01:09:37.038" style="s2">for you to look at.</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.737" end="01:09:37.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great.</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.637" end="01:09:43.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, I&#39;d like to have a word with you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.538" end="01:09:44.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s on your mind? Go ahead. Say it</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.137" end="01:09:46.737" style="s2">right here.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.538" end="01:09:48.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, I heard your husband is Landon,</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.737" end="01:09:49.737" style="s2">the head of Frost Industries.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.538" end="01:09:51.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.737" end="01:09:52.137" style="s2">Thanks to Vanessa and her husband, there</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.137" end="01:09:54.137" style="s2">was no hiding it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.137" end="01:09:55.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, truth is I have nothing to do</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.137" end="01:09:56.838" style="s2">with Vanessa. I knew nothing about what</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.738" end="01:09:58.438" style="s2">she did.</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.838" end="01:10:00.038" style="s2">Please don&#39;t misunderstand me. I treat</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.438" end="01:10:01.038" style="s2">all my employees the same.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.038" end="01:10:02.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.038" end="01:10:04.538" style="s2">I&#39;ll finish the order I have in hand,</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.938" end="01:10:06.738" style="s2">and once it&#39;s done,</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.538" end="01:10:07.838" style="s2">I&#39;ll resign.</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.738" end="01:10:09.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.838" end="01:10:11.038" style="s2">I know you&#39;re talented. Our company</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.238" end="01:10:12.038" style="s2">needs people like you. I&#39;ll raise your</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.038" end="01:10:14.137" style="s2">pay.</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.038" end="01:10:15.838" style="s2">Is 30 grand a month enough? If not, how</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.137" end="01:10:18.838" style="s2">about 50?</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.838" end="01:10:18.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not about the money.</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.338" end="01:10:21.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.338" end="01:10:22.838" style="s2">Now that you&#39;re Mrs. Frost, I expect</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.637" end="01:10:23.738" style="s2">Landon won&#39;t let you keep working here</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.838" end="01:10:24.938" style="s2">anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.738" end="01:10:26.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me who doesn&#39;t want to stay here</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.938" end="01:10:29.838" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.137" end="01:10:29.838" style="s2">Ellie, all the samples are here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.338" end="01:10:37.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daisy,</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.538" end="01:10:37.938" style="s2">when Ellie resigns, are you leaving too?</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.738" end="01:10:42.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m definitely going wherever Ellie</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.137" end="01:10:42.538" style="s2">goes.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.338" end="01:10:47.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, where are you planning to go</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.338" end="01:10:48.338" style="s2">after you resign? Once we finish the</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.038" end="01:10:49.838" style="s2">Frost Industries order, I&#39;ll start</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.338" end="01:10:50.637" style="s2">sending out resumes. Shouldn&#39;t be hard</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.838" end="01:10:52.238" style="s2">to find work.</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.637" end="01:10:53.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, you married into a rich family.</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.238" end="01:10:55.038" style="s2">Why keep slaving away as an employee?</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.938" end="01:10:57.838" style="s2">Can&#39;t you just have your husband open a</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.038" end="01:10:57.838" style="s2">studio for you?</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.038" end="01:11:03.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, Eric has handed his work over</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.438" end="01:11:06.137" style="s2">to me. While he&#39;s recovering, I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.137" end="01:11:06.137" style="s2">taking over his duties.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.637" end="01:11:14.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any word from overseas?</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.938" end="01:11:15.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean your brother&#39;s side?</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.038" end="01:11:16.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.137" end="01:11:18.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The money your brother stashed overseas</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.637" end="01:11:21.438" style="s2">is almost spent. He&#39;ll probably be back</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.637" end="01:11:23.137" style="s2">in the country before long.</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.438" end="01:11:26.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep a close eye on him. The moment</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.137" end="01:11:28.338" style="s2">anything happens, notify me right away.</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.338" end="01:11:28.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.338" end="01:11:30.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.539" end="01:11:32.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; go now.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.739" end="01:11:34.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if I were to start a business, I</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.539" end="01:11:35.839" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t need to ask my husband. My</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.339" end="01:11:37.839" style="s2">mother-in-law gave me a huge sum of</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.839" end="01:11:39.439" style="s2">money. If you&#39;ve got the money, then be</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.839" end="01:11:41.339" style="s2">your own boss.</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.439" end="01:11:43.439" style="s2">You have that much faith in me? I feel</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.339" end="01:11:44.739" style="s2">like I still need more experience. Isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.439" end="01:11:46.739" style="s2">the process of starting a business</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.739" end="01:11:48.739" style="s2">itself experience?</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.739" end="01:11:51.539" style="s2">You make a good point. Let&#39;s talk about</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.739" end="01:11:51.539" style="s2">it once I resign.</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.339" end="01:11:55.739" style="s2">Oh, and the HR manager at Frost</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.339" end="01:11:57.239" style="s2">Industries asked us to come to their</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.739" end="01:11:58.939" style="s2">company tomorrow to take measurements</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.239" end="01:12:00.039" style="s2">for their employees.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.939" end="01:12:02.439" style="s2">Didn&#39;t they say they wanted to see the</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.039" end="01:12:03.539" style="s2">finished sample garments first?</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.439" end="01:12:04.939" style="s2">I bet they&#39;ve learned you&#39;re the lady of</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.539" end="01:12:06.039" style="s2">the house now, so they dropped their</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.939" end="01:12:07.039" style="s2">demands.</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.039" end="01:12:08.339" style="s2">Then reply [snorts] and tell them we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.039" end="01:12:10.739" style="s2">come tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.339" end="01:12:10.739" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.439" end="01:12:16.539" style="s2">Honey, I&#39;m going to your company</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.039" end="01:12:16.539" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.739" end="01:12:19.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning or afternoon?</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.539" end="01:12:25.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still working this late?</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.539" end="01:12:27.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.439" end="01:12:28.439" style="s2">Eric&#39;s taking 3 months off, so he handed</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.239" end="01:12:29.639" style="s2">his work over to a secretary</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.439" end="01:12:30.739" style="s2">temporarily.</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.639" end="01:12:32.539" style="s2">There are a few things she&#39;s not sure</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.739" end="01:12:34.039" style="s2">about, so she asks me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.539" end="01:12:36.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t she ask during the day? Why does</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.039" end="01:12:39.339" style="s2">it have to be at this hour?</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.939" end="01:12:41.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, are you jealous?</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.339" end="01:12:42.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not jealous. It&#39;s just that it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.039" end="01:12:44.539" style="s2">already 11:00 and my boss would never</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.839" end="01:12:46.239" style="s2">call me about work at this hour.</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.539" end="01:12:47.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She sent the wrong photo by mistake,</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.239" end="01:12:49.239" style="s2">then apologized, and only after that did</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.839" end="01:12:52.239" style="s2">we start talking about work.</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.239" end="01:12:53.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sent the wrong photo?</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.239" end="01:12:54.639" style="s2">Do you really think she sent it by</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.339" end="01:12:56.439" style="s2">mistake?</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.639" end="01:12:57.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You suspect she did it on purpose just</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.439" end="01:12:58.939" style="s2">to show me?</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.139" end="01:13:00.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you never been in a relationship?</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.939" end="01:13:01.539" style="s2">The fake innocent act is practically</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.439" end="01:13:02.539" style="s2">leaking through your screen and you</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.539" end="01:13:04.039" style="s2">can&#39;t even see it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.539" end="01:13:05.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my first girlfriend. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.039" end="01:13:06.939" style="s2">suspect her because Eric vouched for</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.339" end="01:13:08.439" style="s2">her. He praised how capable she is at</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.939" end="01:13:09.239" style="s2">work a few times, so that thought never</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.439" end="01:13:10.539" style="s2">crossed my mind.</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.239" end="01:13:12.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone who gets into your company must</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.539" end="01:13:14.139" style="s2">be outstanding, but I can understand her</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.339" end="01:13:15.039" style="s2">falling for you. Who could resist such a</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.139" end="01:13:16.139" style="s2">brilliant boss?</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.039" end="01:13:17.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll have her transferred to a different</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.139" end="01:13:19.439" style="s2">post tomorrow. I&#39;m not used to having a</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.739" end="01:13:21.339" style="s2">female assistant around anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.439" end="01:13:22.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about giving her a chance?</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.339" end="01:13:24.139" style="s2">What if I overthinking it and treating</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.639" end="01:13:25.739" style="s2">her unfairly?</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.139" end="01:13:27.139" style="s2">After that photo, she went straight back</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.739" end="01:13:27.939" style="s2">to talking about work.</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.139" end="01:13:28.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure you want to give her a</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.939" end="01:13:30.939" style="s2">chance?</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.839" end="01:13:32.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eric is only off for 3 months, right?</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.939" end="01:13:33.140" style="s2">That girl won&#39;t be by your side for long</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.340" end="01:13:35.040" style="s2">anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.140" end="01:13:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll see how she does.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.040" end="01:13:37.640" style="s2">If she sends another wrong message, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.640" end="01:13:38.740" style="s2">have her transferred.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.640" end="01:13:40.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.740" end="01:13:42.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, I love you more than anyone. In</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.440" end="01:13:45.640" style="s2">this life, you&#39;re the only one I want.</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.240" end="01:13:49.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, do you want to have a child?</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.640" end="01:13:49.440" style="s2">So, do you want to have a child?</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.340" end="01:13:55.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, aren&#39;t you infertile?</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.540" end="01:13:57.340" style="s2">You want me to have the baby myself?</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.340" end="01:13:59.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lied about being infertile. The one</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.340" end="01:14:00.740" style="s2">who&#39;s infertile is Ethan. I claimed it</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.340" end="01:14:02.240" style="s2">was me to spare Ethan&#39;s pride, but</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.740" end="01:14:03.640" style="s2">instead he looked down on me and dumped</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.240" end="01:14:04.840" style="s2">me. So, I deliberately told you I was</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.640" end="01:14:05.540" style="s2">infertile just to see whether you turned</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.840" end="01:14:07.540" style="s2">me away.</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.540" end="01:14:09.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. Honey, I don&#39;t like kids and I</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.540" end="01:14:09.940" style="s2">don&#39;t want any. Having you is more than</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.140" end="01:14:11.140" style="s2">enough.</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.940" end="01:14:12.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why don&#39;t you like kids?</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.140" end="01:14:13.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just don&#39;t. Let&#39;s use protection from</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.840" end="01:14:15.540" style="s2">now on.</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.440" end="01:14:17.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hates kids that much. If I got</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.540" end="01:14:19.740" style="s2">pregnant, he probably wouldn&#39;t be happy.</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.740" end="01:14:23.140" style="s2">Still, a lifetime of just the two of us</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.740" end="01:14:23.140" style="s2">together doesn&#39;t sound bad either.</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.640" end="01:14:31.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just the two of you, designer Ellie?</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.140" end="01:14:33.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.340" end="01:14:35.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about I pull a few people to help</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.040" end="01:14:37.740" style="s2">you? You just teach them how to measure.</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.540" end="01:14:39.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, please. Thank you so much.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.740" end="01:14:41.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to thank me. Let me take you to</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.340" end="01:14:43.040" style="s2">the conference room first. Did you hear?</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.540" end="01:14:45.140" style="s2">The designer coming today has something</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.040" end="01:14:46.540" style="s2">special going on with our Mr. Frost.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.140" end="01:14:48.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time she fainted in our company,</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.540" end="01:14:49.840" style="s2">Mr. Frost carried her to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.340" end="01:14:51.440" style="s2">They say Mr. Frost has a mysterious</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.840" end="01:14:52.640" style="s2">wife. Could that mysterious wife happen</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.440" end="01:14:54.340" style="s2">to be that designer?</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.640" end="01:14:55.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You guys have quite the imagination.</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.340" end="01:14:58.040" style="s2">I&#39;ve never heard that Mr. Frost has a</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.640" end="01:14:58.040" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.040" end="01:15:08.340" style="s2">Sent the wrong photo?</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.040" end="01:15:08.340" style="s2">She&#39;s Landon&#39;s assistant now.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.440" end="01:15:13.140" style="s2">You must be the designer Ellie, right?</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.340" end="01:15:14.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, I&#39;m Zoe, Mr. Frost&#39;s temporary</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.140" end="01:15:15.940" style="s2">assistant. If you need any help today,</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.840" end="01:15:17.940" style="s2">just let me know.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.940" end="01:15:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like I overthought it last night.</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.940" end="01:15:22.440" style="s2">She&#39;s so poised and proper. She probably</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.240" end="01:15:24.440" style="s2">isn&#39;t one of those scheming types.</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.440" end="01:15:25.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, Miss Robert said she&#39;d send people</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.440" end="01:15:27.412" style="s2">to help with measurements, so no need to</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.740" end="01:15:29.432" style="s2">trouble you. All right?</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.412" end="01:15:29.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.240" end="01:15:33.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, want to grab together?</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.042" end="01:15:39.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, your husband just sent you a</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.642" end="01:15:42.742" style="s2">message.</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.542" end="01:15:42.742" style="s2">Let&#39;s focus on work first.</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.942" end="01:15:47.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, what brings you here? Are you</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.142" end="01:15:47.942" style="s2">getting measured, too?</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.642" end="01:15:52.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost&#39;s suits are all custom</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.042" end="01:15:54.042" style="s2">tailored. They&#39;re not like what we wear.</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.742" end="01:15:55.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.042" end="01:15:58.142" style="s2">So Mr. Frost came here to see the</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.442" end="01:15:58.142" style="s2">designer Ellie?</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.642" end="01:16:05.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m having lunch with Daisy today. You</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.542" end="01:16:07.142" style="s2">eat on your own.</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.642" end="01:16:08.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Roberts, please arrange lunch for</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.142" end="01:16:10.742" style="s2">the designer Ellie and her assistant.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.742" end="01:16:12.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, Mr. Frost. Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.742" end="01:16:13.242" style="s2">make sure the designer Ellie is well</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.142" end="01:16:14.642" style="s2">taken care of.</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.242" end="01:16:15.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just passing by. Keep going,</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.642" end="01:16:16.842" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:16:15.142" end="01:16:18.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, do you and Mr. Frost know each</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.842" end="01:16:21.242" style="s2">other? He even had Miss Roberts prepare</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.742" end="01:16:22.842" style="s2">lunch for you. That&#39;s so thoughtful.</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.242" end="01:16:24.642" style="s2">Last time I fainted at your company, Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.842" end="01:16:25.942" style="s2">Frost took me to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.642" end="01:16:27.542" style="s2">Miss Roberts, you don&#39;t need to prepare</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.942" end="01:16:29.542" style="s2">lunch for us. We&#39;ll just order takeout.</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.542" end="01:16:31.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That won&#39;t do. Just focus on your work.</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.542" end="01:16:32.942" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring your lunch over soon. Landon,</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.542" end="01:16:34.542" style="s2">are you that afraid the employees will</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.942" end="01:16:36.942" style="s2">keep gossiping about us?</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.542" end="01:16:38.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since Mr. Frost explicitly asked, I must</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.942" end="01:16:40.542" style="s2">get the designer Ellie a luxurious</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.742" end="01:16:42.442" style="s2">lunch.</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.542" end="01:16:43.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, I didn&#39;t know what you liked, so</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.442" end="01:16:46.042" style="s2">I ordered the restaurant&#39;s signature</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.842" end="01:16:47.742" style="s2">lunch box. Open it. If you don&#39;t like</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.042" end="01:16:49.642" style="s2">it, I&#39;ll get you something else.</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.742" end="01:16:52.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Roberts, you&#39;re too kind. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.642" end="01:16:52.842" style="s2">picky. I can eat anything.</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.342" end="01:17:01.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.342" end="01:17:03.242" style="s2">Ellie, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.142" end="01:17:05.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, just a bit queasy. Zoe, come</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.242" end="01:17:07.683" style="s2">with me to the restroom.</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.663" end="01:17:07.683" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.942" end="01:17:15.142" style="s2">Ellie, are you all right? I heard your</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.642" end="01:17:16.642" style="s2">stomach feels off. Want me to get you</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.142" end="01:17:18.742" style="s2">some medicine?</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.642" end="01:17:19.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, no need.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.742" end="01:17:21.242" style="s2">Do you know how our employees gossip</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.942" end="01:17:22.742" style="s2">about you and Mr. Frost behind the</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.242" end="01:17:24.142" style="s2">scenes?</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.742" end="01:17:26.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do they say?</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.142" end="01:17:27.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They say Mr. Frost has a mysterious wife</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.342" end="01:17:29.542" style="s2">and that you&#39;re her.</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.942" end="01:17:30.842" style="s2">I&#39;ve worked here so long and never once</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.542" end="01:17:32.542" style="s2">heard that rumor.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.842" end="01:17:34.442" style="s2">Hasn&#39;t Eric told you anything?</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.542" end="01:17:36.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eric only talks to me about work, work,</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.442" end="01:17:38.343" style="s2">about Mr. Frost&#39;s private matters.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.642" end="01:17:39.743" style="s2">I really admire him. He&#39;s brilliant at</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.343" end="01:17:41.743" style="s2">his job and has amazing emotional</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.743" end="01:17:42.743" style="s2">intelligence. I hope one day I&#39;ll be as</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.743" end="01:17:46.043" style="s2">good as him.</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.743" end="01:17:46.043" style="s2">Eric is indeed outstanding.</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.143" end="01:17:51.343" style="s2">Ellie, you&#39;re retching this badly. Could</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.743" end="01:17:53.343" style="s2">you be pregnant? Am I really pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.343" end="01:17:54.943" style="s2">But Landon doesn&#39;t want kids.</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.343" end="01:17:57.343" style="s2">Zoah, please don&#39;t tell Landon about</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.943" end="01:17:57.343" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.443" end="01:18:04.543" style="s2">Ellie, are you feeling better?</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.843" end="01:18:06.043" style="s2">If you&#39;re still unwell, I can drive you</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.543" end="01:18:07.943" style="s2">to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.043" end="01:18:09.743" style="s2">I&#39;m fine now, Mrs. Roberts. Thanks for</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.943" end="01:18:11.743" style="s2">the lunch. Go eat.</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.743" end="01:18:14.143" style="s2">Good. Glad you&#39;re okay. I&#39;ll head off</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.743" end="01:18:14.143" style="s2">then.</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.643" end="01:18:19.443" style="s2">Ellie, it&#39;s just us now. Tell me the</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.343" end="01:18:20.743" style="s2">truth. Are you pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.443" end="01:18:22.943" style="s2">I retched once and you think I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.743" end="01:18:24.543" style="s2">pregnant? Of course, because you have a</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.943" end="01:18:26.043" style="s2">husband. If you weren&#39;t married, I</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.543" end="01:18:27.943" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t think that way.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.043" end="01:18:29.343" style="s2">I&#39;m starting to wonder that too.</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.943" end="01:18:30.843" style="s2">He never used protection. Not using</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.343" end="01:18:32.743" style="s2">protection means he wants kids. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.843" end="01:18:34.743" style="s2">great. Have the baby. If it&#39;s a son,</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.743" end="01:18:36.143" style="s2">he&#39;ll inherit the Frost fortune.</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.743" end="01:18:37.743" style="s2">Ellie, this is your perfect chance to</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.143" end="01:18:39.329" style="s2">turn things around and plant roots in</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.743" end="01:18:41.543" style="s2">high society.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.329" end="01:18:42.843" style="s2">[snorts] He doesn&#39;t want kids.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.543" end="01:18:44.743" style="s2">Why wouldn&#39;t he want kids? Is he</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.843" end="01:18:46.643" style="s2">incapable? No, wait. You&#39;re clearly</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.743" end="01:18:48.043" style="s2">pregnant, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.643" end="01:18:49.143" style="s2">I lied to him before and told him I was</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.043" end="01:18:50.543" style="s2">infertile, so he stopped using</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.143" end="01:18:52.243" style="s2">protection.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.543" end="01:18:53.943" style="s2">We just talked about kids last night. He</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.243" end="01:18:55.843" style="s2">said he simply doesn&#39;t like children. He</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.943" end="01:18:58.543" style="s2">planted the seed, so he has to accept</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.843" end="01:18:59.843" style="s2">it. Ellie, have it. You must.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.543" end="01:19:01.443" style="s2">I&#39;ve read romance novels for over a</p>
<p begin="01:18:59.843" end="01:19:03.543" style="s2">decade. I know what I&#39;m talking about.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.443" end="01:19:05.243" style="s2">Trust me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.543" end="01:19:07.343" style="s2">You&#39;re only 21 and you&#39;ve read romance</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.243" end="01:19:09.243" style="s2">novels for over 10 years? You started in</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.343" end="01:19:10.743" style="s2">elementary school? Hey, you&#39;re missing</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.243" end="01:19:12.443" style="s2">the point. I&#39;m telling you to have the</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.743" end="01:19:13.743" style="s2">baby even if Landon doesn&#39;t want it, his</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.443" end="01:19:15.243" style="s2">mother will.</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.743" end="01:19:18.243" style="s2">Landon won&#39;t be able to resist and he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.243" end="01:19:20.243" style="s2">have no choice but to be a dad.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.243" end="01:19:22.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? Ellie&#39;s pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.243" end="01:19:24.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. If Ellie gives Landon a child, then</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.643" end="01:19:26.943" style="s2">after Landon dies, everything goes to</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.343" end="01:19:28.143" style="s2">his kid. You won&#39;t get a cent.</p>
<p begin="01:19:26.943" end="01:19:29.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.143" end="01:19:32.543" style="s2">My dear little brother, you&#39;ve pushed me</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.843" end="01:19:34.643" style="s2">this far and think I&#39;ll just roll over?</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.543" end="01:19:37.843" style="s2">I&#39;ll take everything from you. Let&#39;s see</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.643" end="01:19:37.843" style="s2">who&#39;s really in charge.</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.443" end="01:19:44.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, let me drive you home.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.545" end="01:19:46.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. I haven&#39;t confirmed I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.244" end="01:19:47.344" style="s2">pregnant yet. I&#39;ll grab a pregnancy test</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.144" end="01:19:49.045" style="s2">at the pharmacy.</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.344" end="01:19:51.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come with you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.045" end="01:19:51.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.545" end="01:20:00.844" style="s2">Ellie, your husband is waiting for you</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.344" end="01:20:02.144" style="s2">to get off work. Go on over.</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.844" end="01:20:04.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll head off then.</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.144" end="01:20:04.545" style="s2">Bye.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.045" end="01:20:11.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re off work this early today?</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.144" end="01:20:11.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mostly I wanted to go home with you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.644" end="01:20:13.644" style="s2">You won&#39;t [snorts] come work at my</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.244" end="01:20:15.744" style="s2">company so I can&#39;t even commute with</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.644" end="01:20:15.744" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.844" end="01:20:23.644" style="s2">Mom, I&#39;m flat broke. You have to give me</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.945" end="01:20:25.144" style="s2">a way to eat. Do you want to see me dead</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.644" end="01:20:27.744" style="s2">in the street? What would people say</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.144" end="01:20:29.844" style="s2">about the Frosts?</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.744" end="01:20:31.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marcus, this is your brother&#39;s home and</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.844" end="01:20:34.644" style="s2">he&#39;ll be back any minute. Are you sure</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.744" end="01:20:34.644" style="s2">you want to stay here?</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.744" end="01:20:41.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wherever you are, I&#39;ll be there too. Let</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.844" end="01:20:41.644" style="s2">him try to kill me.</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.545" end="01:20:47.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wherever you are, I&#39;ll be there too. Let</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.244" end="01:20:47.045" style="s2">him try to kill me.</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.945" end="01:20:51.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon, it wasn&#39;t me who called your</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.344" end="01:20:52.244" style="s2">brother over. He came on his own.</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.344" end="01:20:53.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.244" end="01:20:54.144" style="s2">you and Ellie go back to your room</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.344" end="01:20:55.144" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.144" end="01:20:58.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.144" end="01:20:58.445" style="s2">Ellie, let&#39;s head back to the room.</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.945" end="01:21:00.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You blew through the money from selling</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.244" end="01:21:02.045" style="s2">the company?</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.945" end="01:21:03.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon, don&#39;t think I don&#39;t know you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.045" end="01:21:05.045" style="s2">had people watching me and setting traps</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.644" end="01:21:06.344" style="s2">to swindle my money. You&#39;re out there</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.045" end="01:21:08.045" style="s2">partying and gambling and you have the</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.344" end="01:21:09.744" style="s2">nerve to blame others? Bro, you haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.045" end="01:21:11.144" style="s2">improved one bit. All these years</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.744" end="01:21:12.445" style="s2">without your status as the eldest Frost</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.144" end="01:21:14.144" style="s2">son and this family&#39;s wealth, you&#39;d have</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.445" end="01:21:15.344" style="s2">starved on the street long ago. I admit</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.144" end="01:21:17.344" style="s2">you&#39;re better at making money, but</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.344" end="01:21:18.644" style="s2">that&#39;s not the only measure of success</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.344" end="01:21:20.144" style="s2">than we measure by how shameless and</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.644" end="01:21:21.644" style="s2">despicable someone is.</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.144" end="01:21:23.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still think I caused Dad to lose</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.644" end="01:21:25.445" style="s2">control?</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.144" end="01:21:26.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it wasn&#39;t you, then who?</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.445" end="01:21:28.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It didn&#39;t surprise me that you drugged</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.744" end="01:21:29.844" style="s2">Dad into a frenzy.</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.344" end="01:21:31.445" style="s2">What shocked me was that when Dad tried</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.844" end="01:21:33.945" style="s2">to strangle Mom, you stood in the</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.445" end="01:21:35.144" style="s2">shadows watching, completely guilt-free.</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.945" end="01:21:36.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A drink.</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.144" end="01:21:41.045" style="s2">I want a drink.</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.945" end="01:21:41.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re drunk again. Stop drinking.</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.445" end="01:21:45.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s you. You&#39;re the hiding the liquor.</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.845" end="01:21:48.146" style="s2">I&#39;ll kill you. See if you dare stop me</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.845" end="01:21:48.146" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.446" end="01:21:53.046" style="s2">MONSTER.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.146" end="01:21:56.146" style="s2">LET GO OF MY MOTHER.</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.646" end="01:22:11.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOM, ARE YOU OKAY?</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.245" end="01:22:13.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LANDON, thank goodness you came back, or</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.845" end="01:22:15.546" style="s2">your father really would have strangled</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.546" end="01:22:16.546" style="s2">me. I don&#39;t know what got into him</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.546" end="01:22:18.446" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.546" end="01:22:21.646" style="s2">He was so wild,</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.446" end="01:22:24.245" style="s2">almost like he&#39;d taken some drug.</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.646" end="01:22:24.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.546" end="01:22:28.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:22:26.146" end="01:22:28.845" style="s2">Dad, what happened?</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.446" end="01:22:34.646" style="s2">Dad isn&#39;t breathing.</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.745" end="01:22:36.646" style="s2">Dad&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.646" end="01:22:38.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon, how cruel of you, killing your</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.646" end="01:22:40.046" style="s2">own father over the inheritance. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.245" end="01:22:42.646" style="s2">calling the police.</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.046" end="01:22:45.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marcus, this has nothing to do with your</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.646" end="01:22:47.745" style="s2">brother. You must not call the police.</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.345" end="01:22:50.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, if you shield this [ __ ] now, we</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.745" end="01:22:52.046" style="s2">might be his next victims.</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.146" end="01:22:53.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t hide in a corner watching. I</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.046" end="01:22:55.046" style="s2">was in my room and never heard a thing</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.646" end="01:22:56.345" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="01:22:55.046" end="01:22:57.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know why I sent mom back to her</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.345" end="01:22:58.946" style="s2">room?</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.745" end="01:23:01.345" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.946" end="01:23:02.946" style="s2">Mom raised you herself. Yet to frame me,</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.345" end="01:23:04.745" style="s2">you nearly killed her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.946" end="01:23:06.446" style="s2">You have no morals. You&#39;re worse than an</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.745" end="01:23:06.946" style="s2">animal. I was afraid our words would</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.446" end="01:23:09.192" style="s2">upset her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.946" end="01:23:10.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I TOLD YOU IT WASN&#39;T ME.</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.192" end="01:23:13.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.646" end="01:23:15.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I HAVE PROOF.</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.345" end="01:23:17.446" style="s2">I HAVE PROOF.</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.646" end="01:23:20.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT PROOF? If you had proof, you</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.446" end="01:23:22.245" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t have stayed silent until now.</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.546" end="01:23:24.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forensics found a rare drug in dad&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.245" end="01:23:26.146" style="s2">body, and I had people find the same</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.046" end="01:23:27.146" style="s2">chemical traces in your car.</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.146" end="01:23:28.646" style="s2">You&#39;re smart.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.146" end="01:23:29.745" style="s2">This drug only makes people agitated,</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.646" end="01:23:31.245" style="s2">not dead.</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.745" end="01:23:33.245" style="s2">So even if I handed the evidence to the</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.245" end="01:23:34.646" style="s2">police, they couldn&#39;t touch you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.245" end="01:23:36.446" style="s2">But it&#39;s enough to make mom see who you</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.646" end="01:23:38.546" style="s2">really are.</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.446" end="01:23:40.745" style="s2">You didn&#39;t tell mom, did you?</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.546" end="01:23:42.546" style="s2">Mom can&#39;t take stress, so I never told</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.745" end="01:23:44.646" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.546" end="01:23:46.247" style="s2">But she already figured out it was you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.646" end="01:23:48.247" style="s2">If you want to keep a secret,</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.247" end="01:23:50.547" style="s2">don&#39;t do the deed.</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.247" end="01:23:51.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I set it up back then. But whose</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.547" end="01:23:53.747" style="s2">fault is it that dad always wanted to</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.947" end="01:23:55.447" style="s2">give the shares to you? He never stopped</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.747" end="01:23:56.947" style="s2">saying I was worse than you. I became a</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.447" end="01:23:58.347" style="s2">waste because he kept drilling it into</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.947" end="01:24:00.747" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.347" end="01:24:02.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re beyond saving. I&#39;m homeless now.</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.747" end="01:24:04.147" style="s2">You have to find me a place.</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.947" end="01:24:06.247" style="s2">If I end up on the streets and hit the</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.147" end="01:24:08.147" style="s2">headlines, it&#39;ll be the Frosts who look</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.247" end="01:24:10.347" style="s2">bad. Do you think my success comes from</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.147" end="01:24:11.947" style="s2">the Frosts? I spared your sorry life</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.347" end="01:24:13.247" style="s2">just so you&#39;d suffer.</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.947" end="01:24:14.547" style="s2">Go ahead and embarrass yourself out</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.247" end="01:24:16.647" style="s2">there. See if it affects me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.547" end="01:24:17.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon, don&#39;t go too far.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.647" end="01:24:19.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.847" end="01:24:20.647" style="s2">Don&#39;t bother my mother again or I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.247" end="01:24:23.047" style="s2">hesitate to take that sorry life of</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.647" end="01:24:23.047" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.247" end="01:24:33.347" style="s2">Mom, you heard everything?</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.747" end="01:24:34.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t I tell you to stay in your room?</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.347" end="01:24:36.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted to know what you two would talk</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.947" end="01:24:37.847" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.047" end="01:24:39.547" style="s2">I truly regret it. My spoiling of your</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.847" end="01:24:41.747" style="s2">brother turned him into a complete waste</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.547" end="01:24:44.147" style="s2">and a monster. He not only killed his</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.747" end="01:24:45.947" style="s2">father but nearly destroyed you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.147" end="01:24:47.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t cry.</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.947" end="01:24:48.347" style="s2">It&#39;s over now.</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.147" end="01:24:50.947" style="s2">From now on, I won&#39;t let him get</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.347" end="01:24:50.947" style="s2">anywhere near you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.047" end="01:24:53.447" style="s2">Is my mother asleep?</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.547" end="01:24:54.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.447" end="01:24:56.747" style="s2">What upsets her most is feeling like she</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.947" end="01:24:57.847" style="s2">failed you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.747" end="01:24:58.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.847" end="01:25:00.847" style="s2">When I was little, she favored my</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.847" end="01:25:02.747" style="s2">brother. After all, he&#39;s the eldest son,</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.847" end="01:25:04.047" style="s2">the one she raised herself.</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.747" end="01:25:05.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t it hurt that your mother plays</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.047" end="01:25:07.147" style="s2">favorites?</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.347" end="01:25:08.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a lie to say it doesn&#39;t hurt. But</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.147" end="01:25:10.347" style="s2">favoritism aside, she&#39;s always been good</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.747" end="01:25:11.747" style="s2">to me too, so I can&#39;t just stand by and</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.347" end="01:25:12.947" style="s2">watch anyone hurt her.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.747" end="01:25:15.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You went to prison because you killed</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.947" end="01:25:15.347" style="s2">your father.</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.747" end="01:25:18.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.947" end="01:25:20.947" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t stopped him, my mother would</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.147" end="01:25:20.947" style="s2">have been the one to die.</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.747" end="01:25:25.434" style="s2">Sweetheart,</p>
<p begin="01:25:22.847" end="01:25:26.147" style="s2">did I scare you?</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.434" end="01:25:27.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.147" end="01:25:29.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father must have had a drinking</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.247" end="01:25:31.047" style="s2">problem, right? Otherwise, your brother</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.047" end="01:25:33.147" style="s2">couldn&#39;t have pulled it off so easily.</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.047" end="01:25:34.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, my father was a bastard. But</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.147" end="01:25:36.147" style="s2">unlike my brother, reckless as he was,</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.647" end="01:25:37.647" style="s2">he had real ability. That&#39;s how the</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.147" end="01:25:38.947" style="s2">Frosts built so much wealth.</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.647" end="01:25:42.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your brother inherited your father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.947" end="01:25:43.947" style="s2">flaws and you inherited his strength.</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.047" end="01:25:45.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could say that.</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.947" end="01:25:48.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you don&#39;t want kids because you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.047" end="01:25:48.948" style="s2">afraid they&#39;ll your father&#39;s bad genes?</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.049" end="01:25:51.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you really want a child?</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.749" end="01:25:53.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before I met you, if someone had asked</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.948" end="01:25:55.049" style="s2">me that, I&#39;d have said it doesn&#39;t matter</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.349" end="01:25:56.549" style="s2">whether I marry or have children. But</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.049" end="01:25:58.249" style="s2">since I&#39;ve been with you,</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.549" end="01:25:58.749" style="s2">I really do want a child of our own</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.249" end="01:25:59.749" style="s2">because</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.749" end="01:26:01.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie,</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.749" end="01:26:03.849" style="s2">we can get a cat or a dog and treat it</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.249" end="01:26:03.849" style="s2">as our child.</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.049" end="01:26:07.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what if I&#39;m already pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.349" end="01:26:12.849" style="s2">But what if I&#39;m already pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.749" end="01:26:12.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, are you pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.948" end="01:26:16.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said if.</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.448" end="01:26:17.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, we&#39;ll use protection so you</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.049" end="01:26:19.349" style="s2">won&#39;t get pregnant or I&#39;ll get a</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.948" end="01:26:21.549" style="s2">vasectomy.</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.349" end="01:26:24.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;d rather have a cat or a dog rather</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.549" end="01:26:25.849" style="s2">get a vasectomy than want a child. If I</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.049" end="01:26:26.849" style="s2">really am pregnant now,</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.849" end="01:26:28.249" style="s2">that news would hit him like a</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.849" end="01:26:29.549" style="s2">bombshell.</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.249" end="01:26:32.249" style="s2">Let&#39;s talk about it later. I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.549" end="01:26:32.249" style="s2">take a shower.</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.049" end="01:26:37.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Officer Grant. Did Ethan talk?</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.448" end="01:26:39.149" style="s2">He admitted your brother told him to go</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.649" end="01:26:40.349" style="s2">after you, but the bomb was his own</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.149" end="01:26:41.948" style="s2">doing. It had nothing to do with your</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.349" end="01:26:43.948" style="s2">brother. So the main responsibility</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.948" end="01:26:45.549" style="s2">falls on Ethan. Right. Tomorrow I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.948" end="01:26:46.948" style="s2">bring your brother in for questioning.</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.549" end="01:26:48.448" style="s2">As long as he claims he only had Ethan</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.948" end="01:26:52.149" style="s2">teach you a lesson rather than kill you,</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.448" end="01:26:53.749" style="s2">he&#39;ll avoid any charges. Understood.</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.149" end="01:26:55.349" style="s2">Marcus, since you don&#39;t want to do</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.749" end="01:26:58.549" style="s2">prison time, then go taste the</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.349" end="01:26:58.549" style="s2">bitterness of real life.</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.349" end="01:27:04.948" style="s2">Where&#39;s Ellie? Has she eaten breakfast?</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.349" end="01:27:06.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The missus hasn&#39;t eaten. She said it was</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.948" end="01:27:08.649" style="s2">too early and she had no appetite. She&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.948" end="01:27:11.849" style="s2">eat when she got to work.</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.649" end="01:27:13.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did she leave so early today?</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.849" end="01:27:14.448" style="s2">Sweetheart, why were you up so early?</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.448" end="01:27:16.948" style="s2">The housekeeper said you skipped</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.448" end="01:27:18.549" style="s2">breakfast. Is it your stomach?</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.948" end="01:27:20.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I took so much time off before that my</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.549" end="01:27:22.448" style="s2">work fell way behind, so I need to get</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.549" end="01:27:23.649" style="s2">back to work properly now.</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.448" end="01:27:25.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re running out of time, I can</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.649" end="01:27:27.349" style="s2">push back the order delivery dates.</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.349" end="01:27:29.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I can handle it.</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.349" end="01:27:32.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. If anything comes up, you</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.049" end="01:27:32.549" style="s2">have to tell me. Don&#39;t push yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.948" end="01:27:44.849" style="s2">You&#39;re pregnant. Do you plan to keep the</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.549" end="01:27:46.549" style="s2">baby?</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.849" end="01:27:48.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t decided yet.</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.549" end="01:27:49.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you married?</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.349" end="01:27:50.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my husband who</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.250" end="01:27:51.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; want kids.</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.550" end="01:27:53.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.850" end="01:27:54.850" style="s2">You&#39;ve only just become pregnant, so you</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.150" end="01:27:56.550" style="s2">still have time to think it over. But</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.850" end="01:27:57.850" style="s2">don&#39;t wait too long. The further along</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.550" end="01:27:59.950" style="s2">you are, the harder an abortion is on</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.850" end="01:28:01.650" style="s2">your body.</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.950" end="01:28:03.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll go home and think it over.</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.650" end="01:28:06.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.750" end="01:28:07.850" style="s2">Doctor, I don&#39;t like children, but my</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.050" end="01:28:09.550" style="s2">wife seems to really want one. Why don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.850" end="01:28:11.050" style="s2">you like children?</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.550" end="01:28:12.550" style="s2">I don&#39;t like my father&#39;s genes, so I</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.050" end="01:28:13.850" style="s2">don&#39;t want to carry them on.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.550" end="01:28:15.750" style="s2">A child&#39;s temperament can be shaped</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.850" end="01:28:17.150" style="s2">through upbringing. My mother raised my</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.750" end="01:28:19.250" style="s2">brother and treated him well, yet he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.150" end="01:28:20.650" style="s2">still a complete bastard. If my child</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.250" end="01:28:21.950" style="s2">turned out that way, I&#39;d rather not have</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.650" end="01:28:24.350" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.950" end="01:28:26.050" style="s2">Do you love your wife?</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.350" end="01:28:27.550" style="s2">Do you love your wife?</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.050" end="01:28:29.950" style="s2">Of course I love my wife, otherwise I</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.550" end="01:28:32.650" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t be seeing a therapist.</p>
<p begin="01:28:29.950" end="01:28:34.850" style="s2">So you realize you have a problem?</p>
<p begin="01:28:32.650" end="01:28:36.550" style="s2">My whole [snorts] family has problems.</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.850" end="01:28:38.450" style="s2">But you&#39;re quite accomplished. What if</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.550" end="01:28:39.750" style="s2">your child turns out like you? What if</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.450" end="01:28:42.350" style="s2">they turn out like my father or my</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.750" end="01:28:43.850" style="s2">brother? Then let&#39;s think worst case. If</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.350" end="01:28:45.950" style="s2">the child were like your father or your</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.850" end="01:28:47.450" style="s2">brother, what would you do?</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.950" end="01:28:48.850" style="s2">I&#39;d be in agony.</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.450" end="01:28:50.350" style="s2">What if the child took after you or your</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.850" end="01:28:51.850" style="s2">wife?</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.350" end="01:28:53.650" style="s2">Then I&#39;d be overjoyed.</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.850" end="01:28:55.650" style="s2">Best of all, if they took after my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.650" end="01:28:57.350" style="s2">She&#39;s so smart and adorable. So for the</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.650" end="01:28:58.550" style="s2">chance of that good outcome, why not</p>
<p begin="01:28:57.350" end="01:29:00.350" style="s2">give it a try?</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.550" end="01:29:01.750" style="s2">But if it&#39;s a bad outcome, it&#39;ll ruin my</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.350" end="01:29:03.850" style="s2">feelings for my wife and throw my</p>
<p begin="01:29:01.750" end="01:29:05.750" style="s2">peaceful life into chaos. I understand</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.850" end="01:29:07.050" style="s2">your concerns, but having a child isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.750" end="01:29:08.250" style="s2">just about you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.050" end="01:29:11.150" style="s2">Since you love your wife, you should</p>
<p begin="01:29:08.250" end="01:29:11.150" style="s2">respect her wishes.</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.550" end="01:29:16.550" style="s2">Why are you here? Isn&#39;t today a workday?</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.950" end="01:29:17.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost didn&#39;t go in this morning, so</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.550" end="01:29:19.850" style="s2">I had nothing to do. Figured I&#39;d come</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.950" end="01:29:20.650" style="s2">see you. Eric, how&#39;s your recovery</p>
<p begin="01:29:19.850" end="01:29:22.250" style="s2">going?</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.650" end="01:29:24.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty good. How do you like working for</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.250" end="01:29:26.650" style="s2">Mr. Frost?</p>
<p begin="01:29:24.350" end="01:29:28.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost is incredibly capable. Working</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.650" end="01:29:29.250" style="s2">beside him, I often feel like I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.150" end="01:29:30.950" style="s2">skilled enough.</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.250" end="01:29:32.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I felt the same way once.</p>
<p begin="01:29:30.950" end="01:29:33.450" style="s2">Get through this stage and your skills</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.150" end="01:29:34.450" style="s2">will improve a lot.</p>
<p begin="01:29:33.450" end="01:29:35.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.450" end="01:29:38.750" style="s2">I&#39;ll work hard to improve myself so I</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.950" end="01:29:38.750" style="s2">don&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.650" end="01:29:43.350" style="s2">What? Mr. Frost went to the office?</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.650" end="01:29:44.750" style="s2">Okay, I&#39;ll head right back. Eric, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.350" end="01:29:47.150" style="s2">heading back to the office.</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.750" end="01:29:50.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.150" end="01:29:50.550" style="s2">Something&#39;s off about that scent.</p>
<p begin="01:29:50.650" end="01:29:53.151" style="s2">This scent,</p>
<p begin="01:29:51.950" end="01:29:55.651" style="s2">I feel like I&#39;ve smelled it somewhere</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.151" end="01:29:56.851" style="s2">before. So this is Marcus&#39;s car?</p>
<p begin="01:29:55.651" end="01:29:59.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the car Mr. Marcus has been</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.851" end="01:29:59.351" style="s2">driving lately.</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.052" end="01:30:02.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a thorough look at the car and see</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.151" end="01:30:05.052" style="s2">if you can find any drug residue.</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.751" end="01:30:05.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.432" end="01:30:10.552" style="s2">[snorts and crying]</p>
<p begin="01:30:07.751" end="01:30:11.951" style="s2">What a scent. So fragrant.</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.552" end="01:30:13.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really is the perfume scent. This</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.951" end="01:30:15.052" style="s2">perfume is for his own use. It should be</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.451" end="01:30:16.751" style="s2">harmless. I know the perfume isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.052" end="01:30:17.751" style="s2">toxic. I just find this scent pretty</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.751" end="01:30:18.951" style="s2">distinctive.</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.751" end="01:30:21.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfumes like this for the wealthy are</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.951" end="01:30:23.351" style="s2">probably custom blended by a perfumer.</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.052" end="01:30:25.052" style="s2">You can&#39;t buy them on the market.</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.351" end="01:30:26.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The perfume on Zoe just now. It&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.052" end="01:30:29.151" style="s2">same scent I smelled in Marcus&#39;s car</p>
<p begin="01:30:26.552" end="01:30:30.651" style="s2">half a year ago. Could Zoe know Marcus?</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.151" end="01:30:31.951" style="s2">Impossible. Zoe came straight to the</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.651" end="01:30:33.351" style="s2">company after graduation and worked</p>
<p begin="01:30:31.951" end="01:30:35.951" style="s2">under me. The scent is probably just a</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.351" end="01:30:35.951" style="s2">coincidence.</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.552" end="01:30:47.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, have you told Mr. Frost that</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.151" end="01:30:49.151" style="s2">you&#39;re pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.552" end="01:30:50.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t even confirmed last night, so</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.151" end="01:30:51.552" style="s2">what would I tell him? Why are you in</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.751" end="01:30:53.052" style="s2">such a hurry?</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.552" end="01:30:54.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re definitely pregnant. That&#39;s how</p>
<p begin="01:30:53.052" end="01:30:55.751" style="s2">it always goes in romance novels. The</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.552" end="01:30:57.451" style="s2">moment the bead ran throws up, she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.751" end="01:30:59.052" style="s2">pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:30:57.451" end="01:30:59.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really am pregnant, but I don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.052" end="01:31:00.951" style="s2">whether to tell him.</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.951" end="01:31:04.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell him. Tell him right now. If you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:31:00.951" end="01:31:04.151" style="s2">too embarrassed, I&#39;ll do it for you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:05.052" end="01:31:08.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daisy, I haven&#39;t decided yet. Let me</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.052" end="01:31:10.251" style="s2">tell him once I&#39;ve thought it through.</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.751" end="01:31:11.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pregnant and the baby is</p>
<p begin="01:31:10.251" end="01:31:13.052" style="s2">Landon&#39;s. That&#39;s a done deal. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.751" end="01:31:14.351" style="s2">there to think about?</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.052" end="01:31:16.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He thinks his family&#39;s genes aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.351" end="01:31:17.851" style="s2">good, so he&#39;s reluctant to have kids. If</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.351" end="01:31:20.151" style="s2">he won&#39;t have kids, then is he planning</p>
<p begin="01:31:17.851" end="01:31:22.151" style="s2">to donate all his fortune to charity?</p>
<p begin="01:31:20.151" end="01:31:23.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know. He&#39;s a person who focuses</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.151" end="01:31:25.351" style="s2">on the here and now.</p>
<p begin="01:31:23.552" end="01:31:27.151" style="s2">And I think the same way. If we don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:31:25.351" end="01:31:28.351" style="s2">have kids, we can still live a wonderful</p>
<p begin="01:31:27.151" end="01:31:29.951" style="s2">life together.</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.351" end="01:31:31.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, you&#39;re just going to listen to</p>
<p begin="01:31:29.951" end="01:31:34.851" style="s2">him and give up having kids without even</p>
<p begin="01:31:31.552" end="01:31:34.851" style="s2">talking it over with your husband?</p>
<p begin="01:31:36.751" end="01:31:40.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I plan to find a chance to talk to him</p>
<p begin="01:31:38.251" end="01:31:43.052" style="s2">about having a baby. If we can keep the</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.351" end="01:31:44.151" style="s2">child, that would be best.</p>
<p begin="01:31:43.052" end="01:31:45.951" style="s2">This is the first time I&#39;ve met a man</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.151" end="01:31:47.751" style="s2">who doesn&#39;t want kids.</p>
<p begin="01:31:45.951" end="01:31:49.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daisy, everyone grows up in a different</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.751" end="01:31:51.552" style="s2">environment, so we think differently.</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.751" end="01:31:52.851" style="s2">Let&#39;s just get to work.</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.552" end="01:31:54.352" style="s2">Once I finish the patterns for all the</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.851" end="01:31:55.452" style="s2">sizes, we&#39;ll send them to the factory</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.352" end="01:31:57.752" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.452" end="01:31:57.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.052" end="01:32:02.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie Hart, this is Marcus, Landon&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.952" end="01:32:03.952" style="s2">older brother. Landon has a secret he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:02.653" end="01:32:05.552" style="s2">never told you and I think I should tell</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.952" end="01:32:07.452" style="s2">you in person. I&#39;ll wait for you at the</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.552" end="01:32:09.752" style="s2">Emerald Bistro at noon today.</p>
<p begin="01:32:07.452" end="01:32:12.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; has a secret? there be another unspoken</p>
<p begin="01:32:09.752" end="01:32:12.852" style="s2">reason he won&#39;t have kids?</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.653" end="01:32:19.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; there, sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.052" end="01:32:21.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; your message you said Landon has a</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.352" end="01:32:23.052" style="s2">secret. What secret?</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.852" end="01:32:25.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t tell Landon you were coming</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.052" end="01:32:25.852" style="s2">to see me, did you?</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.552" end="01:32:31.552" style="s2">it back after you&#39;ve read it.</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.552" end="01:32:36.153" style="s2">Landon has a mental illness and that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.552" end="01:32:37.352" style="s2">been a secret of the Frost family all</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.153" end="01:32:39.052" style="s2">along.</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.352" end="01:32:40.552" style="s2">But now Landon has completely cut ties</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.052" end="01:32:43.252" style="s2">with me, so I can tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:32:40.552" end="01:32:44.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure this report is real?</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.252" end="01:32:46.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t believe me, you can go ask</p>
<p begin="01:32:44.552" end="01:32:48.452" style="s2">him, but he&#39;s too proud to admit it.</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.852" end="01:32:50.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No wonder Landon won&#39;t have kids with</p>
<p begin="01:32:48.452" end="01:32:52.653" style="s2">me. He said he doesn&#39;t like children. If</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.852" end="01:32:54.114" style="s2">he weren&#39;t sick, he couldn&#39;t be so firm</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.653" end="01:32:54.852" style="s2">about not having them.</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.114" end="01:32:55.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.852" end="01:32:57.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People with mental illness shouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.852" end="01:32:58.752" style="s2">have kids, you know? Otherwise you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:32:57.352" end="01:33:00.452" style="s2">bring a little lunatic into the world</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.752" end="01:33:03.552" style="s2">and it would only hurt people.</p>
<p begin="01:33:00.452" end="01:33:03.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s none of your business.</p>
<p begin="01:33:04.752" end="01:33:08.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landon has a mental illness and that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.752" end="01:33:10.352" style="s2">been a secret of the Frost family all</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.352" end="01:33:12.052" style="s2">along. People with mental illness</p>
<p begin="01:33:10.352" end="01:33:13.852" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t have kids. Otherwise you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.052" end="01:33:16.952" style="s2">bring a little lunatic into the world</p>
<p begin="01:33:13.852" end="01:33:16.952" style="s2">and it would only hurt people.</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.852" end="01:33:21.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dr. Whitfield, I want to get an</p>
<p begin="01:33:19.052" end="01:33:23.552" style="s2">abortion. Please schedule a time for the</p>
<p begin="01:33:21.052" end="01:33:23.552" style="s2">surgery.</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.952" end="01:33:40.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s you?</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.153" end="01:33:42.552" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you at the hospital? What are</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.352" end="01:33:44.153" style="s2">you sneaking around the company for?</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.552" end="01:33:46.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, you&#39;re off work so early today?</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.153" end="01:33:47.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. I&#39;m a married man now, so of</p>
<p begin="01:33:46.052" end="01:33:49.653" style="s2">course I head home early.</p>
<p begin="01:33:47.952" end="01:33:51.052" style="s2">Now, what are you really doing at the</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.653" end="01:33:52.452" style="s2">company?</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.052" end="01:33:54.552" style="s2">I still haven&#39;t figured out whether Zoe</p>
<p begin="01:33:52.452" end="01:33:56.052" style="s2">and Marcus really have a connection, so</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.552" end="01:33:57.352" style="s2">I&#39;d better not tell Mr. Frost about it</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.052" end="01:33:58.554" style="s2">yet.</p>
<p begin="01:33:57.352" end="01:33:59.754" style="s2">I rested for so long that I really</p>
<p begin="01:33:58.554" end="01:34:01.554" style="s2">missed the office, so I figured I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.754" end="01:34:03.354" style="s2">swing by now that everyone&#39;s gone home.</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.554" end="01:34:04.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you crazy? If you&#39;re told to rest,</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.354" end="01:34:06.754" style="s2">rest well. You won&#39;t get this longest</p>
<p begin="01:34:04.954" end="01:34:09.154" style="s2">patient again.</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.754" end="01:34:10.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, what do you think of Zoe?</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.154" end="01:34:11.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want the truth or</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.354" end="01:34:13.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The truth, of course. She&#39;s only</p>
<p begin="01:34:11.854" end="01:34:14.654" style="s2">temporarily filling in for you, so I</p>
<p begin="01:34:13.654" end="01:34:15.954" style="s2">haven&#39;t let her handle much of the</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.654" end="01:34:17.454" style="s2">important work.</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.954" end="01:34:19.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You praised her ability, and true</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.454" end="01:34:21.054" style="s2">enough, but she&#39;s an unmarried woman and</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.354" end="01:34:22.254" style="s2">I&#39;m a married man. Don&#39;t arrange female</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.054" end="01:34:24.154" style="s2">staff like that for me again.</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.254" end="01:34:25.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, that&#39;s my fault. My awareness</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.154" end="01:34:26.454" style="s2">wasn&#39;t up to par. I&#39;ll be careful from</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.754" end="01:34:27.254" style="s2">now on.</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.454" end="01:34:30.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.254" end="01:34:30.354" style="s2">I&#39;ll drive you back to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.354" end="01:34:35.654" style="s2">Zoe, why are you so late tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.454" end="01:34:37.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I was leaving work, I noticed</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.654" end="01:34:39.054" style="s2">someone following me. Could your brother</p>
<p begin="01:34:37.354" end="01:34:41.154" style="s2">be starting to suspect me?</p>
<p begin="01:34:39.054" end="01:34:42.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. I&#39;ve never told anyone about</p>
<p begin="01:34:41.154" end="01:34:43.954" style="s2">our relationship.</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.054" end="01:34:45.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I&#39;m just being paranoid. I always</p>
<p begin="01:34:43.954" end="01:34:46.354" style="s2">feel like your brother is holding back</p>
<p begin="01:34:45.154" end="01:34:48.354" style="s2">from me and won&#39;t let me handle much</p>
<p begin="01:34:46.354" end="01:34:49.654" style="s2">important work. Every day all he has me</p>
<p begin="01:34:48.354" end="01:34:51.154" style="s2">do is keep tabs on his movements,</p>
<p begin="01:34:49.654" end="01:34:53.254" style="s2">nothing else.</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.154" end="01:34:54.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s naturally suspicious by nature. It</p>
<p begin="01:34:53.254" end="01:34:56.654" style="s2">took Eric years working for him to earn</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.754" end="01:34:57.854" style="s2">his full trust, so it&#39;s only normal that</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.654" end="01:34:59.554" style="s2">he doesn&#39;t trust you yet.</p>
<p begin="01:34:57.854" end="01:35:01.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what should I do next? After Ellie</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.554" end="01:35:03.054" style="s2">Hart goes for her abortion, should I</p>
<p begin="01:35:01.154" end="01:35:04.554" style="s2">find a chance to kill your brother? But</p>
<p begin="01:35:03.054" end="01:35:05.554" style="s2">then Ellie, as his widow, would inherit</p>
<p begin="01:35:04.554" end="01:35:08.554" style="s2">his estate, too.</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.554" end="01:35:08.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then kill Ellie Hart, too.</p>
<p begin="01:35:08.954" end="01:35:11.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.954" end="01:35:12.454" style="s2">Only this way can you reclaim everything</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.354" end="01:35:14.754" style="s2">in the Frost family and then we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:35:12.454" end="01:35:16.354" style="s2">finally have good days ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:35:14.754" end="01:35:17.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoe, if this works, I &#39;ll marry you</p>
<p begin="01:35:16.354" end="01:35:20.654" style="s2">right away. I &#39;ll make you the grand</p>
<p begin="01:35:17.954" end="01:35:20.654" style="s2">Mrs. Frost.</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.454" end="01:35:27.754" style="s2">Honey, guess who I ran into today?</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.154" end="01:35:28.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.754" end="01:35:30.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eric.</p>
<p begin="01:35:28.754" end="01:35:31.754" style="s2">He said he was bored at the hospital, so</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.454" end="01:35:34.354" style="s2">he snuck over to the company for a</p>
<p begin="01:35:31.754" end="01:35:35.754" style="s2">stroll. Isn&#39;t that ridiculous?</p>
<p begin="01:35:34.354" end="01:35:36.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surely he doesn&#39;t want to start working</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.754" end="01:35:38.754" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.854" end="01:35:39.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. I&#39;m planning to let him work from</p>
<p begin="01:35:38.754" end="01:35:41.154" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="01:35:39.454" end="01:35:44.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Since he&#39;s willing to work,</p>
<p begin="01:35:41.154" end="01:35:44.154" style="s2">let&#39;s respect his wishes.</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.554" end="01:35:48.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey,</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.554" end="01:35:51.654" style="s2">I went to see a psychologist today.</p>
<p begin="01:35:48.954" end="01:35:53.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:35:51.654" end="01:35:54.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a hard time accepting the idea of</p>
<p begin="01:35:53.154" end="01:35:56.254" style="s2">our having a child, but I can tell you</p>
<p begin="01:35:54.854" end="01:35:57.554" style="s2">want one, so I went to see a</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.254" end="01:35:58.654" style="s2">psychologist.</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.554" end="01:36:00.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s not have one if you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.654" end="01:36:02.356" style="s2">accept it. As long as the two of us are</p>
<p begin="01:36:00.656" end="01:36:04.756" style="s2">together and happy, a baby doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.356" end="01:36:04.756" style="s2">matter.</p>
<p begin="01:36:05.955" end="01:36:08.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.156" end="01:36:10.055" style="s2">Because you matter more to me than any</p>
<p begin="01:36:08.455" end="01:36:11.356" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.055" end="01:36:12.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie says I matter more to her than a</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.356" end="01:36:14.555" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="01:36:12.555" end="01:36:16.055" style="s2">She can give up having kids for me. So</p>
<p begin="01:36:14.555" end="01:36:17.156" style="s2">why can&#39;t I overcome this mental block</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.055" end="01:36:18.356" style="s2">for her?</p>
<p begin="01:36:17.156" end="01:36:20.756" style="s2">Tomorrow I&#39;ll start preparing for a</p>
<p begin="01:36:18.356" end="01:36:20.756" style="s2">baby.</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.656" end="01:36:28.055" style="s2">Where&#39;s my wife? Did she go out again?</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.656" end="01:36:30.555" style="s2">Did she have breakfast today?</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.055" end="01:36:31.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam had breakfast today, but not much.</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.555" end="01:36:32.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="01:36:31.555" end="01:36:34.955" style="s2">Do you know what preparation is needed</p>
<p begin="01:36:32.656" end="01:36:36.156" style="s2">to try for a baby?</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.955" end="01:36:37.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and madam are planning to have a</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.156" end="01:36:40.055" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.455" end="01:36:41.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even though I don&#39;t like kids, she does.</p>
<p begin="01:36:40.055" end="01:36:43.055" style="s2">I want her to stay by my side forever,</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.656" end="01:36:44.455" style="s2">so it&#39;s better to have one.</p>
<p begin="01:36:43.055" end="01:36:45.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s really wonderful that you can think</p>
<p begin="01:36:44.455" end="01:36:47.055" style="s2">that way.</p>
<p begin="01:36:45.656" end="01:36:48.656" style="s2">Love needs both sides to give and</p>
<p begin="01:36:47.055" end="01:36:50.356" style="s2">nurture it. Once you have a child</p>
<p begin="01:36:48.656" end="01:36:51.555" style="s2">together, your bond will only grow</p>
<p begin="01:36:50.356" end="01:36:53.156" style="s2">deeper.</p>
<p begin="01:36:51.555" end="01:36:54.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what I think.</p>
<p begin="01:36:53.156" end="01:36:56.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll have the driver buy some folic acid</p>
<p begin="01:36:54.856" end="01:36:57.356" style="s2">later. You two can start taking it right</p>
<p begin="01:36:56.455" end="01:36:58.356" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="01:36:57.356" end="01:37:00.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:36:58.356" end="01:37:02.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Besides folic acid, you should also step</p>
<p begin="01:37:00.256" end="01:37:04.156" style="s2">up your exercise. During this time, no</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.356" end="01:37:04.955" style="s2">smoking and definitely no alcohol.</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.156" end="01:37:06.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.955" end="01:37:08.656" style="s2">When the driver buys the folic acid,</p>
<p begin="01:37:06.555" end="01:37:10.055" style="s2">have him send a bottle over to Ellie.</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.656" end="01:37:13.455" style="s2">If she learns I&#39;m actively preparing for</p>
<p begin="01:37:10.055" end="01:37:13.455" style="s2">a baby, she&#39;ll be thrilled.</p>
<p begin="01:37:14.856" end="01:37:18.656" style="s2">Daisy, did Ellie not come in today?</p>
<p begin="01:37:17.156" end="01:37:20.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie took the morning off, but don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.656" end="01:37:21.955" style="s2">worry. We won&#39;t fall behind on the</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.055" end="01:37:23.856" style="s2">orders.</p>
<p begin="01:37:21.955" end="01:37:25.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh. I was planning to talk to her about</p>
<p begin="01:37:23.856" end="01:37:25.955" style="s2">Vanessa.</p>
<p begin="01:37:25.055" end="01:37:27.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about Vanessa?</p>
<p begin="01:37:25.955" end="01:37:30.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wasn&#39;t Vanessa arrested before? She got</p>
<p begin="01:37:27.756" end="01:37:32.055" style="s2">people to bully Ellie. She deserved it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.055" end="01:37:33.156" style="s2">Now she&#39;s been sentenced to 6 months.</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.055" end="01:37:34.055" style="s2">That record will follow her for the rest</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.156" end="01:37:34.756" style="s2">of her life.</p>
<p begin="01:37:34.055" end="01:37:35.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="01:37:34.756" end="01:37:37.156" style="s2">And what about [snorts] that Ethan</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.555" end="01:37:39.656" style="s2">Brooks?</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.156" end="01:37:40.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What Ethan did is no small crime.</p>
<p begin="01:37:39.656" end="01:37:42.055" style="s2">Even if he isn&#39;t given the death</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.656" end="01:37:44.055" style="s2">penalty, he won&#39;t get out for a good 8</p>
<p begin="01:37:42.055" end="01:37:45.955" style="s2">to 10 years.</p>
<p begin="01:37:44.055" end="01:37:47.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="01:37:45.955" end="01:37:49.055" style="s2">Boss, there&#39;s someone at the gate who</p>
<p begin="01:37:47.356" end="01:37:50.555" style="s2">says he&#39;s the Frost family&#39;s driver here</p>
<p begin="01:37:49.055" end="01:37:53.256" style="s2">to deliver something to Ellie.</p>
<p begin="01:37:50.555" end="01:37:53.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quick, let him in.</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.256" end="01:37:57.856" style="s2">Where&#39;s my madam?</p>
<p begin="01:37:56.256" end="01:37:59.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie took the morning off. You&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="01:37:57.856" end="01:37:59.756" style="s2">Frost driver. How could you not know</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.156" end="01:38:00.555" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.756" end="01:38:01.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:38:00.555" end="01:38:03.357" style="s2">Madam didn&#39;t tell the household she was</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.756" end="01:38:05.556" style="s2">taking leave. otherwise I wouldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="01:38:03.357" end="01:38:06.857" style="s2">been sent to bring her something.</p>
<p begin="01:38:05.556" end="01:38:07.957" style="s2">She&#39;s Ellie&#39;s assistant. You can give it</p>
<p begin="01:38:06.857" end="01:38:10.056" style="s2">to her.</p>
<p begin="01:38:07.957" end="01:38:13.056" style="s2">This is folic acid, one tablet a day,</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.056" end="01:38:13.056" style="s2">and make sure our madam takes it.</p>
<p begin="01:38:13.556" end="01:38:17.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this folic acid Landon had the driver</p>
<p begin="01:38:15.556" end="01:38:19.556" style="s2">send? Isn&#39;t folic acid for trying to</p>
<p begin="01:38:17.556" end="01:38:20.963" style="s2">conceive? Could Landon actually want a</p>
<p begin="01:38:19.556" end="01:38:21.556" style="s2">baby with Ellie?</p>
<p begin="01:38:20.963" end="01:38:23.056" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:38:21.556" end="01:38:25.556" style="s2">Oh my god, Ellie took leave. She&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.056" end="01:38:26.757" style="s2">going to get an abortion, is she?</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.556" end="01:38:28.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie Hart&#39;s already gone into the</p>
<p begin="01:38:26.757" end="01:38:29.757" style="s2">hospital. She scheduled the abortion</p>
<p begin="01:38:28.556" end="01:38:31.656" style="s2">surgery for this morning.</p>
<p begin="01:38:29.757" end="01:38:33.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Later I&#39;ll see if I can find a</p>
<p begin="01:38:31.656" end="01:38:35.757" style="s2">chance to kill Landon.</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.457" end="01:38:37.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoe, you must seize this opportunity. If</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.757" end="01:38:40.457" style="s2">it works this time, you&#39;ll be Mrs. Frost</p>
<p begin="01:38:37.957" end="01:38:40.457" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="01:38:41.357" end="01:38:44.556" style="s2">Does your husband know about this?</p>
<p begin="01:38:44.857" end="01:38:47.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:38:46.056" end="01:38:48.757" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t want kids, which is why I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:38:47.556" end="01:38:50.257" style="s2">having this surgery.</p>
<p begin="01:38:48.757" end="01:38:51.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he doesn&#39;t want kids, how did he even</p>
<p begin="01:38:50.257" end="01:38:53.556" style="s2">get you pregnant? And now you&#39;re having</p>
<p begin="01:38:51.957" end="01:38:54.957" style="s2">surgery and he won&#39;t even come with you.</p>
<p begin="01:38:53.556" end="01:38:56.556" style="s2">What kind of husband did you pick?</p>
<p begin="01:38:54.957" end="01:38:58.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband is wonderful. I just didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:38:56.556" end="01:39:00.757" style="s2">ask him to come with me.</p>
<p begin="01:38:58.857" end="01:39:01.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re such a hopeless romantic. I bet</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.757" end="01:39:02.457" style="s2">you&#39;ll be getting more abortions in the</p>
<p begin="01:39:01.957" end="01:39:04.957" style="s2">future.</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.457" end="01:39:08.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? Doctor, you misunderstand.</p>
<p begin="01:39:04.957" end="01:39:08.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once you finish signing, hand it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:39:10.457" end="01:39:13.556" style="s2">Go get the anesthesia first.</p>
<p begin="01:39:13.957" end="01:39:17.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:39:15.328" end="01:39:19.056" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:39:17.156" end="01:39:20.457" style="s2">Mr. Frost, the coffee you asked for is</p>
<p begin="01:39:19.056" end="01:39:23.156" style="s2">ready.</p>
<p begin="01:39:20.457" end="01:39:24.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just put it on the desk.</p>
<p begin="01:39:23.156" end="01:39:26.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Mr. Frost, these beans just</p>
<p begin="01:39:24.957" end="01:39:28.757" style="s2">arrived today. You can try how they</p>
<p begin="01:39:26.357" end="01:39:28.757" style="s2">taste.</p>
<p begin="01:39:30.056" end="01:39:32.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="01:39:32.757" end="01:39:36.357" style="s2">Go ahead and step out. I&#39;ll call you if</p>
<p begin="01:39:34.357" end="01:39:38.556" style="s2">I need anything.</p>
<p begin="01:39:36.357" end="01:39:38.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.357" end="01:39:51.357" style="s2">Doctor, I think I heard my phone ring.</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.556" end="01:39:51.357" style="s2">Let me take this call.</p>
<p begin="01:39:53.656" end="01:39:57.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ellie, where are you?</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.357" end="01:39:58.556" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you&#39;re in the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.156" end="01:39:59.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am in the hospital, actually. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:39:58.556" end="01:40:00.757" style="s2">up?</p>
<p begin="01:39:59.357" end="01:40:02.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you and your husband both out of</p>
<p begin="01:40:00.757" end="01:40:04.558" style="s2">your minds? You raced to the hospital</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.957" end="01:40:06.958" style="s2">for an abortion while your husband has</p>
<p begin="01:40:04.558" end="01:40:09.458" style="s2">driver send you folic acid? He actually</p>
<p begin="01:40:06.958" end="01:40:11.558" style="s2">wants to start a family with you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:09.458" end="01:40:13.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.558" end="01:40:14.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said your husband wants to have a baby</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.258" end="01:40:15.858" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.658" end="01:40:16.258" style="s2">Hey, are you still getting the surgery</p>
<p begin="01:40:15.858" end="01:40:18.558" style="s2">or not?</p>
<p begin="01:40:16.258" end="01:40:21.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, I&#39;m not doing it. I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:40:18.558" end="01:40:21.958" style="s2">My husband wants this baby.</p>
<p begin="01:40:25.158" end="01:40:29.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.379" end="01:40:29.399" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.158" end="01:40:32.858" style="s2">Something up?</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.858" end="01:40:35.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, there&#39;s something I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:40:32.858" end="01:40:36.258" style="s2">keeping from you. Miss Hart asked me not</p>
<p begin="01:40:35.058" end="01:40:37.458" style="s2">to say anything.</p>
<p begin="01:40:36.258" end="01:40:38.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean Ellie?</p>
<p begin="01:40:37.458" end="01:40:40.158" style="s2">What happened to her?</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.558" end="01:40:41.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time Miss Hart came to the company</p>
<p begin="01:40:40.158" end="01:40:44.058" style="s2">for a fitting, I learned about her</p>
<p begin="01:40:41.858" end="01:40:45.758" style="s2">relationship with you from a colleague.</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.058" end="01:40:46.458" style="s2">During lunch, I saw her reaching in the</p>
<p begin="01:40:45.758" end="01:40:47.758" style="s2">restroom.</p>
<p begin="01:40:46.458" end="01:40:50.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would she reach?</p>
<p begin="01:40:47.758" end="01:40:53.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:40:50.058" end="01:40:55.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? My wife is pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:40:53.158" end="01:40:59.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t tell you, Mr. Frost?</p>
<p begin="01:40:55.258" end="01:41:01.358" style="s2">Unless unless the child isn&#39;t yours.</p>
<p begin="01:40:59.158" end="01:41:02.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. Ellie Hart is not that kind</p>
<p begin="01:41:01.358" end="01:41:03.958" style="s2">of loose woman.</p>
<p begin="01:41:02.858" end="01:41:06.558" style="s2">I&#39;m calling her right now to get to the</p>
<p begin="01:41:03.958" end="01:41:06.558" style="s2">bottom of this.</p>
<p begin="01:41:07.758" end="01:41:11.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.058" end="01:41:13.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So dizzy.</p>
<p begin="01:41:11.358" end="01:41:15.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you get enough rest last night?</p>
<p begin="01:41:13.258" end="01:41:17.658" style="s2">Mr. Frost, maybe postpone the meeting</p>
<p begin="01:41:15.358" end="01:41:19.958" style="s2">and get some proper rest first.</p>
<p begin="01:41:17.658" end="01:41:19.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:41:21.858" end="01:41:25.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, aren&#39;t you dizzy? If you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:41:24.158" end="01:41:27.258" style="s2">dizzy, just rest.</p>
<p begin="01:41:25.958" end="01:41:29.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:41:27.258" end="01:41:31.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, you&#39;re already this week and</p>
<p begin="01:41:29.358" end="01:41:33.358" style="s2">you&#39;re still so fierce. How scary. I &#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:41:31.758" end="01:41:35.258" style="s2">tell you the truth. Ellie took the</p>
<p begin="01:41:33.358" end="01:41:36.258" style="s2">morning off to go get an abortion.</p>
<p begin="01:41:35.258" end="01:41:37.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:41:36.258" end="01:41:39.158" style="s2">An abortion?</p>
<p begin="01:41:37.258" end="01:41:42.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Because you don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="01:41:39.158" end="01:41:43.858" style="s2">kids, she went and terminated the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.058" end="01:41:44.758" style="s2">She really is trying so hard to please</p>
<p begin="01:41:43.858" end="01:41:46.158" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:41:44.758" end="01:41:47.758" style="s2">Too bad you&#39;ll probably never see her</p>
<p begin="01:41:46.158" end="01:41:49.358" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:41:47.758" end="01:41:50.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You drugged me?</p>
<p begin="01:41:49.358" end="01:41:52.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:41:50.458" end="01:41:54.658" style="s2">Between you and your brother, I actually</p>
<p begin="01:41:52.158" end="01:41:57.958" style="s2">preferred you. Too bad you were so blind</p>
<p begin="01:41:54.658" end="01:41:59.358" style="s2">and married that useless Ellie Hart.</p>
<p begin="01:41:57.958" end="01:42:00.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Marcus&#39;s woman?</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.358" end="01:42:02.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:42:00.458" end="01:42:04.958" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for Marcus, I&#39;d have died</p>
<p begin="01:42:02.358" end="01:42:06.058" style="s2">long ago. He&#39;s my savior.</p>
<p begin="01:42:04.958" end="01:42:08.359" style="s2">Even though he&#39;s been a failure in</p>
<p begin="01:42:06.058" end="01:42:10.359" style="s2">business, I have the ability. Once we</p>
<p begin="01:42:08.359" end="01:42:11.659" style="s2">take Frost Industries, I can support him</p>
<p begin="01:42:10.359" end="01:42:13.659" style="s2">going forward.</p>
<p begin="01:42:11.659" end="01:42:16.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frost Industries is mine. You want to</p>
<p begin="01:42:13.659" end="01:42:18.159" style="s2">take it in your dreams.</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.159" end="01:42:19.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as you die today, Frost</p>
<p begin="01:42:18.159" end="01:42:20.959" style="s2">Industries naturally goes to your older</p>
<p begin="01:42:19.759" end="01:42:23.259" style="s2">brother Marcus.</p>
<p begin="01:42:20.959" end="01:42:25.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if I die, there&#39;s still Ella.</p>
<p begin="01:42:23.259" end="01:42:27.459" style="s2">She&#39;s my legal wife, and we never signed</p>
<p begin="01:42:25.359" end="01:42:29.659" style="s2">a prenuptial agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:42:27.459" end="01:42:31.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I can kill you, I can kill Ellie Hart</p>
<p begin="01:42:29.659" end="01:42:33.159" style="s2">too. Landon,</p>
<p begin="01:42:31.459" end="01:42:37.159" style="s2">for the sake of you being Marcus&#39;s own</p>
<p begin="01:42:33.159" end="01:42:37.159" style="s2">brother, I&#39;ll make it quick for you.</p>
<p begin="01:42:44.059" end="01:42:47.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not poisoned.</p>
<p begin="01:42:45.559" end="01:42:48.459" style="s2">You didn&#39;t drink that coffee.</p>
<p begin="01:42:47.359" end="01:42:50.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:42:48.459" end="01:42:51.159" style="s2">The laziness just now was an act.</p>
<p begin="01:42:50.259" end="01:42:54.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="01:42:51.159" end="01:42:54.659" style="s2">When did you start suspecting me?</p>
<p begin="01:42:55.059" end="01:42:59.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll drive you back to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:42:57.459" end="01:42:59.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:43:07.059" end="01:43:11.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you looking at me?</p>
<p begin="01:43:09.359" end="01:43:14.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, I might have messed up.</p>
<p begin="01:43:11.759" end="01:43:15.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What mistake?</p>
<p begin="01:43:14.259" end="01:43:18.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoa</p>
<p begin="01:43:15.459" end="01:43:19.859" style="s2">might be your brother&#39;s woman.</p>
<p begin="01:43:18.259" end="01:43:20.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did Eric figure out my relationship</p>
<p begin="01:43:19.859" end="01:43:24.231" style="s2">with Marcus?</p>
<p begin="01:43:20.959" end="01:43:25.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your perfume gave you away.</p>
<p begin="01:43:24.231" end="01:43:27.359" style="s2">[snorts] 6 months ago, I had Eric</p>
<p begin="01:43:25.559" end="01:43:29.259" style="s2">investigate Marcus,</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.359" end="01:43:31.459" style="s2">and he found a uniquely scented car air</p>
<p begin="01:43:29.259" end="01:43:32.559" style="s2">freshener in Marcus&#39;s car.</p>
<p begin="01:43:31.459" end="01:43:34.359" style="s2">When you went to see Eric at the</p>
<p begin="01:43:32.559" end="01:43:36.859" style="s2">hospital a few days ago, you had that</p>
<p begin="01:43:34.359" end="01:43:38.659" style="s2">exact same scent on you.</p>
<p begin="01:43:36.859" end="01:43:40.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s what did it.</p>
<p begin="01:43:38.659" end="01:43:42.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eric wanted to finish his investigation</p>
<p begin="01:43:40.359" end="01:43:44.059" style="s2">and tell me quietly, but since you work</p>
<p begin="01:43:42.459" end="01:43:46.559" style="s2">right beside me, he worried you might</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.059" end="01:43:49.159" style="s2">strike at any moment, so he told me.</p>
<p begin="01:43:46.559" end="01:43:52.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that cup of coffee, you drank it then</p>
<p begin="01:43:49.159" end="01:43:52.559" style="s2">threw it up the moment I stepped out.</p>
<p begin="01:43:53.759" end="01:43:57.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. You&#39;re a woman, so I won&#39;t lay a</p>
<p begin="01:43:55.659" end="01:44:01.259" style="s2">hand on you, but your attempt to murder</p>
<p begin="01:43:57.459" end="01:44:01.259" style="s2">me, I&#39;ll see it through to the very end.</p>
<p begin="01:44:03.059" end="01:44:07.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Frost, you think we only had the one</p>
<p begin="01:44:05.359" end="01:44:07.859" style="s2">plan?</p>
<p begin="01:44:09.859" end="01:44:12.459" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t he</p>
<p begin="01:44:12.561" end="01:44:15.261" style="s2">Is he busy?</p>
<p begin="01:44:22.161" end="01:44:27.161" style="s2">Our plan was I kill you here and he</p>
<p begin="01:44:24.161" end="01:44:29.261" style="s2">kills Ellie at the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.161" end="01:44:33.361" style="s2">With both of you dead, Marcus would</p>
<p begin="01:44:29.261" end="01:44:33.361" style="s2">naturally inherit everything you own.</p>
<p begin="01:44:36.661" end="01:44:39.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello? Is my wife in your hands right</p>
<p begin="01:44:38.461" end="01:44:40.461" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="01:44:39.161" end="01:44:43.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still alive?</p>
<p begin="01:44:40.461" end="01:44:44.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did Zoe&#39;s plan fail?</p>
<p begin="01:44:43.061" end="01:44:46.461" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="01:44:44.161" end="01:44:46.861" style="s2">Let my wife go and I&#39;ll give Zoe back to</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.461" end="01:44:48.061" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.861" end="01:44:50.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dream on.</p>
<p begin="01:44:48.061" end="01:44:51.861" style="s2">Go ahead and kill Zoe if you can.</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.061" end="01:44:53.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t want Zoe?</p>
<p begin="01:44:51.861" end="01:44:55.461" style="s2">Then what do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:44:53.361" end="01:44:56.761" style="s2">Since we&#39;ve already burned our bridges,</p>
<p begin="01:44:55.461" end="01:44:58.461" style="s2">I&#39;ll be direct.</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.761" end="01:44:59.561" style="s2">Give me money and I&#39;ll never come back</p>
<p begin="01:44:58.461" end="01:45:01.461" style="s2">to the country again.</p>
<p begin="01:44:59.561" end="01:45:02.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much do you want? At least 500</p>
<p begin="01:45:01.461" end="01:45:04.561" style="s2">million, right?</p>
<p begin="01:45:02.961" end="01:45:06.661" style="s2">You sure have the nerve to ask for that.</p>
<p begin="01:45:04.561" end="01:45:08.361" style="s2">Won&#39;t pay? Then I&#39;ll drag your wife down</p>
<p begin="01:45:06.661" end="01:45:11.261" style="s2">with me. Either way, you&#39;ll never give</p>
<p begin="01:45:08.361" end="01:45:13.361" style="s2">me a way out. Marcus, calm down.</p>
<p begin="01:45:11.261" end="01:45:15.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want money? I&#39;ll give it to you.</p>
<p begin="01:45:13.361" end="01:45:17.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just let me have a word with Ellie.</p>
<p begin="01:45:15.161" end="01:45:17.461" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:45:18.857" end="01:45:21.461" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:45:19.512" end="01:45:22.861" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.461" end="01:45:24.361" style="s2">Landon wants to talk to you.</p>
<p begin="01:45:22.861" end="01:45:26.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, we&#39;re in the old Victory</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.361" end="01:45:28.161" style="s2">Warehouse. Don&#39;t give him the money.</p>
<p begin="01:45:26.261" end="01:45:30.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You [ __ ] You&#39;ve got a death wish.</p>
<p begin="01:45:28.161" end="01:45:31.761" style="s2">Believe me, I&#39;ll kill you. Marcus, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:45:30.161" end="01:45:33.761" style="s2">touch my wife. I&#39;ll give you the money.</p>
<p begin="01:45:31.761" end="01:45:35.661" style="s2">Send me your account number. Fine. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:45:33.761" end="01:45:37.661" style="s2">send you the account and you better have</p>
<p begin="01:45:35.661" end="01:45:39.461" style="s2">a helicopter ready. The address is where</p>
<p begin="01:45:37.661" end="01:45:41.061" style="s2">your wife said. Only when I see the</p>
<p begin="01:45:39.461" end="01:45:42.561" style="s2">money in the helicopter will I let her</p>
<p begin="01:45:41.061" end="01:45:43.861" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="01:45:42.561" end="01:45:45.861" style="s2">Didn&#39;t think my little brother was such</p>
<p begin="01:45:43.861" end="01:45:47.161" style="s2">a lovesick fool, willing to hand me 500</p>
<p begin="01:45:45.861" end="01:45:48.861" style="s2">million for you.</p>
<p begin="01:45:47.161" end="01:45:50.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marcus, your mother worked so hard to</p>
<p begin="01:45:48.861" end="01:45:52.561" style="s2">raise you, yet you tear the Frost family</p>
<p begin="01:45:50.661" end="01:45:54.361" style="s2">apart like this. Doesn&#39;t your conscience</p>
<p begin="01:45:52.561" end="01:45:56.661" style="s2">ache?</p>
<p begin="01:45:54.361" end="01:45:59.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did I tear the family apart?</p>
<p begin="01:45:56.661" end="01:46:01.261" style="s2">My father deserved to die.</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.161" end="01:46:03.361" style="s2">I made his death quick and painless. He</p>
<p begin="01:46:01.261" end="01:46:04.961" style="s2">should be the one thanking me.</p>
<p begin="01:46:03.361" end="01:46:06.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And your mother?</p>
<p begin="01:46:04.961" end="01:46:08.061" style="s2">Because of you, she nearly got strangled</p>
<p begin="01:46:06.961" end="01:46:09.761" style="s2">to death by your father.</p>
<p begin="01:46:08.061" end="01:46:11.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never meant to kill my mother because</p>
<p begin="01:46:09.761" end="01:46:13.062" style="s2">I knew my brother would save her. I knew</p>
<p begin="01:46:11.761" end="01:46:16.062" style="s2">she wouldn&#39;t die.</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.062" end="01:46:17.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re wrong. Just like Landon, never</p>
<p begin="01:46:16.062" end="01:46:20.162" style="s2">expected a single punch to kill your</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.863" end="01:46:21.863" style="s2">father. No one can predict whether your</p>
<p begin="01:46:20.162" end="01:46:22.762" style="s2">mother would really have been strangled</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.863" end="01:46:23.562" style="s2">to death.</p>
<p begin="01:46:22.762" end="01:46:25.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; up.</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.562" end="01:46:26.863" style="s2">are you to lecture me? I did all OF THIS</p>
<p begin="01:46:25.562" end="01:46:28.562" style="s2">FOR MY MOTHER.</p>
<p begin="01:46:26.863" end="01:46:29.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; are you talking about? Have you lost</p>
<p begin="01:46:28.562" end="01:46:30.962" style="s2">your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:46:29.462" end="01:46:32.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not crazy.</p>
<p begin="01:46:30.962" end="01:46:34.162" style="s2">I was raised with my mother&#39;s loving</p>
<p begin="01:46:32.562" end="01:46:35.863" style="s2">care while my brother was brought up by</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.162" end="01:46:38.062" style="s2">our grandfather. Even though my mother</p>
<p begin="01:46:35.863" end="01:46:39.962" style="s2">tried so hard to raise me and I studied</p>
<p begin="01:46:38.062" end="01:46:42.262" style="s2">so hard, I could never measure up to my</p>
<p begin="01:46:39.962" end="01:46:43.863" style="s2">brother. Relatives compared us. Said I</p>
<p begin="01:46:42.262" end="01:46:45.662" style="s2">wasn&#39;t as good as my brother. Said my</p>
<p begin="01:46:43.863" end="01:46:47.562" style="s2">mother couldn&#39;t raise kids well. My</p>
<p begin="01:46:45.662" end="01:46:49.062" style="s2">classmates mocked me, too. No matter how</p>
<p begin="01:46:47.562" end="01:46:50.863" style="s2">hard I tried growing up, I could never</p>
<p begin="01:46:49.062" end="01:46:51.863" style="s2">beat HIM. DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA HOW MUCH</p>
<p begin="01:46:50.863" end="01:46:52.962" style="s2">PAIN I&#39;M IN?</p>
<p begin="01:46:51.863" end="01:46:54.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; JUST BECAUSE you can&#39;t beat your</p>
<p begin="01:46:52.962" end="01:46:56.662" style="s2">brother, you want to destroy him? He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:46:54.662" end="01:46:57.363" style="s2">your own flesh and blood, not your</p>
<p begin="01:46:56.662" end="01:46:59.863" style="s2">enemy.</p>
<p begin="01:46:57.363" end="01:47:01.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is my enemy. I have to surpass him.</p>
<p begin="01:46:59.863" end="01:47:03.162" style="s2">I&#39;ll make everyone know I&#39;m better. I</p>
<p begin="01:47:01.662" end="01:47:04.762" style="s2">was raised by my mother and her way of</p>
<p begin="01:47:03.162" end="01:47:06.062" style="s2">raising me was perfectly fine.</p>
<p begin="01:47:04.762" end="01:47:08.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother just wants you to stay by</p>
<p begin="01:47:06.062" end="01:47:09.762" style="s2">her side safe and sound. Even if you</p>
<p begin="01:47:08.062" end="01:47:11.962" style="s2">never amount to anything, she won&#39;t look</p>
<p begin="01:47:09.762" end="01:47:12.762" style="s2">down on you. She told me that herself.</p>
<p begin="01:47:11.962" end="01:47:14.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:47:12.762" end="01:47:16.462" style="s2">I refuse to live a wasted life.</p>
<p begin="01:47:14.762" end="01:47:18.162" style="s2">Once I get my 500 million, I&#39;m going</p>
<p begin="01:47:16.462" end="01:47:20.962" style="s2">abroad to build my own business. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:47:18.162" end="01:47:22.062" style="s2">carve out a sky that&#39;s all mine.</p>
<p begin="01:47:20.962" end="01:47:23.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Son,</p>
<p begin="01:47:22.062" end="01:47:24.962" style="s2">stop this now.</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.962" end="01:47:25.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:47:24.962" end="01:47:28.062" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.962" end="01:47:29.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make another mistake. Your brother</p>
<p begin="01:47:28.062" end="01:47:32.162" style="s2">owes you nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:47:29.662" end="01:47:34.363" style="s2">If anyone owes you, it&#39;s your mother. I</p>
<p begin="01:47:32.162" end="01:47:35.562" style="s2">gave you a life without a care,</p>
<p begin="01:47:34.363" end="01:47:36.162" style="s2">but I never gave you a sense of</p>
<p begin="01:47:35.562" end="01:47:38.562" style="s2">security.</p>
<p begin="01:47:36.162" end="01:47:40.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I won&#39;t hurt Ellie. As long as</p>
<p begin="01:47:38.562" end="01:47:42.062" style="s2">Landon gives me the 500 million, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.462" end="01:47:44.062" style="s2">leave the country. Once I build my</p>
<p begin="01:47:42.062" end="01:47:46.062" style="s2">business abroad, I&#39;ll come back for you.</p>
<p begin="01:47:44.062" end="01:47:47.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wake up. Success is never measured by</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.062" end="01:47:49.662" style="s2">how much money you make. Even if you</p>
<p begin="01:47:47.562" end="01:47:52.863" style="s2">earn a fortune abroad, will it erase all</p>
<p begin="01:47:49.662" end="01:47:52.863" style="s2">the dirty things you&#39;ve done here?</p>
<p begin="01:47:54.363" end="01:47:57.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what do you mean? You don&#39;t want me</p>
<p begin="01:47:55.662" end="01:48:00.562" style="s2">to go abroad and start a business?</p>
<p begin="01:47:57.562" end="01:48:00.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re out of chances.</p>
<p begin="01:48:02.962" end="01:48:05.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="01:48:04.462" end="01:48:07.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re now suspected of kidnapping and</p>
<p begin="01:48:05.762" end="01:48:09.162" style="s2">extortion. I&#39;ve already called the</p>
<p begin="01:48:07.262" end="01:48:11.062" style="s2">police. Brother, you once schemed so</p>
<p begin="01:48:09.162" end="01:48:12.962" style="s2">hard to send me to prison. Now it&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="01:48:11.062" end="01:48:14.562" style="s2">turn. Except you probably won&#39;t be as</p>
<p begin="01:48:12.962" end="01:48:15.063" style="s2">lucky as me to get out so fast.</p>
<p begin="01:48:14.562" end="01:48:15.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEN JUST KILL</p>
<p begin="01:48:15.063" end="01:48:17.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ME RIGHT NOW.</p>
<p begin="01:48:15.964" end="01:48:19.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Murder is against the law. You committed</p>
<p begin="01:48:17.563" end="01:48:21.464" style="s2">a crime. The law will handle you. Oh,</p>
<p begin="01:48:19.263" end="01:48:22.563" style="s2">and by the way, Zoe is pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:48:21.464" end="01:48:23.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="01:48:22.563" end="01:48:25.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But when you chose to abandon her, she</p>
<p begin="01:48:23.964" end="01:48:26.263" style="s2">went to the hospital and had an</p>
<p begin="01:48:25.063" end="01:48:28.663" style="s2">abortion.</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.263" end="01:48:32.464" style="s2">baby&#39;s probably already gone by now.</p>
<p begin="01:48:28.663" end="01:48:34.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; lying. You have to be lying.</p>
<p begin="01:48:32.464" end="01:48:36.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; go to prison and reform yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:48:34.263" end="01:48:39.364" style="s2">I&#39;ll take good care of Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:48:36.964" end="01:48:40.464" style="s2">Take him away.</p>
<p begin="01:48:39.364" end="01:48:41.663" style="s2">Ellie,</p>
<p begin="01:48:40.464" end="01:48:43.063" style="s2">are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.663" end="01:48:45.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="01:48:43.063" end="01:48:46.663" style="s2">Ellie, I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.063" end="01:48:48.864" style="s2">It&#39;s my fault for failing to raise my</p>
<p begin="01:48:46.663" end="01:48:50.364" style="s2">eldest son right. I dragged you into</p>
<p begin="01:48:48.864" end="01:48:51.263" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:48:50.364" end="01:48:52.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:48:51.263" end="01:48:53.964" style="s2">none of what brother did has anything to</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.763" end="01:48:55.364" style="s2">do with you.</p>
<p begin="01:48:53.964" end="01:48:59.563" style="s2">Don&#39;t blame yourself for other people&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.364" end="01:48:59.563" style="s2">mistakes. Everyone is their own person.</p>
<p begin="01:49:00.364" end="01:49:03.964" style="s2">I heard you&#39;re pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:49:02.063" end="01:49:05.163" style="s2">The baby The baby&#39;s right here in my</p>
<p begin="01:49:03.964" end="01:49:06.964" style="s2">belly.</p>
<p begin="01:49:05.163" end="01:49:08.663" style="s2">I thought Landon didn&#39;t want kids, so I</p>
<p begin="01:49:06.964" end="01:49:10.964" style="s2">was going to terminate the pregnancy.</p>
<p begin="01:49:08.663" end="01:49:13.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You silly girl. You just said every</p>
<p begin="01:49:10.964" end="01:49:15.163" style="s2">person is their own being.</p>
<p begin="01:49:13.063" end="01:49:17.964" style="s2">The baby is growing inside you, whether</p>
<p begin="01:49:15.163" end="01:49:19.864" style="s2">Landon wants it or not. If you want it,</p>
<p begin="01:49:17.964" end="01:49:21.763" style="s2">you can have it.</p>
<p begin="01:49:19.864" end="01:49:23.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all my fault. I didn&#39;t even notice</p>
<p begin="01:49:21.763" end="01:49:24.163" style="s2">Ellie was pregnant and it made her</p>
<p begin="01:49:23.063" end="01:49:26.263" style="s2">suffer.</p>
<p begin="01:49:24.163" end="01:49:28.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you changed your mind for me.</p>
<p begin="01:49:26.263" end="01:49:30.663" style="s2">Honey, thank you for loving me.</p>
<p begin="01:49:28.864" end="01:49:31.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, your brother came to see me</p>
<p begin="01:49:30.663" end="01:49:32.763" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:49:31.663" end="01:49:34.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did he want with you?</p>
<p begin="01:49:32.763" end="01:49:36.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He had a medical evaluation report</p>
<p begin="01:49:34.364" end="01:49:37.864" style="s2">issued by a psychiatric hospital</p>
<p begin="01:49:36.263" end="01:49:40.364" style="s2">claiming you&#39;re mentally ill.</p>
<p begin="01:49:37.864" end="01:49:41.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That bastard. He&#39;s the one who&#39;s crazy.</p>
<p begin="01:49:40.364" end="01:49:43.063" style="s2">In our family, he&#39;s the most insane of</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.864" end="01:49:45.063" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="01:49:43.063" end="01:49:46.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said it was your family&#39;s secret. And</p>
<p begin="01:49:45.063" end="01:49:47.464" style="s2">since you were so set against having</p>
<p begin="01:49:46.464" end="01:49:48.864" style="s2">kids,</p>
<p begin="01:49:47.464" end="01:49:49.864" style="s2">I figured it was because of your illness</p>
<p begin="01:49:48.864" end="01:49:51.964" style="s2">that you didn&#39;t want them.</p>
<p begin="01:49:49.864" end="01:49:53.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I were mentally ill, I&#39;d tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:49:51.964" end="01:49:54.763" style="s2">Why would I marry you if I had some</p>
<p begin="01:49:53.163" end="01:49:55.464" style="s2">illness? Wouldn&#39;t that just be ruining</p>
<p begin="01:49:54.763" end="01:49:58.364" style="s2">your life?</p>
<p begin="01:49:55.464" end="01:49:59.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a relief. You&#39;re not sick.</p>
<p begin="01:49:58.364" end="01:50:01.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re such a fool.</p>
<p begin="01:49:59.964" end="01:50:03.763" style="s2">Even after thinking I was mentally ill,</p>
<p begin="01:50:01.964" end="01:50:05.063" style="s2">you never thought about divorcing me.</p>
<p begin="01:50:03.763" end="01:50:07.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as you don&#39;t give up on our</p>
<p begin="01:50:05.063" end="01:50:09.063" style="s2">love,</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.063" end="01:50:11.563" style="s2">I&#39;ll never divorce you.</p>
<p begin="01:50:09.063" end="01:50:15.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The word give up isn&#39;t in my dictionary.</p>
<p begin="01:50:11.563" end="01:50:15.063" style="s2">I&#39;m stuck being my wife for life.</p>
<p begin="01:50:16.063" end="01:50:20.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, aren&#39;t you meeting your important</p>
<p begin="01:50:17.964" end="01:50:22.465" style="s2">client today? I&#39;ll have Daisy come with</p>
<p begin="01:50:20.165" end="01:50:23.765" style="s2">me to my checkup. Focus on work and</p>
<p begin="01:50:22.465" end="01:50:24.865" style="s2">don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:50:23.765" end="01:50:26.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see you through the checkup and</p>
<p begin="01:50:24.865" end="01:50:28.865" style="s2">then go meet the client.</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.865" end="01:50:31.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the baby&#39;s not due yet.</p>
<p begin="01:50:28.865" end="01:50:32.465" style="s2">Put work first. I&#39;ll be fine.</p>
<p begin="01:50:31.465" end="01:50:34.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:50:32.465" end="01:50:36.065" style="s2">Call me anytime if anything comes up.</p>
<p begin="01:50:34.565" end="01:50:38.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Nothing will happen. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:50:36.065" end="01:50:38.565" style="s2">heading out.</p>
<p begin="01:50:43.465" end="01:50:47.265" style="s2">Ellie, can you really eat spicy hot pot</p>
<p begin="01:50:45.465" end="01:50:49.365" style="s2">right now? Don&#39;t worry. I asked the</p>
<p begin="01:50:47.265" end="01:50:51.765" style="s2">doctor. He said a little is fine.</p>
<p begin="01:50:49.365" end="01:50:54.465" style="s2">If you can eat it, why sneak out here?</p>
<p begin="01:50:51.765" end="01:50:56.165" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you dare tell Landon?</p>
<p begin="01:50:54.465" end="01:50:58.165" style="s2">Daisy, you just don&#39;t understand a</p>
<p begin="01:50:56.165" end="01:50:59.465" style="s2">pregnant woman&#39;s cravings. You&#39;ll get it</p>
<p begin="01:50:58.165" end="01:51:01.465" style="s2">once you&#39;re pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:50:59.465" end="01:51:02.665" style="s2">Fine, but eat only a little. If Landon</p>
<p begin="01:51:01.465" end="01:51:05.465" style="s2">finds out I brought you here for spicy</p>
<p begin="01:51:02.665" end="01:51:07.165" style="s2">hot pot, he&#39;ll blame me. Relax. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:51:05.465" end="01:51:09.765" style="s2">meeting an important client today. He</p>
<p begin="01:51:07.165" end="01:51:11.265" style="s2">won&#39;t be home before 10 at night.</p>
<p begin="01:51:09.765" end="01:51:13.265" style="s2">Ellie,</p>
<p begin="01:51:11.265" end="01:51:15.665" style="s2">eat slowly. Nobody&#39;s going to steal it</p>
<p begin="01:51:13.265" end="01:51:18.265" style="s2">from you.</p>
<p begin="01:51:15.665" end="01:51:20.465" style="s2">This spicy hot pot is amazing. Then I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:51:18.265" end="01:51:23.065" style="s2">top it off with an ice cream. Pure</p>
<p begin="01:51:20.465" end="01:51:23.065" style="s2">bliss.</p>
<p begin="01:51:25.065" end="01:51:28.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, aren&#39;t you supposed to be at your</p>
<p begin="01:51:26.665" end="01:51:30.565" style="s2">checkup?</p>
<p begin="01:51:28.165" end="01:51:32.365" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:51:30.565" end="01:51:34.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that my husband?</p>
<p begin="01:51:32.365" end="01:51:36.465" style="s2">Am I seeing things? Daisy, pinch me.</p>
<p begin="01:51:34.765" end="01:51:38.465" style="s2">Landon, we just sat down and had two</p>
<p begin="01:51:36.465" end="01:51:40.765" style="s2">bites. Just two bites. It shouldn&#39;t hurt</p>
<p begin="01:51:38.465" end="01:51:43.565" style="s2">your baby&#39;s health. Please don&#39;t be mad.</p>
<p begin="01:51:40.765" end="01:51:43.565" style="s2">I &#39;m out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:51:45.965" end="01:51:48.665" style="s2">Honey, who are they?</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.465" end="01:51:49.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Important clients.</p>
<p begin="01:51:48.665" end="01:51:52.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would you bring important clients</p>
<p begin="01:51:49.965" end="01:51:53.165" style="s2">here? That&#39;s so inappropriate.</p>
<p begin="01:51:52.265" end="01:51:54.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey,</p>
<p begin="01:51:53.165" end="01:51:56.065" style="s2">did you forget I can see your live</p>
<p begin="01:51:54.165" end="01:51:57.565" style="s2">location?</p>
<p begin="01:51:56.065" end="01:51:58.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I forgot.</p>
<p begin="01:51:57.565" end="01:52:00.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I picked up the clients and was heading</p>
<p begin="01:51:58.765" end="01:52:02.265" style="s2">back to the office when my phone showed</p>
<p begin="01:52:00.665" end="01:52:03.565" style="s2">you at the hot pot place. I thought</p>
<p begin="01:52:02.265" end="01:52:05.665" style="s2">something was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:52:03.565" end="01:52:07.765" style="s2">So I rushed over with them right away.</p>
<p begin="01:52:05.665" end="01:52:09.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, I really really wanted to eat it,</p>
<p begin="01:52:07.765" end="01:52:10.865" style="s2">but I only had two bites. I &#39;ll stop</p>
<p begin="01:52:09.365" end="01:52:12.365" style="s2">now, take the clients back to the</p>
<p begin="01:52:10.865" end="01:52:14.165" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="01:52:12.365" end="01:52:16.165" style="s2">I &#39;ll go to my checkup myself.</p>
<p begin="01:52:14.165" end="01:52:17.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Business can be done anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:52:16.165" end="01:52:19.665" style="s2">If you want hot fudge, I&#39;ll eat it with</p>
<p begin="01:52:17.665" end="01:52:20.766" style="s2">you. No more sneaking around, but don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:52:19.665" end="01:52:21.666" style="s2">eat too much.</p>
<p begin="01:52:20.766" end="01:52:23.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh,</p>
<p begin="01:52:21.666" end="01:52:25.466" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe he&#39;s not mad at all.</p>
<p begin="01:52:23.466" end="01:52:27.166" style="s2">He&#39;s even eating with me. My husband</p>
<p begin="01:52:25.466" end="01:52:29.666" style="s2">really loves me.</p>
<p begin="01:52:27.166" end="01:52:31.466" style="s2">Honey, can I have one ice cream later?</p>
<p begin="01:52:29.666" end="01:52:33.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, in a bit we can buy one.</p>
<p begin="01:52:31.466" end="01:52:34.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, I knew you spoil me the most.</p>
<p begin="01:52:33.366" end="01:52:36.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll buy one</p>
<p begin="01:52:34.766" end="01:52:38.366" style="s2">and you watch me eat it.</p>
<p begin="01:52:36.166" end="01:52:38.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:52:39.566" end="01:52:42.666" style="s2">Bush Mrs. Frost.</p>
<p begin="01:52:42.952" end="01:52:46.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:52:44.466" end="01:52:47.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;d known childbirth hurt this much,</p>
<p begin="01:52:46.566" end="01:52:48.866" style="s2">I never should have made Ellie go</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.466" end="01:52:51.166" style="s2">through it.</p>
<p begin="01:52:48.866" end="01:52:52.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Son, be strong. It&#39;ll all be fine once</p>
<p begin="01:52:51.166" end="01:52:55.166" style="s2">the baby&#39;s out.</p>
<p begin="01:52:52.366" end="01:52:56.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s taking so long. Isn&#39;t it out yet?</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.166" end="01:52:57.966" style="s2">Should I go in and check?</p>
<p begin="01:52:56.266" end="01:52:59.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:52:57.966" end="01:53:00.666" style="s2">If you go in there crying, you&#39;ll scare</p>
<p begin="01:52:59.366" end="01:53:02.366" style="s2">the baby so much it won&#39;t want to come</p>
<p begin="01:53:00.666" end="01:53:04.466" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:53:02.366" end="01:53:06.366" style="s2">Mr. Frost, congratulations. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:53:04.466" end="01:53:09.566" style="s2">healthy baby girl. Mother and daughter</p>
<p begin="01:53:06.366" end="01:53:10.766" style="s2">are both safe. You can go in now.</p>
<p begin="01:53:09.566" end="01:53:12.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey,</p>
<p begin="01:53:10.766" end="01:53:15.566" style="s2">did it hurt so much?</p>
<p begin="01:53:12.566" end="01:53:15.566" style="s2">We&#39;re never having another one.</p>
<p begin="01:53:16.066" end="01:53:19.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, look at our daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:53:20.766" end="01:53:24.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This little thing, pretty cute. No</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.966" end="01:53:24.966" style="s2">surprise coming from you.</p>
<p begin="01:53:24.873" end="01:53:26.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:53:24.966" end="01:53:29.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t it nice having a child after all?</p>
<p begin="01:53:26.966" end="01:53:30.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm, look at whose kid it is.</p>
<p begin="01:53:29.566" end="01:53:32.466" style="s2">She&#39;ll grow up just as smart and</p>
<p begin="01:53:30.966" end="01:53:34.166" style="s2">beautiful as you.</p>
<p begin="01:53:32.466" end="01:53:36.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, don&#39;t worry. We&#39;ll definitely</p>
<p begin="01:53:34.166" end="01:53:37.766" style="s2">raise her to be an honest, kind person.</p>
<p begin="01:53:36.866" end="01:53:38.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="01:53:37.766" end="01:53:40.066" style="s2">Honey,</p>
<p begin="01:53:38.666" end="01:53:40.966" style="s2">I have a gift for you.</p>
<p begin="01:53:40.066" end="01:53:43.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:53:40.966" end="01:53:43.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open it and see.</p>
<p begin="01:53:43.868" end="01:53:45.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:53:44.566" end="01:53:46.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the fashion company I used to</p>
<p begin="01:53:45.966" end="01:53:48.666" style="s2">work for.</p>
<p begin="01:53:46.766" end="01:53:50.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. I bought that company and now</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.666" end="01:53:52.566" style="s2">it&#39;s yours. Didn&#39;t you want to open your</p>
<p begin="01:53:50.466" end="01:53:54.066" style="s2">own studio? Use this ready-made one so</p>
<p begin="01:53:52.566" end="01:53:55.366" style="s2">you won&#39;t tire yourself out.</p>
<p begin="01:53:54.066" end="01:53:56.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t even discuss it with me. How</p>
<p begin="01:53:55.366" end="01:53:58.666" style="s2">much did it cost?</p>
<p begin="01:53:56.866" end="01:53:59.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money doesn&#39;t matter. Your happiness</p>
<p begin="01:53:58.666" end="01:54:01.166" style="s2">does.</p>
<p begin="01:53:59.666" end="01:54:02.666" style="s2">Honey, are you happy now?</p>
<p begin="01:54:01.166" end="01:54:04.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as I&#39;m with you, I&#39;m happy no</p>
<p begin="01:54:02.666" end="01:54:07.166" style="s2">matter what I do.</p>
<p begin="01:54:04.066" end="01:54:07.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, me too.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
